export const halmaGameTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Halma":"ሃልማ","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"ሃልማ ኦንላይን - ነፃ 16×16 የቦርድ ጨዋታ ከዝላይ ሰንሰለቶች ጋር","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"የሚታወቀው ባለ ሁለት ተጫዋች ሀልማን በመስመር ላይ በነጻ ይጫወቱ። የ 19 ቁርጥራጮችን በ 16 ×16 ሰሌዳ ላይ በስምንት አቅጣጫ ደረጃዎች እና በሰንሰለት መዝለሎች ያንቀሳቅሱ; አካባቢያዊ ኮምፒተርን ይጫወቱ ወይም ይለፉ እና ይጫወቱ።","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"ሁሉንም 19 ቁርጥራጮችዎን ወደ ተቃራኒው የማዕዘን ካምፕ ያሽጉ። አንድ ካሬ ደረጃ ያድርጉ ወይም በማንኛውም ቁራጭ ላይ ይዝለሉ ፣ ከዚያ በተመሳሳይ መዞር ላይ ብዙ ሆፕዎችን ሰንሰለት ያድርጉ። የተዘለሉ ቁርጥራጮች በቦርዱ ላይ ይቆያሉ.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"ለመጫወት ነፃ። ቦርዱ እና የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይቆያሉ; ምንም የጨዋታ ውሂብ አይሰቀልም።","Play Halma":"ሃልማን አጫውት።","How a jump chain works":"የዝላይ ሰንሰለት እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"አንድ ቁራጭ ከጎን ባለው የተያዘ ካሬ ላይ በቀጥታ ከሱ ወዲያ ወደ ባዶ ካሬ መዝለል ይችላል። ካረፈ በኋላ እንደገና ወደ ሌላ አቅጣጫ መዝለል ይችላል። የዘለለባቸው ቁርጥራጮች በጭራሽ አይያዙም።","How to play":"እንዴት መጫወት እንደሚቻል","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"ይህ ገጽ መደበኛ ባለ ሁለት-ተጫዋች ስኩዌር-ቦርድ ልዩነትን ይጠቀማል-16×16 ፍርግርግ እና 19 ቁርጥራጮች በእያንዳንዱ ሁለት ተቃራኒ ጥግ ካምፖች። በማዞር አንድ ቁራጭ ወደ ከስምንት አቅጣጫዎች ወደ ጎረቤት ባዶ ካሬ ይውሰዱ ወይም አንድ ወይም ከዚያ በላይ ተከታታይ ሆፕ በተመሳሳይ ቁራጭ ያድርጉ። በማንኛውም ማረፊያ ላይ የሆፕ ሰንሰለት ማቆም ይችላሉ. አንድ ደረጃ እና ሆፕ በአንድ ዙር ሊጣመሩ አይችሉም። ለማሸነፍ በተቃራኒ ካምፕ ውስጥ ያለውን እያንዳንዱን ካሬ ይሙሉ።","Frequently asked questions":"በተደጋጋሚ የሚጠየቁ ጥያቄዎች","Do jumps capture pieces?":"ዝላይ ቁርጥራጮች ይይዛሉ?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"ቁ. ዝላይ ቁራጭዎን በአጠገብ ቁራጭ ላይ ብቻ ያንቀሳቅሰዋል። የዘለለ ቁራጭ ያንተ ይሁን የሌላው ተጫዋች ባለበት ይቆያል።","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"በየተራ ከአንድ በላይ መዝለል እችላለሁ?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"አዎ። በሌላ አጎራባች ቁራጭ ላይ በተመሳሳይ ቁራጭ ወደ ባዶ ካሬ ይቀጥሉ። ከማንኛውም ማረፊያ በኋላ ሰንሰለቱን ማቆም ይችላሉ.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"መርገጥ እና ከዚያም በአንድ ዙር መዝለል እችላለሁ?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"ቁ. መዞር አንድ የተጠጋ ደረጃ ወይም አንድ ዝላይ ሰንሰለት ነው። ሊጣመሩ አይችሉም.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"አንድ ቁራጭ ከገባ በኋላ ተቃራኒውን ካምፕ መውጣት ይችላል?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"ቁ. ይህ እትም አንድ ቁራጭ ከገባ በኋላ በተቃዋሚው መድረሻ ካምፕ ውስጥ ያስቀምጣል።","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"ሃልማ የኮምፒውተር ተቃዋሚ አለው?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"አዎ። የአካባቢውን ኮምፒውተር ይምረጡ ወይም ተመሳሳይ መሳሪያ በሁለት ሰዎች መካከል ያስተላልፉ። ኮምፒዩተሩ በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ቀላል ህጋዊ እንቅስቃሴ ያደርጋል; የመስመር ላይ ብዙ ተጫዋች አይደለም.","Rules and limitations":"ህጎች እና ገደቦች","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"የኮምፒዩተር ተቃዋሚው ቀላል ክብደት ያለው የአካባቢያዊ ግስጋሴ ሂዩሪስቲክ ነው እንጂ ጥልቅ ፍለጋ ወይም ፍፁም ጨዋታን አይጠቀምም። ይህ ባለ ሁለት-ተጫዋች 16 ×16 ካሬ-ቦርድ ጨዋታ እንጂ የኮከብ ቅርጽ ያለው የቻይና ቼኮች አይደለም. ሶስት ተደጋጋሚ ቦታዎች ወይም የ 400-ዙር የደህንነት ካፕ በዚህ ስሪት ውስጥ እንደ ስዕል ይያዛሉ.","Related tools":"ተዛማጅ መሳሪያዎች","Game mode":"የጨዋታ ሁነታ","Play against the computer":"ከኮምፒውተሩ ጋር ይጫወቱ","Two players on this device":"ሁለት ተጫዋቾች በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ","First turn":"የመጀመሪያ ተራ","Player 1 starts":"ተጫዋች 1 ይጀምራል","Computer starts":"ኮምፒውተር ይጀምራል","Player 2 starts":"ተጫዋች 2 ይጀምራል","New game":"አዲስ ጨዋታ","Resume saved game":"የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ ከቆመበት ቀጥል","Delete saved game":"የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ ሰርዝ","Choose a mode and start a game.":"ሁነታ ይምረጡ እና ጨዋታ ይጀምሩ።","Halma 16 by 16 board":"ሃልማ 16 በ 16 ቦርድ","Row {row}, column {column}":"ረድፍ {row}፣ አምድ {column}","Player 1":"ተጫዋች 1","Player 2":"ተጫዋች 2","Computer":"ኮምፒውተር","empty":"ባዶ","Turn":"አዙር","Pieces in opposite camp":"በተቃራኒ ካምፕ ውስጥ ያሉ ቁርጥራጮች","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"ግብ፡ ተቃራኒውን የማዕዘን ካምፕ ሙላ","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"የእርስዎ ተራ፡ ከቁራጭዎ ውስጥ አንዱን፣ከዚያ ቀጥሎ ያለውን ባዶ ካሬ ወይም ዝላይ ይምረጡ።","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"ቁራጭ ተመርጧል። የሚገኝ ካሬ ይምረጡ።","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"ሌላ ሆፕ አለ። መዝለልዎን ይቀጥሉ ወይም መዞሩን ያጠናቅቁ።","End jump chain":"የዝላይ ሰንሰለት መጨረሻ","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"ኮምፒዩተሩ ህጋዊ እርምጃን እየመረጠ ነው…","Pass the device to the next player.":"መሣሪያውን ወደሚቀጥለው ተጫዋች ያስተላልፉ።","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"ተቃራኒውን ካምፕ ሞልተህ አሸንፈሃል!","Player 1 wins!":"ተጫዋች 1 አሸነፈ!","Player 2 wins!":"ተጫዋች 2 አሸነፈ!","The computer wins.":"ኮምፒዩተሩ ያሸንፋል።","The game is a draw.":"ጨዋታው አቻ ነው።","New game started.":"አዲስ ጨዋታ ተጀመረ።","Game saved on this device.":"ጨዋታ በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ ተቀምጧል።","Saved game resumed.":"የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ ከቆመበት ቀጥሏል።","Saved game deleted.":"የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ ተሰርዟል።","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"ይህ አሳሽ በአገር ውስጥ ማስቀመጥ አይችልም። ይህ ገጽ ክፍት ሆኖ ሳለ መጫወቱን መቀጠል ይችላሉ።","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"የተቀመጠው ጨዋታ ሊነበብ አልቻለም። አዲስ ጨዋታ ይጀምሩ ወይም የተበላሸውን ቆጣቢ ይሰርዙ።","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"ይህ እርምጃ ህጋዊ አይደለም። ባዶ ካሬ ይምረጡ እና የደመቀውን የዝላይ ሰንሰለት ይከተሉ።","Rules reference":"የሕጎች ማጣቀሻ","Standard two-player Halma rules":"መደበኛ ባለሁለት ተጫዋች ሃልማ ህጎች"},"ar":{"Halma":"هالما","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — لعبة لوحية مجانية 16×16 مع سلاسل القفز","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"العب لعبة Halma الكلاسيكية للاعبين عبر الإنترنت مجانًا. انقل قطع 19 عبر لوحة 16×16 بخطوات ذات ثمانية اتجاهات وقفزات متسلسلة؛ تشغيل جهاز كمبيوتر محلي أو التمرير واللعب.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"تسابق بكل قطعك 19 إلى معسكر الزاوية المقابل. قم بخطوة مربعة واحدة أو قفز فوق أي قطعة، ثم قم بتسلسل المزيد من القفزات في نفس المنعطف. تبقى القطع المقفزة على السبورة.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"لعب مجاني. تبقى اللوحة واللعبة المحفوظة في هذا المتصفح على هذا الجهاز؛ لم يتم تحميل أي بيانات اللعبة.","Play Halma":"تشغيل هالما","How a jump chain works":"كيفية عمل سلسلة القفز","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"يمكن للقطعة أن تقفز فوق مربع مشغول مجاور إلى المربع الفارغ الذي يقع خلفها مباشرة. وبعد الهبوط، قد يقفز مرة أخرى في اتجاه آخر. لا يتم التقاط القطع التي قفزت فوقها أبدًا.","How to play":"كيفية اللعب","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"تستخدم هذه الصفحة متغير اللوحة المربعة القياسي للاعبين: شبكة 16×16 وقطع 19 في كل من معسكري الزاوية المتقابلين. في كل دور، حرك قطعة واحدة إلى مربع فارغ مجاور في أي من الاتجاهات الثمانية، أو قم بقفزة واحدة أو أكثر متتالية بنفس القطعة. يمكنك إيقاف سلسلة القفزات عند أي هبوط. لا يمكن الجمع بين الخطوة والقفز في دورة واحدة. املأ كل مربع في المعسكر المقابل للفوز.","Frequently asked questions":"الأسئلة المتداولة","Do jumps capture pieces?":"هل القفزات تلتقط القطع؟","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"رقم. تؤدي القفزة إلى تحريك قطعتك فوق قطعة مجاورة فقط. القطعة التي تم القفز فوقها تبقى في مكانها، سواء كانت ملكًا لك أو للاعب الآخر.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"هل يمكنني القيام بأكثر من قفزة واحدة في كل دورة؟","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"نعم. استمر بنفس القطعة فوق قطعة أخرى مجاورة في مربع فارغ. يمكنك إنهاء السلسلة بعد أي هبوط.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"هل يمكنني أن أخطو ثم أقفز في دورة واحدة؟","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"رقم. يكون المنعطف إما خطوة واحدة مجاورة أو سلسلة قفز واحدة. لا يمكن الجمع بينهما.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"هل يمكن للقطعة أن تخرج من المعسكر المقابل بعد دخولها؟","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"رقم. يحتفظ هذا الإصدار بقطعة داخل معسكر وجهة الخصم بمجرد دخولها.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"هل لدى Halma خصم كمبيوتر؟","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"نعم. اختر الكمبيوتر المحلي أو قم بتمرير نفس الجهاز بين شخصين. يقوم الكمبيوتر بحركة قانونية بسيطة على هذا الجهاز؛ إنها ليست متعددة اللاعبين عبر الإنترنت.","Rules and limitations":"القواعد والقيود","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"يستخدم خصم الكمبيوتر إرشادًا للتقدم المحلي خفيف الوزن، وليس البحث العميق أو اللعب المثالي. هذه هي لعبة 16×16 ذات اللوحة المربعة للاعبين، وليست لعبة الداما الصينية على شكل نجمة. يتم التعامل مع ثلاثة مواضع متكررة أو غطاء أمان 400 على أنه قرعة في هذا الإصدار.","Related tools":"أدوات ذات صلة","Game mode":"وضع اللعبة","Play against the computer":"اللعب ضد الكمبيوتر","Two players on this device":"هناك لاعبان على هذا الجهاز","First turn":"المنعطف الأول","Player 1 starts":"يبدأ تشغيل المشغل 1","Computer starts":"يبدأ تشغيل الكمبيوتر","Player 2 starts":"يبدأ تشغيل المشغل 2","New game":"لعبة جديدة","Resume saved game":"استئناف اللعبة المحفوظة","Delete saved game":"حذف اللعبة المحفوظة","Choose a mode and start a game.":"اختر الوضع وابدأ اللعبة.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"هالما 16 بواسطة لوحة 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"الصف {row}، العمود {column}","Player 1":"اللاعب 1","Player 2":"اللاعب 2","Computer":"حاسوب","empty":"فارغ","Turn":"دوران","Pieces in opposite camp":"القطع في المعسكر المقابل","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"الهدف: املأ معسكر الزاوية المقابل","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"دورك: اختر إحدى القطع الخاصة بك، ثم مربعًا فارغًا مجاورًا أو قفزة.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"القطعة المحددة. اختر المربع المتاح.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"تتوفر خطوة أخرى. استمر في القفز أو قم بإنهاء الدور.","End jump chain":"نهاية سلسلة القفز","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"الكمبيوتر يختار خطوة قانونية...","Pass the device to the next player.":"قم بتمرير الجهاز إلى اللاعب التالي.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"لقد ملأت المعسكر المقابل وفزت!","Player 1 wins!":"اللاعب 1 يفوز!","Player 2 wins!":"اللاعب 2 يفوز!","The computer wins.":"الكمبيوتر يفوز.","The game is a draw.":"المباراة بالتعادل.","New game started.":"بدأت لعبة جديدة.","Game saved on this device.":"اللعبة محفوظة على هذا الجهاز.","Saved game resumed.":"تم استئناف اللعبة المحفوظة.","Saved game deleted.":"تم حذف اللعبة المحفوظة.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"لا يمكن لهذا المتصفح الحفظ محليًا. يمكنك الاستمرار في اللعب بينما تظل هذه الصفحة مفتوحة.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"تعذرت قراءة اللعبة المحفوظة. ابدأ لعبة جديدة أو احذف الحفظ التالف.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"هذه الخطوة غير قانونية. اختر مربعًا فارغًا واتبع سلسلة القفز المميزة.","Rules reference":"مرجع القواعد","Standard two-player Halma rules":"قواعد Halma القياسية للاعبين"},"bg":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Безплатна настолна игра 16×16 с вериги за скачане","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Играйте класическа Halma за двама играчи онлайн безплатно. Преместете 19 фигури през дъска 16×16 със стъпки в осем посоки и верижни скокове; играйте на локален компютър или пасвайте и играйте.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Състезавайте се с всичките си 19 фигури в противоположния ъглов лагер. Стъпете с едно квадратче или прескочете произволно парче, след което вържете повече скокове в същия ход. Прескочените фигури остават на дъската.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Безплатна игра. Дъската и запазената игра остават в този браузър на това устройство; не се качват данни за играта.","Play Halma":"Играйте Halma","How a jump chain works":"Как работи веригата за скок","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Фигура може да прескочи съседен зает квадрат в празния квадрат точно отвъд него. След кацане може да скочи отново в друга посока. Парчетата, които е прескочило, никога не се улавят.","How to play":"Как се играе","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Тази страница използва стандартния вариант на квадратна дъска за двама играчи: решетка 16×16 и фигури 19 във всеки от двата противоположни ъглови лагера. На ход преместете една фигура в съседно празно поле във всяка от осемте посоки или направете едно или повече последователни скока със същата фигура. Можете да спрете верига за скачане на всяко кацане. Стъпка и подскок не могат да се комбинират в един ход. Попълнете всеки квадрат в противоположния лагер, за да спечелите.","Frequently asked questions":"Често задавани въпроси","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Скоковете улавят ли парчета?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Бр. Скокът само премества вашата фигура над съседна фигура. Прескоченото парче остава там, където е, независимо дали принадлежи на вас или на другия играч.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Мога ли да направя повече от един скок на завой?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Да. Продължете със същата фигура върху друга съседна фигура в празен квадрат. Можете да прекратите веригата след всяко кацане.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Мога ли да стъпя и след това да скоча наведнъж?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Бр. Обратът е или една съседна стъпка, или една верига за скок. Те не могат да се комбинират.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Може ли фигура да напусне противоположния лагер, след като влезе?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Бр. Тази версия запазва фигура в целевия лагер на противника, след като влезе.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Има ли Халма компютърен противник?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Да. Изберете локалния компютър или предайте едно и също устройство между двама души. Компютърът прави просто законно движение на това устройство; не е онлайн мултиплейър.","Rules and limitations":"Правила и ограничения","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Компютърният противник използва лека евристика за локален прогрес, а не дълбоко търсене или перфектна игра. Това е играта с квадратна дъска 16×16 за двама играчи, а не китайски шашки във формата на звезда. Три повтарящи се позиции или предпазна капачка със завъртане 400 се третират като равенство в тази версия.","Related tools":"Свързани инструменти","Game mode":"Режим на игра","Play against the computer":"Играйте срещу компютъра","Two players on this device":"Двама играчи на това устройство","First turn":"Първи завой","Player 1 starts":"Плейър 1 стартира","Computer starts":"Компютърът се стартира","Player 2 starts":"Плейър 2 стартира","New game":"Нова игра","Resume saved game":"Възобновете запазената игра","Delete saved game":"Изтриване на запазена игра","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Изберете режим и започнете игра.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Платка Halma 16 от 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Ред {row}, колона {column}","Player 1":"Играч 1","Player 2":"Играч 2","Computer":"компютър","empty":"празен","Turn":"Завой","Pieces in opposite camp":"Парчета в срещуположния лагер","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Цел: запълнете противоположния ъглов лагер","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Ваш ред: изберете една от вашите фигури, след това съседно празно поле или скок.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Избрано парче. Изберете наличен квадрат.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Наличен е друг хоп. Продължете със скока или завършете завоя.","End jump chain":"Верига за краен скок","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Компютърът избира законен ход...","Pass the device to the next player.":"Предайте устройството на следващия играч.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Попълнихте противоположния лагер и спечелихте!","Player 1 wins!":"Играч 1 печели!","Player 2 wins!":"Играч 2 печели!","The computer wins.":"Компютърът печели.","The game is a draw.":"Мачът е равен.","New game started.":"Започна нова игра.","Game saved on this device.":"Играта е запазена на това устройство.","Saved game resumed.":"Запазената игра е възобновена.","Saved game deleted.":"Запазената игра е изтрита.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Този браузър не може да записва локално. Можете да продължите да играете, докато тази страница остава отворена.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Запазената игра не може да бъде прочетена. Започнете нова игра или изтрийте повреденото запазване.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Това движение не е законно. Изберете празен квадрат и следвайте маркираната верига за скачане.","Rules reference":"Препратка към правилата","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Стандартни правила на Halma за двама играчи"},"bn":{"Halma":"হালমা","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"হালমা অনলাইন — জাম্প চেইন সহ বিনামূল্যে 16×16 বোর্ড গেম","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"ক্লাসিক টু প্লেয়ার হালমা অনলাইনে বিনামূল্যে খেলুন। 19 টুকরোগুলিকে একটি 16×16 বোর্ড জুড়ে আট-দিক-নির্দেশের ধাপ এবং শৃঙ্খলিত লাফ দিয়ে সরান; একটি স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার বা পাস-এন্ড-প্লে খেলুন।","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"আপনার সমস্ত 19 টুকরা বিপরীত কর্নার ক্যাম্পে রেস করুন। একটি বর্গাকার ধাপ বা যে কোনো টুকরার উপর হপ, তারপর একই পালা আরো হপ চেইন. লাফানো টুকরো বোর্ডে থাকে।","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"খেলতে বিনামূল্যে। বোর্ড এবং সংরক্ষিত গেম এই ডিভাইসে এই ব্রাউজারে থাকে; কোন খেলা তথ্য আপলোড করা হয় না.","Play Halma":"হালমা খেলুন","How a jump chain works":"কিভাবে একটি জাম্প চেইন কাজ করে","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"একটি টুকরো একটি সংলগ্ন দখলকৃত স্কোয়ারের উপর দিয়ে সরাসরি এর বাইরে খালি বর্গক্ষেত্রে যেতে পারে। অবতরণ করার পরে, এটি আবার অন্য দিকে লাফ দিতে পারে। এটি যে টুকরোগুলো লাফিয়ে পড়েছিল তা কখনই ধরা পড়ে না।","How to play":"কিভাবে খেলতে হয়","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"এই পৃষ্ঠাটি স্ট্যান্ডার্ড টু-প্লেয়ার স্কোয়ার-বোর্ডের বৈকল্পিক ব্যবহার করে: একটি 16×16 গ্রিড এবং 19 টুকরা দুটি বিপরীত কোণার ক্যাম্পের প্রতিটিতে। একটি বাঁক নিয়ে, আটটি দিকের যেকোনো একটি সংলগ্ন খালি বর্গক্ষেত্রে এক টুকরো সরান, অথবা একই টুকরো দিয়ে এক বা একাধিক পরপর হপ তৈরি করুন। আপনি যেকোন অবতরণে একটি হপ চেইন বন্ধ করতে পারেন। একটি ধাপ এবং একটি হপ এক পালা একত্রিত করা যাবে না. জয়ের জন্য বিপরীত শিবিরের প্রতিটি স্কোয়ার পূরণ করুন।","Frequently asked questions":"প্রায়শই জিজ্ঞাসিত প্রশ্ন","Do jumps capture pieces?":"জাম্প কি টুকরো ক্যাপচার করে?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"না। একটি লাফ শুধুমাত্র একটি সংলগ্ন টুকরা উপর আপনার টুকরা সরানো. ঝাঁপ দেওয়া টুকরোটি যেখানে আছে সেখানেই থাকে, তা আপনার বা অন্য খেলোয়াড়ের।","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"আমি কি একবারে একাধিক লাফ দিতে পারি?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"হ্যাঁ। একটি খালি বর্গক্ষেত্রে অন্য সংলগ্ন টুকরা উপর একই টুকরা সঙ্গে চালিয়ে যান। আপনি যে কোনো অবতরণ পরে চেইন শেষ করতে পারেন.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"আমি কি এক পালা করে লাফ দিতে পারি?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"না। একটি পালা হয় একটি সংলগ্ন পদক্ষেপ বা একটি লাফ চেইন। তারা একত্রিত করা যাবে না.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"একটি টুকরা প্রবেশ করার পর কি বিপরীত শিবির ছেড়ে যেতে পারে?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"না। এই সংস্করণটি প্রবেশ করার পরে প্রতিপক্ষের গন্তব্য শিবিরের ভিতরে একটি অংশ রাখে।","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"হালমার কি কম্পিউটারের প্রতিপক্ষ আছে?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"হ্যাঁ। স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার চয়ন করুন বা একই ডিভাইস দুটি লোকের মধ্যে পাস করুন। কম্পিউটার এই ডিভাইসে একটি সহজ আইনি পদক্ষেপ করে; এটি অনলাইন মাল্টিপ্লেয়ার নয়।","Rules and limitations":"নিয়ম এবং সীমাবদ্ধতা","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"কম্পিউটার প্রতিপক্ষ একটি হালকা স্থানীয় অগ্রগতি হিউরিস্টিক ব্যবহার করে, গভীর অনুসন্ধান বা নিখুঁত খেলা নয়। এটি দুই-খেলোয়াড়ের 16×16 স্কোয়ার-বোর্ড গেম, তারকা আকৃতির চাইনিজ চেকার নয়। তিনটি পুনরাবৃত্ত অবস্থান বা একটি 400-টার্ন সেফটি ক্যাপ এই সংস্করণে একটি ড্র হিসাবে বিবেচিত হয়।","Related tools":"সম্পর্কিত টুলস","Game mode":"গেম মোড","Play against the computer":"কম্পিউটারের বিরুদ্ধে খেলুন","Two players on this device":"এই ডিভাইসে দুটি প্লেয়ার","First turn":"প্রথম পালা","Player 1 starts":"প্লেয়ার 1 শুরু হয়৷","Computer starts":"কম্পিউটার শুরু হয়","Player 2 starts":"প্লেয়ার 2 শুরু হয়৷","New game":"নতুন গেম","Resume saved game":"সংরক্ষিত খেলা পুনরায় শুরু করুন","Delete saved game":"সংরক্ষিত গেম মুছুন","Choose a mode and start a game.":"একটি মোড চয়ন করুন এবং একটি খেলা শুরু করুন.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"16 বোর্ড দ্বারা হালমা 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"সারি {row}, কলাম {column}","Player 1":"প্লেয়ার 1","Player 2":"প্লেয়ার 2","Computer":"কম্পিউটার","empty":"খালি","Turn":"বাঁক","Pieces in opposite camp":"বিরুদ্ধ শিবিরে টুকরো","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"লক্ষ্য: বিপরীত কর্নার ক্যাম্প পূরণ করুন","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"আপনার পালা: আপনার টুকরোগুলির মধ্যে একটি বেছে নিন, তারপর একটি সংলগ্ন খালি বর্গক্ষেত্র বা একটি লাফ দিন৷","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"পিস নির্বাচিত হয়েছে৷ একটি উপলব্ধ বর্গ চয়ন করুন.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"আরেকটি হপ উপলব্ধ। জাম্পিং চালিয়ে যান বা পালা শেষ করুন।","End jump chain":"এন্ড জাম্প চেইন","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"কম্পিউটার একটি আইনি পদক্ষেপ বেছে নিচ্ছে...","Pass the device to the next player.":"পরবর্তী প্লেয়ারের কাছে ডিভাইসটি পাস করুন।","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"আপনি বিপরীত শিবির পূরণ করেছেন এবং জিতেছেন!","Player 1 wins!":"খেলোয়াড় 1 জিতেছে!","Player 2 wins!":"খেলোয়াড় 2 জিতেছে!","The computer wins.":"কম্পিউটার জিতেছে।","The game is a draw.":"খেলাটি ড্র হয়েছে।","New game started.":"নতুন গেম শুরু হয়েছে৷","Game saved on this device.":"গেম এই ডিভাইসে সংরক্ষিত।","Saved game resumed.":"সংরক্ষিত খেলা আবার শুরু হয়েছে৷","Saved game deleted.":"সংরক্ষিত খেলা মুছে ফেলা হয়েছে।","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"এই ব্রাউজারটি স্থানীয়ভাবে সংরক্ষণ করতে পারে না। এই পৃষ্ঠাটি খোলা থাকাকালীন আপনি খেলা চালিয়ে যেতে পারেন।","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"সংরক্ষিত গেমটি পড়া যাবে না। একটি নতুন গেম শুরু করুন বা ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত সেভ মুছে দিন।","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"এই পদক্ষেপটি বৈধ নয়। একটি খালি বর্গক্ষেত্র চয়ন করুন এবং হাইলাইট করা জাম্প চেইন অনুসরণ করুন।","Rules reference":"নিয়ম রেফারেন্স","Standard two-player Halma rules":"স্ট্যান্ডার্ড টু-প্লেয়ার হালমার নিয়ম"},"ca":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Joc de taula 16×16 gratuït amb cadenes de salt","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Juga a Halma clàssic de dos jugadors en línia gratuïtament. Mou peces 19 per un tauler 16×16 amb passos de vuit direccions i salts encadenats; jugar amb un ordinador local o passar i jugar.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Fes una cursa amb totes les teves peces 19 al campament de la cantonada oposada. Passa un quadrat o salta per sobre de qualsevol peça i, a continuació, encadena més llúpols al mateix torn. Les peces saltades queden al tauler.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Jugar gratuït. El tauler i el joc desat es mantenen en aquest navegador en aquest dispositiu; no es pengen dades del joc.","Play Halma":"Jugar a Halma","How a jump chain works":"Com funciona una cadena de salt","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Una peça pot saltar per sobre d'un quadrat ocupat adjacent cap a la casella buida directament més enllà d'ella. Després de l'aterratge, pot tornar a saltar en una altra direcció. Les peces que ha saltat mai són capturades.","How to play":"Com jugar","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Aquesta pàgina utilitza la variant estàndard de tauler quadrat per a dos jugadors: una graella 16×16 i peces 19 a cadascun dels dos campaments de cantonada oposats. En un torn, moveu una peça a una casella buida adjacent en qualsevol de les vuit direccions, o feu un o més salts consecutius amb aquesta mateixa peça. Podeu aturar una cadena de llúpol en qualsevol aterratge. Un pas i un salt no es poden combinar en un torn. Omple tots els quadrats del camp contrari per guanyar.","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntes freqüents","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Els salts capturen peces?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Núm. Un salt només mou la teva peça sobre una peça adjacent. La peça saltata per sobre es queda on és, tant si et pertany a tu com a l'altre jugador.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Puc fer més d'un salt en un torn?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Sí. Continueu amb la mateixa peça sobre una altra peça adjacent en un quadrat buit. Podeu acabar la cadena després de qualsevol aterratge.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Puc trepitjar i després saltar d'un torn?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Núm. Un gir és un pas adjacent o una cadena de salt. No es poden combinar.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Una peça pot sortir del campament contrari després d'entrar?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Núm. Aquesta versió manté una peça dins del camp de destinació de l'oponent un cop entra.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"L'Halma té un oponent a l'ordinador?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Sí. Tria l'ordinador local o passa el mateix dispositiu entre dues persones. L'ordinador fa un simple moviment legal en aquest dispositiu; no és multijugador en línia.","Rules and limitations":"Normes i limitacions","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"L'oponent de l'ordinador utilitza una heurística de progrés local lleugera, no una cerca profunda ni un joc perfecte. Aquest és el joc de taula quadrat 16×16 de dos jugadors, no les dames xineses en forma d'estrella. Tres posicions repetides o una tapa de seguretat de gir 400 es tracten com un empat en aquesta versió.","Related tools":"Eines relacionades","Game mode":"Mode de joc","Play against the computer":"Juga contra l'ordinador","Two players on this device":"Dos jugadors en aquest dispositiu","First turn":"Primer torn","Player 1 starts":"El reproductor 1 s'inicia","Computer starts":"L'ordinador s'inicia","Player 2 starts":"El reproductor 2 s'inicia","New game":"Joc nou","Resume saved game":"Reprèn la partida desada","Delete saved game":"Suprimeix la partida desada","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Tria un mode i comença un joc.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Placa Halma 16 de 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Fila {row}, columna {column}","Player 1":"Jugador 1","Player 2":"Jugador 2","Computer":"Ordinador","empty":"buit","Turn":"Gira","Pieces in opposite camp":"Peces al campament oposat","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Objectiu: omplir el campament de la cantonada oposada","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"El teu torn: tria una de les teves peces, després una casella buida adjacent o un salt.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Peça seleccionada. Trieu un quadrat disponible.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Hi ha un altre salt disponible. Continueu saltant o finalitzeu el torn.","End jump chain":"Cadena de salt final","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"L'ordinador està triant un moviment legal...","Pass the device to the next player.":"Passa el dispositiu al següent reproductor.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Vas omplir el camp contrari i vas guanyar!","Player 1 wins!":"El jugador 1 guanya!","Player 2 wins!":"El jugador 2 guanya!","The computer wins.":"L'ordinador guanya.","The game is a draw.":"El joc és un empat.","New game started.":"S'ha iniciat un nou joc.","Game saved on this device.":"El joc s'ha desat en aquest dispositiu.","Saved game resumed.":"S'ha reprès el joc desat.","Saved game deleted.":"S'ha suprimit el joc desat.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Aquest navegador no es pot desar localment. Pots seguir jugant mentre aquesta pàgina roman oberta.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"No s'ha pogut llegir la partida desada. Comença un joc nou o suprimeix el desat danyat.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Aquest moviment no és legal. Trieu un quadrat buit i seguiu la cadena de salts destacada.","Rules reference":"Referència de regles","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Normes Halma estàndard per a dos jugadors"},"de":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online – Kostenloses 16×16 Brettspiel mit Sprungketten","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Spielen Sie das klassische Halma für zwei Spieler kostenlos online. Bewegen Sie 19-Teile über ein 16×16-Brett mit Schritten in acht Richtungen und verketteten Sprüngen. Spielen Sie auf einem lokalen Computer oder Pass-and-Play.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Lassen Sie alle 19 Ihrer Figuren in das gegenüberliegende Ecklager. Machen Sie einen Schritt um ein Feld oder hüpfen Sie über ein beliebiges Stück und verketten Sie dann in derselben Runde weitere Hüpfer. Übersprungene Figuren bleiben auf dem Brett.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Kostenlos spielbar. Das Brett und das gespeicherte Spiel bleiben in diesem Browser auf diesem Gerät; Es werden keine Spieldaten hochgeladen.","Play Halma":"Spielen Sie Halma","How a jump chain works":"So funktioniert eine Sprungkette","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Eine Figur kann über ein angrenzendes besetztes Feld in das leere Feld direkt dahinter springen. Nach der Landung kann es sein, dass es wieder in eine andere Richtung hüpft. Die Teile, über die es gesprungen ist, werden nie eingefangen.","How to play":"Wie man spielt","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Diese Seite verwendet die Standardvariante eines quadratischen Bretts für zwei Spieler: ein 16×16-Raster und 19-Steine in jedem der beiden gegenüberliegenden Ecklager. Bewegen Sie in einer Runde eine Figur in eine von acht Richtungen auf ein angrenzendes leeres Feld oder machen Sie einen oder mehrere aufeinanderfolgende Sprünge mit derselben Figur. Sie können eine Sprungkette an jeder Landung stoppen. Ein Schritt und ein Sprung können nicht in einer Runde kombiniert werden. Füllen Sie jedes Feld im gegnerischen Lager aus, um zu gewinnen.","Frequently asked questions":"Häufig gestellte Fragen","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Erfassen Sprünge Figuren?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Nr. Ein Sprung bewegt Ihre Figur nur über eine benachbarte Figur. Der übersprungene Stein bleibt dort, wo er ist, egal, ob er dir oder dem anderen Spieler gehört.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Kann ich in einer Runde mehr als einen Sprung machen?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Ja. Fahren Sie mit demselben Teil über einem anderen angrenzenden Teil in ein leeres Quadrat fort. Sie können die Kette nach jeder Landung beenden.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Kann ich in einer Runde einen Schritt machen und dann springen?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Nr. Eine Runde besteht entweder aus einem benachbarten Schritt oder einer Sprungkette. Sie können nicht kombiniert werden.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Kann eine Figur das gegnerische Lager verlassen, nachdem sie es betreten hat?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Nr. Bei dieser Version bleibt eine Figur im Ziellager des Gegners, sobald sie dieses betritt.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Hat Halma einen Computergegner?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Ja. Wählen Sie den lokalen Computer oder geben Sie dasselbe Gerät zwischen zwei Personen weiter. Der Computer führt auf diesem Gerät einen einfachen legalen Zug aus; Es ist kein Online-Multiplayer.","Rules and limitations":"Regeln und Einschränkungen","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Der Computergegner verwendet eine einfache lokale Fortschrittsheuristik, keine tiefe Suche oder perfektes Spiel. Hierbei handelt es sich um das quadratische Brettspiel 16×16 für zwei Spieler, nicht um sternförmige Chinesische Dame. Drei wiederholte Positionen oder eine 400-Drehsicherungskappe werden in dieser Version als Unentschieden behandelt.","Related tools":"Verwandte Tools","Game mode":"Spielmodus","Play against the computer":"Spielen Sie gegen den Computer","Two players on this device":"Zwei Spieler auf diesem Gerät","First turn":"Erste Runde","Player 1 starts":"Player 1 wird gestartet","Computer starts":"Computer startet","Player 2 starts":"Player 2 wird gestartet","New game":"Neues Spiel","Resume saved game":"Gespeichertes Spiel fortsetzen","Delete saved game":"Gespeichertes Spiel löschen","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Wählen Sie einen Modus und starten Sie ein Spiel.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 von 16-Board","Row {row}, column {column}":"Zeile {row}, Spalte {column}","Player 1":"Spieler 1","Player 2":"Spieler 2","Computer":"Computer","empty":"leer","Turn":"Umdrehen","Pieces in opposite camp":"Teile im gegenüberliegenden Lager","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Ziel: Das gegenüberliegende Ecklager füllen","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Ihr Zug: Wählen Sie eine Ihrer Figuren, dann ein angrenzendes leeres Feld oder einen Sprung.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Stück ausgewählt. Wählen Sie ein verfügbares Quadrat.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Ein weiterer Hop ist verfügbar. Springen Sie weiter oder beenden Sie die Kurve.","End jump chain":"Sprungkette beenden","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Der Computer wählt einen legalen Schritt…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Geben Sie das Gerät an den nächsten Spieler weiter.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Du hast das gegnerische Lager besetzt und gewonnen!","Player 1 wins!":"Spieler 1 gewinnt!","Player 2 wins!":"Spieler 2 gewinnt!","The computer wins.":"Der Computer gewinnt.","The game is a draw.":"Das Spiel ist unentschieden.","New game started.":"Neues Spiel gestartet.","Game saved on this device.":"Spiel auf diesem Gerät gespeichert.","Saved game resumed.":"Gespeichertes Spiel fortgesetzt.","Saved game deleted.":"Gespeichertes Spiel gelöscht.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Dieser Browser kann nicht lokal speichern. Sie können weiterspielen, solange diese Seite geöffnet bleibt.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Das gespeicherte Spiel konnte nicht gelesen werden. Starten Sie ein neues Spiel oder löschen Sie den beschädigten Speicher.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Dieser Schritt ist nicht legal. Wählen Sie ein leeres Quadrat und folgen Sie der hervorgehobenen Sprungkette.","Rules reference":"Regelreferenz","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Standard-Halma-Regeln für zwei Spieler"},"el":{"Halma":"Χάλμα","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Δωρεάν 16×16 επιτραπέζιο παιχνίδι με αλυσίδες άλματος","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Παίξτε το κλασικό Halma για δύο παίκτες online δωρεάν. Μετακινήστε τα κομμάτια 19 σε έναν πίνακα 16×16 με βήματα οκτώ κατευθύνσεων και αλυσοδεμένα άλματα. παίξτε έναν τοπικό υπολογιστή ή περάστε και παίξτε.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Αγωνίστε όλα τα 19 από τα κομμάτια σας στο απέναντι γωνιακό στρατόπεδο. Βάλτε ένα τετράγωνο ή πηδήξτε πάνω από οποιοδήποτε κομμάτι και, στη συνέχεια, αλυσοδώστε περισσότερους λυκίσκους στην ίδια στροφή. Τα άλματα κομμάτια παραμένουν στο ταμπλό.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Δωρεάν παιχνίδι. Ο πίνακας και το αποθηκευμένο παιχνίδι παραμένουν σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης σε αυτήν τη συσκευή. δεν μεταφορτώνονται δεδομένα παιχνιδιού.","Play Halma":"Παίξτε Halma","How a jump chain works":"Πώς λειτουργεί μια αλυσίδα άλματος","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Ένα κομμάτι μπορεί να πηδήξει πάνω από ένα παρακείμενο κατειλημμένο τετράγωνο στο κενό τετράγωνο ακριβώς πέρα από αυτό. Μετά την προσγείωση, μπορεί να πηδήξει ξανά προς άλλη κατεύθυνση. Τα κομμάτια που πήδηξε δεν αποτυπώνονται ποτέ.","How to play":"Πώς να παίξετε","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Αυτή η σελίδα χρησιμοποιεί την τυπική παραλλαγή τετράγωνου πίνακα δύο παικτών: ένα πλέγμα 16×16 και κομμάτια 19 σε καθένα από τα δύο απέναντι γωνιακά στρατόπεδα. Σε μια στροφή, μετακινήστε ένα κομμάτι σε ένα διπλανό κενό τετράγωνο προς οποιαδήποτε από τις οκτώ κατευθύνσεις ή κάντε ένα ή περισσότερα διαδοχικά άλματα με το ίδιο κομμάτι. Μπορείτε να σταματήσετε μια αλυσίδα λυκίσκου σε οποιαδήποτε προσγείωση. Ένα βήμα και ένα άλμα δεν μπορούν να συνδυαστούν σε μια στροφή. Γεμίστε κάθε τετράγωνο στο απέναντι στρατόπεδο για να κερδίσετε.","Frequently asked questions":"Συχνές ερωτήσεις","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Τα άλματα καταγράφουν κομμάτια;","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Αρ. Ένα άλμα μετακινεί το κομμάτι σας μόνο πάνω από ένα διπλανό κομμάτι. Το κομμάτι που αναπήδησε παραμένει εκεί που είναι, είτε ανήκει σε εσάς είτε στον άλλο παίκτη.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Μπορώ να κάνω περισσότερα από ένα άλματα σε μια στροφή;","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Ναι. Συνεχίστε με το ίδιο κομμάτι πάνω από ένα άλλο διπλανό κομμάτι σε ένα κενό τετράγωνο. Μπορείτε να τερματίσετε την αλυσίδα μετά από οποιαδήποτε προσγείωση.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Μπορώ να πατήσω και μετά να πηδήξω σε μια στροφή;","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Αρ. Μια στροφή είναι είτε ένα διπλανό βήμα είτε μια αλυσίδα άλματος. Δεν μπορούν να συνδυαστούν.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Μπορεί ένα κομμάτι να φύγει από το απέναντι στρατόπεδο αφού μπει;","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Αρ. Αυτή η έκδοση διατηρεί ένα κομμάτι μέσα στο στρατόπεδο προορισμού του αντιπάλου μόλις μπει.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Έχει η Halma αντίπαλο υπολογιστή;","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Ναι. Επιλέξτε τον τοπικό υπολογιστή ή περάστε την ίδια συσκευή μεταξύ δύο ατόμων. Ο υπολογιστής κάνει μια απλή νομική κίνηση σε αυτήν τη συσκευή. δεν είναι online multiplayer.","Rules and limitations":"Κανόνες και περιορισμοί","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Ο αντίπαλος υπολογιστής χρησιμοποιεί μια ελαφριά ευρετική τοπική προόδου, όχι βαθιά αναζήτηση ή τέλειο παιχνίδι. Αυτό είναι το επιτραπέζιο παιχνίδι δύο παικτών 16×16 με τετράγωνο παιχνίδι, όχι κινέζικα πούλια σε σχήμα αστεριού. Τρεις επαναλαμβανόμενες θέσεις ή ένα καπάκι ασφαλείας στροφής 400 αντιμετωπίζονται ως ισοπαλία σε αυτήν την έκδοση.","Related tools":"Σχετικά εργαλεία","Game mode":"Λειτουργία παιχνιδιού","Play against the computer":"Παίξτε ενάντια στον υπολογιστή","Two players on this device":"Δύο παίκτες σε αυτήν τη συσκευή","First turn":"Πρώτη στροφή","Player 1 starts":"Το πρόγραμμα αναπαραγωγής 1 ξεκινά","Computer starts":"Ο υπολογιστής ξεκινά","Player 2 starts":"Το πρόγραμμα αναπαραγωγής 2 ξεκινά","New game":"Νέο παιχνίδι","Resume saved game":"Συνέχιση αποθηκευμένου παιχνιδιού","Delete saved game":"Διαγραφή αποθηκευμένου παιχνιδιού","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Επιλέξτε μια λειτουργία και ξεκινήστε ένα παιχνίδι.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Πλακέτα Halma 16 by 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Σειρά {row}, στήλη {column}","Player 1":"Παίκτης 1","Player 2":"Παίκτης 2","Computer":"Ηλεκτρονικός υπολογιστής","empty":"κενό","Turn":"Στροφή","Pieces in opposite camp":"Τεμάχια στο απέναντι στρατόπεδο","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Στόχος: γεμίστε το απέναντι γωνιακό στρατόπεδο","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Σειρά σας: επιλέξτε ένα από τα κομμάτια σας, μετά ένα διπλανό κενό τετράγωνο ή ένα άλμα.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Επιλέχτηκε το κομμάτι. Επιλέξτε ένα διαθέσιμο τετράγωνο.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Ένα άλλο hop είναι διαθέσιμο. Συνεχίστε το άλμα ή τερματίστε τη στροφή.","End jump chain":"Τελική αλυσίδα άλματος","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Ο υπολογιστής επιλέγει μια νόμιμη κίνηση…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Περάστε τη συσκευή στην επόμενη συσκευή αναπαραγωγής.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Γέμισες το απέναντι στρατόπεδο και κέρδισες!","Player 1 wins!":"Ο παίκτης 1 κερδίζει!","Player 2 wins!":"Ο παίκτης 2 κερδίζει!","The computer wins.":"Ο υπολογιστής κερδίζει.","The game is a draw.":"Το παιχνίδι είναι ισοπαλία.","New game started.":"Ένα νέο παιχνίδι ξεκίνησε.","Game saved on this device.":"Το παιχνίδι αποθηκεύτηκε σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Saved game resumed.":"Το αποθηκευμένο παιχνίδι συνεχίστηκε.","Saved game deleted.":"Το αποθηκευμένο παιχνίδι διαγράφηκε.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης δεν μπορεί να αποθηκεύσει τοπικά. Μπορείτε να συνεχίσετε να παίζετε όσο αυτή η σελίδα παραμένει ανοιχτή.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η ανάγνωση του αποθηκευμένου παιχνιδιού. Ξεκινήστε ένα νέο παιχνίδι ή διαγράψτε την κατεστραμμένη αποθήκευση.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Αυτή η κίνηση δεν είναι νόμιμη. Επιλέξτε ένα κενό τετράγωνο και ακολουθήστε την επισημασμένη αλυσίδα άλματος.","Rules reference":"Αναφορά κανόνων","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Τυπικοί κανόνες Halma για δύο παίκτες"},"es":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Juego de mesa gratuito 16×16 con cadenas para saltar","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Juega al clásico Halma para dos jugadores en línea de forma gratuita. Mueve piezas 19 a través de un tablero 16×16 con pasos de ocho direcciones y saltos encadenados; jugar en una computadora local o pasar y jugar.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Compite con todas las 19 de tus piezas hasta el campamento de la esquina opuesta. Da un paso hacia un cuadrado o salta sobre cualquier pieza, luego encadena más saltos en el mismo turno. Las piezas saltadas permanecen en el tablero.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis para jugar. El tablero y el juego guardado permanecen en este navegador en este dispositivo; no se cargan datos del juego.","Play Halma":"Reproducir Halma","How a jump chain works":"Cómo funciona una cadena de salto","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Una pieza puede saltar sobre una casilla ocupada adyacente a la casilla vacía directamente detrás de ella. Después de aterrizar, puede volver a saltar en otra dirección. Las piezas que saltó nunca son capturadas.","How to play":"Cómo jugar","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Esta página utiliza la variante estándar de tablero cuadrado para dos jugadores: una cuadrícula 16×16 y piezas 19 en cada uno de los dos campos de esquina opuestos. En un turno, mueve una pieza a un cuadrado vacío adyacente en cualquiera de las ocho direcciones, o haz uno o más saltos consecutivos con esa misma pieza. Puedes detener una cadena de salto en cualquier rellano. Un paso y un salto no se pueden combinar en un mismo turno. Llena todos los cuadrados del campo opuesto para ganar.","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntas frecuentes","Do jumps capture pieces?":"¿Los saltos capturan piezas?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"No. Un salto sólo mueve tu pieza sobre una pieza adyacente. La pieza saltada permanece donde está, ya sea tuya o del otro jugador.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"¿Puedo hacer más de un salto en un turno?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Sí. Continúe con la misma pieza sobre otra pieza adyacente hasta formar un cuadrado vacío. Puedes terminar la cadena después de cualquier aterrizaje.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"¿Puedo dar un paso y luego saltar en un giro?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"No. Un turno es un paso adyacente o una cadena de salto. No se pueden combinar.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"¿Puede una pieza salir del campo contrario después de entrar?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"No. Esta versión mantiene una pieza dentro del campamento de destino del oponente una vez que ingresa.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"¿Halma tiene un oponente informático?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Sí. Elige el ordenador local o pasa el mismo dispositivo entre dos personas. La computadora realiza un simple movimiento legal en este dispositivo; No es multijugador en línea.","Rules and limitations":"Reglas y limitaciones","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"El oponente informático utiliza una heurística de progreso local ligera, no una búsqueda profunda ni un juego perfecto. Este es el juego de tablero cuadrado 16×16 para dos jugadores, no damas chinas en forma de estrella. Tres posiciones repetidas o un tapón de seguridad de giro 400 se tratan como un empate en esta versión.","Related tools":"Herramientas relacionadas","Game mode":"Modo de juego","Play against the computer":"Juega contra la computadora","Two players on this device":"Dos reproductores en este dispositivo","First turn":"Primer turno","Player 1 starts":"Se inicia el reproductor 1","Computer starts":"La computadora se inicia","Player 2 starts":"Se inicia el reproductor 2","New game":"Nuevo juego","Resume saved game":"Reanudar juego guardado","Delete saved game":"Eliminar juego guardado","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Elige un modo y comienza un juego.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Placa Halma 16 por 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Fila {row}, columna {column}","Player 1":"Reproductor 1","Player 2":"Reproductor 2","Computer":"Computadora","empty":"vacío","Turn":"Girar","Pieces in opposite camp":"Piezas en el campo opuesto","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Objetivo: llenar el campo de la esquina opuesta","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Tu turno: elige una de tus piezas, luego una casilla vacía adyacente o un salto.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Pieza seleccionada. Elige una plaza disponible.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Hay otro salto disponible. Continúa saltando o finaliza el turno.","End jump chain":"Cadena de salto final","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"La computadora está eligiendo un movimiento legal…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Pasa el dispositivo al siguiente jugador.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"¡Llenaste el campo contrario y ganaste!","Player 1 wins!":"¡El jugador 1 gana!","Player 2 wins!":"¡El jugador 2 gana!","The computer wins.":"La computadora gana.","The game is a draw.":"El juego es un empate.","New game started.":"Nuevo juego iniciado.","Game saved on this device.":"Juego guardado en este dispositivo.","Saved game resumed.":"Se reanudó la partida guardada.","Saved game deleted.":"Juego guardado eliminado.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Este navegador no puede guardar localmente. Puedes seguir jugando mientras esta página permanezca abierta.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"No se pudo leer la partida guardada. Comienza un nuevo juego o elimina el guardado dañado.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Ese movimiento no es legal. Elige un cuadrado vacío y sigue la cadena de salto resaltada.","Rules reference":"Referencia de reglas","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Reglas estándar de Halma para dos jugadores"},"fa":{"Halma":"حلما","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — بازی رومیزی رایگان 16×16 با زنجیر پرش","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Halma کلاسیک دو نفره را به صورت آنلاین و رایگان بازی کنید. تکه های 19 را روی تخته 16×16 با پله های هشت جهتی و پرش های زنجیر شده حرکت دهید. یک رایانه محلی یا پاس و بازی پخش کنید.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"تمام 19 قطعات خود را در کمپ گوشه مقابل مسابقه دهید. مرحله یک مربع یا پرش را روی هر تکه ای بزنید، سپس رازهای بیشتری را در همان نوبت زنجیر کنید. قطعات پریده روی تخته می مانند.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"بازی رایگان. برد و بازی ذخیره شده در این مرورگر در این دستگاه باقی می ماند. هیچ داده بازی آپلود نمی شود.","Play Halma":"بازی حلما","How a jump chain works":"چگونه زنجیر پرش کار می کند","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"یک قطعه می تواند از روی یک مربع اشغال شده مجاور به سمت مربع خالی مستقیماً آن سوی آن بپرد. پس از فرود، ممکن است دوباره در جهت دیگری پرش کند. قطعاتی که از روی آنها پرید هرگز دستگیر نمی شوند.","How to play":"نحوه بازی","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"این صفحه از نوع استاندارد تخته مربعی دو نفره استفاده می کند: یک شبکه 16×16 و قطعات 19 در هر یک از دو کمپ گوشه مقابل. در یک پیچ، یک قطعه را به یک مربع خالی مجاور در هر یک از هشت جهت حرکت دهید، یا یک یا چند پرش متوالی با همان قطعه انجام دهید. در هر فرود می توانید یک زنجیر هاپ را متوقف کنید. یک استپ و یک پرش را نمی توان در یک نوبت ترکیب کرد. هر مربع را در اردوگاه مقابل پر کنید تا برنده شوید.","Frequently asked questions":"سوالات متداول","Do jumps capture pieces?":"آیا پرش ها قطعات را می گیرند؟","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"شماره. یک پرش فقط مهره شما را روی یک قطعه مجاور حرکت می دهد. قطعه ای که از روی آن پرید در جایی که هست باقی می ماند، چه متعلق به شما باشد و چه به بازیکن دیگر.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"آیا می توانم بیش از یک پرش در یک پیچ انجام دهم؟","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"بله. همان قطعه را روی یک قطعه مجاور دیگر در یک مربع خالی ادامه دهید. می توانید پس از هر فرود، زنجیره را پایان دهید.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"آیا می توانم قدم بگذارم و سپس در یک دور بپرم؟","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"شماره. چرخش یا یک پله مجاور یا یک زنجیره پرش است. آنها را نمی توان ترکیب کرد.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"آیا یک قطعه می تواند پس از ورود از کمپ مقابل خارج شود؟","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"شماره. این نسخه پس از ورود، یک قطعه را در کمپ مقصد حریف نگه می دارد.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"آیا هالما حریف کامپیوتری دارد؟","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"بله. رایانه محلی را انتخاب کنید یا همان دستگاه را بین دو نفر ارسال کنید. کامپیوتر یک حرکت قانونی ساده روی این دستگاه انجام می دهد. این چند نفره آنلاین نیست.","Rules and limitations":"قوانین و محدودیت ها","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"حریف رایانه ای از یک اکتشافی پیشرفت محلی سبک وزن استفاده می کند، نه جستجوی عمیق یا بازی کامل. این بازی دو نفره 16×16 تخته مربعی است، نه چکرز چینی شکل. سه موقعیت مکرر یا یک کلاه ایمنی چرخشی 400 به عنوان یک تساوی در این نسخه تلقی می شود.","Related tools":"ابزارهای مرتبط","Game mode":"حالت بازی","Play against the computer":"در مقابل کامپیوتر بازی کنید","Two players on this device":"دو بازیکن در این دستگاه","First turn":"نوبت اول","Player 1 starts":"بازیکن 1 شروع می شود","Computer starts":"کامپیوتر راه اندازی می شود","Player 2 starts":"بازیکن 2 شروع می شود","New game":"بازی جدید","Resume saved game":"از سرگیری بازی ذخیره شده","Delete saved game":"حذف بازی ذخیره شده","Choose a mode and start a game.":"یک حالت را انتخاب کنید و یک بازی را شروع کنید.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"برد Halma 16 by 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"ردیف {row}، ستون {column}","Player 1":"پخش کننده 1","Player 2":"پخش کننده 2","Computer":"کامپیوتر","empty":"خالی","Turn":"پیچ","Pieces in opposite camp":"قطعه در کمپ مقابل","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"هدف: کمپ گوشه مقابل را پر کنید","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"نوبت شماست: یکی از قطعات خود را انتخاب کنید، سپس یک مربع خالی مجاور یا یک پرش.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"قطعه انتخاب شد. مربع موجود را انتخاب کنید.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"یک هاپ دیگر موجود است. به پریدن ادامه دهید یا چرخش را پایان دهید.","End jump chain":"زنجیر پرش انتهایی","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"کامپیوتر در حال انتخاب یک حرکت قانونی است…","Pass the device to the next player.":"دستگاه را به پخش کننده بعدی منتقل کنید.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"کمپ مقابل را پر کردی و بردی!","Player 1 wins!":"بازیکن 1 برنده می شود!","Player 2 wins!":"بازیکن 2 برنده می شود!","The computer wins.":"کامپیوتر برنده است.","The game is a draw.":"بازی مساوی است.","New game started.":"بازی جدید شروع شد.","Game saved on this device.":"بازی در این دستگاه ذخیره شده است.","Saved game resumed.":"بازی ذخیره شده از سر گرفته شد.","Saved game deleted.":"بازی ذخیره شده حذف شد.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"این مرورگر نمی تواند به صورت محلی ذخیره شود. تا زمانی که این صفحه باز است، می‌توانید به بازی ادامه دهید.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"بازی ذخیره شده قابل خواندن نیست. یک بازی جدید شروع کنید یا ذخیره آسیب دیده را حذف کنید.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"این حرکت قانونی نیست. یک مربع خالی انتخاب کنید و زنجیره پرش برجسته شده را دنبال کنید.","Rules reference":"مرجع قوانین","Standard two-player Halma rules":"قوانین استاندارد هالما دو نفره"},"fr":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Jeu de société gratuit 16×16 avec chaînes de saut","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Jouez gratuitement en ligne à Halma, le classique à deux joueurs. Déplacez les pièces 19 sur un plateau 16×16 avec des étapes dans huit directions et des sauts enchaînés ; jouer sur un ordinateur local ou passer et jouer.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Faites la course avec tous les 19 de vos pièces dans le camp du coin opposé. Montez d'un carré ou sautez par-dessus n'importe quelle pièce, puis enchaînez d'autres sauts dans le même tour. Les pièces sautées restent sur le plateau.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Jeu gratuit. Le plateau et la partie sauvegardée restent dans ce navigateur sur cet appareil ; aucune donnée de jeu n'est téléchargée.","Play Halma":"Jouer à Halma","How a jump chain works":"Comment fonctionne une chaîne à sauter","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Une pièce peut sauter par-dessus une case occupée adjacente jusqu'à la case vide située juste au-delà. Après l'atterrissage, il peut sauter à nouveau dans une autre direction. Les pièces par-dessus lesquelles il a sauté ne sont jamais capturées.","How to play":"Comment jouer","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Cette page utilise la variante standard du plateau carré à deux joueurs : une grille 16×16 et des pièces 19 dans chacun des deux camps de coin opposés. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. Vous pouvez arrêter une chaîne de sauts à n'importe quel atterrissage. Un pas et un saut ne peuvent pas être combinés en un seul tour. Remplissez chaque case du camp opposé pour gagner.","Frequently asked questions":"Questions fréquemment posées","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Les sauts capturent-ils des pièces ?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Non. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Can I make more than one jump in a turn?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Oui. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. Vous pouvez terminer la chaîne après tout atterrissage.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Puis-je marcher puis sauter en un seul tour ?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Non. Un tour est soit une étape adjacente, soit une chaîne de sauts. Ils ne peuvent pas être combinés.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Une pièce peut-elle quitter le camp opposé après y être entrée ?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Non. Cette version conserve une pièce dans le camp de destination de l’adversaire une fois qu’elle y entre.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Halma a-t-elle un adversaire informatique ?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Oui. Choisissez l'ordinateur local ou passez le même appareil entre deux personnes. L'ordinateur effectue une simple démarche légale sur cet appareil ; ce n'est pas un multijoueur en ligne.","Rules and limitations":"Règles et limitations","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"L'adversaire informatique utilise une heuristique de progression locale légère, et non une recherche approfondie ou un jeu parfait. Il s'agit du jeu de société carré à deux joueurs 16×16, et non des dames chinoises en forme d'étoile. Trois positions répétées ou un capuchon de sécurité tournant 400 sont traités comme un tirage au sort dans cette version.","Related tools":"Outils associés","Game mode":"Mode jeu","Play against the computer":"Jouer contre l'ordinateur","Two players on this device":"Deux lecteurs sur cet appareil","First turn":"Premier tour","Player 1 starts":"Le lecteur 1 démarre","Computer starts":"L'ordinateur démarre","Player 2 starts":"Le lecteur 2 démarre","New game":"Nouveau jeu","Resume saved game":"Reprendre la partie sauvegardée","Delete saved game":"Supprimer la partie sauvegardée","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Choisissez un mode et démarrez une partie.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Carte Halma 16 par 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Ligne {row}, colonne {column}","Player 1":"Joueur 1","Player 2":"Joueur 2","Computer":"Ordinateur","empty":"vide","Turn":"Tourner","Pieces in opposite camp":"Pièces dans le camp opposé","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Objectif : remplir le camp du coin opposé","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"À votre tour : choisissez une de vos pièces, puis une case vide adjacente ou un saut.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Pièce sélectionnée. Choisissez un carré disponible.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Un autre saut est disponible. Continuez à sauter ou terminez le tour.","End jump chain":"Chaîne à sauter d'extrémité","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"L'ordinateur choisit un mouvement légal…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Passez l'appareil au joueur suivant.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Vous avez rempli le camp opposé et vous avez gagné !","Player 1 wins!":"Le joueur 1 gagne !","Player 2 wins!":"Le joueur 2 gagne !","The computer wins.":"L'ordinateur gagne.","The game is a draw.":"Le jeu est nul.","New game started.":"Nouveau jeu démarré.","Game saved on this device.":"Jeu enregistré sur cet appareil.","Saved game resumed.":"La partie sauvegardée a repris.","Saved game deleted.":"Jeu sauvegardé supprimé.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Ce navigateur ne peut pas enregistrer localement. Vous pouvez continuer à jouer pendant que cette page reste ouverte.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"La partie sauvegardée n'a pas pu être lue. Démarrez une nouvelle partie ou supprimez la sauvegarde endommagée.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Ce déplacement n'est pas légal. Choisissez une case vide et suivez la chaîne de saut en surbrillance.","Rules reference":"Référence aux règles","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Règles Halma standard à deux joueurs"},"gu":{"Halma":"હલમા","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"હલમા ઓનલાઈન — જમ્પ ચેઈન સાથે મફત 16×16 બોર્ડ ગેમ","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"ક્લાસિક ટુ-પ્લેયર હલમા ઑનલાઇન મફતમાં રમો. 19 ટુકડાઓને 16×16 બોર્ડ પર આઠ-દિશાના પગલાં અને સાંકળવાળા કૂદકા સાથે ખસેડો; સ્થાનિક કમ્પ્યુટર ચલાવો અથવા પાસ-એન્ડ-પ્લે.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"તમારા બધા 19 ટુકડાઓ વિરુદ્ધ ખૂણાના શિબિરમાં રેસ કરો. એક ચોરસ સ્ટેપ કરો અથવા કોઈપણ ભાગ પર હોપ કરો, પછી તે જ વળાંકમાં વધુ હોપ્સને સાંકળ કરો. કૂદકા લગાવેલા ટુકડાઓ બોર્ડ પર રહે છે.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"રમવા માટે મફત. બોર્ડ અને સાચવેલ રમત આ ઉપકરણ પર આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં રહે છે; કોઈ રમત ડેટા અપલોડ કરવામાં આવ્યો નથી.","Play Halma":"હલમા રમો","How a jump chain works":"જમ્પ ચેઇન કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"એક ટુકડો અડીને કબજે કરેલા ચોરસ ઉપરથી સીધો તેની બહારના ખાલી ચોરસમાં જઈ શકે છે. ઉતરાણ પછી, તે ફરીથી બીજી દિશામાં ઉછળી શકે છે. તે જે ટુકડા પર કૂદકો માર્યો તે ક્યારેય કબજે કરવામાં આવતો નથી.","How to play":"કેવી રીતે રમવું","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"આ પૃષ્ઠ પ્રમાણભૂત બે-પ્લેયર સ્ક્વેર-બોર્ડ વેરિઅન્ટનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે: એક 16×16 ગ્રીડ અને 19 ટુકડાઓ દરેક બે વિરુદ્ધ ખૂણાના કેમ્પમાં. વળાંક પર, એક ભાગને અડીને આવેલા ખાલી ચોરસમાં આઠમાંથી કોઈપણ દિશામાં ખસેડો, અથવા તે જ ટુકડા સાથે એક અથવા વધુ સળંગ હોપ્સ બનાવો. તમે કોઈપણ ઉતરાણ વખતે હોપ ચેઈન બંધ કરી શકો છો. એક પગલું અને હોપ એક વળાંકમાં જોડી શકાતા નથી. જીતવા માટે વિરુદ્ધ શિબિરમાં દરેક ચોરસ ભરો.","Frequently asked questions":"વારંવાર પૂછાતા પ્રશ્નો","Do jumps capture pieces?":"શું કૂદકા ટુકડાઓ કેપ્ચર કરે છે?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"નં. એક કૂદકો ફક્ત તમારા ભાગને નજીકના ભાગ પર ખસેડે છે. ઉપર કૂદી પડેલો ટુકડો જ્યાં છે ત્યાં જ રહે છે, પછી ભલે તે તમારો હોય કે અન્ય ખેલાડીનો.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"શું હું વળાંકમાં એક કરતાં વધુ કૂદકો લગાવી શકું?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"હા. ખાલી ચોરસમાં બીજા સંલગ્ન ભાગ પર સમાન ટુકડા સાથે ચાલુ રાખો. તમે કોઈપણ ઉતરાણ પછી સાંકળને સમાપ્ત કરી શકો છો.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"શું હું પગલું ભરી શકું અને પછી એક વળાંકમાં કૂદી શકું?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"ના. વળાંક એ કાં તો એક અડીને પગથિયું અથવા એક જમ્પ સાંકળ છે. તેઓ ભેગા થઈ શકતા નથી.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"શું ટુકડો પ્રવેશ્યા પછી સામેની છાવણી છોડી શકે છે?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"ના. આ સંસ્કરણ પ્રતિસ્પર્ધીના ગંતવ્ય શિબિરમાં પ્રવેશ્યા પછી એક ટુકડો રાખે છે.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"શું હલમા પાસે કોમ્પ્યુટર વિરોધી છે?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"હા. સ્થાનિક કમ્પ્યુટર પસંદ કરો અથવા બે લોકો વચ્ચે સમાન ઉપકરણ પસાર કરો. કમ્પ્યુટર આ ઉપકરણ પર એક સરળ કાનૂની ચાલ કરે છે; તે ઓનલાઇન મલ્ટિપ્લેયર નથી.","Rules and limitations":"નિયમો અને મર્યાદાઓ","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"કોમ્પ્યુટર પ્રતિસ્પર્ધી હળવા વજનના સ્થાનિક પ્રોગ્રેસ હ્યુરિસ્ટિકનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે, ડીપ સર્ચ કે પરફેક્ટ પ્લેનો નહીં. આ બે-પ્લેયર 16×16 સ્ક્વેર-બોર્ડ ગેમ છે, સ્ટાર-આકારની ચાઇનીઝ ચેકર્સ નથી. આ સંસ્કરણમાં ત્રણ પુનરાવર્તિત સ્થિતિ અથવા 400-ટર્ન સેફ્ટી કેપને ડ્રો તરીકે ગણવામાં આવે છે.","Related tools":"સંબંધિત સાધનો","Game mode":"ગેમ મોડ","Play against the computer":"કોમ્પ્યુટર સામે રમો","Two players on this device":"આ ઉપકરણ પર બે ખેલાડીઓ","First turn":"પ્રથમ વારો","Player 1 starts":"પ્લેયર 1 શરૂ થાય છે","Computer starts":"કોમ્પ્યુટર શરૂ થાય છે","Player 2 starts":"પ્લેયર 2 શરૂ થાય છે","New game":"નવી રમત","Resume saved game":"સાચવેલી રમત ફરી શરૂ કરો","Delete saved game":"સાચવેલી રમત કાઢી નાખો","Choose a mode and start a game.":"એક મોડ પસંદ કરો અને રમત શરૂ કરો.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"16 બોર્ડ દ્વારા હલમા 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"પંક્તિ {row}, કૉલમ {column}","Player 1":"પ્લેયર 1","Player 2":"પ્લેયર 2","Computer":"કોમ્પ્યુટર","empty":"ખાલી","Turn":"ટર્ન","Pieces in opposite camp":"વિરોધી શિબિરમાં ટુકડાઓ","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"ધ્યેય: સામેના ખૂણે કેમ્પ ભરો","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"તમારો વારો: તમારા ટુકડાઓમાંથી એક પસંદ કરો, પછી અડીને આવેલ ખાલી ચોરસ અથવા કૂદકો.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"ટુકડો પસંદ કર્યો. ઉપલબ્ધ ચોરસ પસંદ કરો.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"બીજી હોપ ઉપલબ્ધ છે. કૂદવાનું ચાલુ રાખો અથવા વળાંક સમાપ્ત કરો.","End jump chain":"એન્ડ જમ્પ ચેઇન","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"કોમ્પ્યુટર કાનૂની ચાલ પસંદ કરી રહ્યું છે…","Pass the device to the next player.":"ઉપકરણને આગલા પ્લેયર સુધી મોકલો.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"તમે વિરુદ્ધ શિબિર ભરી અને જીતી!","Player 1 wins!":"પ્લેયર 1 જીત્યો!","Player 2 wins!":"પ્લેયર 2 જીત્યો!","The computer wins.":"કોમ્પ્યુટર જીતે છે.","The game is a draw.":"ગેમ ડ્રો છે.","New game started.":"નવી રમત શરૂ થઈ.","Game saved on this device.":"આ ઉપકરણ પર ગેમ સાચવવામાં આવી છે.","Saved game resumed.":"સાચવેલ રમત ફરી શરૂ થઈ.","Saved game deleted.":"સાચવેલી રમત કાઢી નાખી.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"આ બ્રાઉઝર સ્થાનિક રીતે સાચવી શકતું નથી. આ પૃષ્ઠ ખુલ્લું રહે ત્યાં સુધી તમે રમવાનું ચાલુ રાખી શકો છો.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"સાચવેલ રમત વાંચી શકાતી નથી. નવી રમત શરૂ કરો અથવા ક્ષતિગ્રસ્ત સેવ કાઢી નાખો.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"તે ચાલ કાયદેસર નથી. એક ખાલી ચોરસ પસંદ કરો અને હાઇલાઇટ કરેલી જમ્પ ચેઇનને અનુસરો.","Rules reference":"નિયમો સંદર્ભ","Standard two-player Halma rules":"સ્ટાન્ડર્ડ ટુ પ્લેયર હલમા નિયમો"},"ha":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online - Wasan allo kyauta 16×16 tare da Jump Chains","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Yi wasan classic Halma mai wasa biyu akan layi kyauta. Matsar da 19 guda ɗaya a fadin tsarin 16 × 16 tare da matakai takwas da tsalle-tsalle; kunna kwamfuta na gida ko wuce-da-wasa.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Yi tsere duk 19 na guntuwar ku zuwa kishiyar sansani. Mataki ɗaya murabba'i ko tsalle a kan kowane yanki, sa'an nan kuma ƙara sarƙar hops a cikin juyi ɗaya. Yankakken tsalle suna tsayawa akan allo.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Kyauta don yin wasa. allo da wasan da aka ajiye suna zama a cikin wannan mai binciken akan wannan na'urar; ba a ɗora bayanan wasan ba.","Play Halma":"Wasa Halma","How a jump chain works":"Yadda sarkar tsalle ke aiki","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Wani yanki na iya tsalle sama da filin da ke kusa da shi zuwa cikin filin da babu kowa kai tsaye bayansa. Bayan saukowa, zai iya sake yin tsalle zuwa wata hanya. Ba a taɓa kama guntun da ya yi tsalle ba.","How to play":"Yadda ake wasa","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Wannan shafin yana amfani da daidaitaccen bambance-bambancen allon-dan wasa biyu: grid 16 ×16 da 19 guda a cikin kowane sansani na kusurwa guda biyu. A bi da bi, matsar da yanki ɗaya zuwa wani fili maras komai kusa da shi a kowane daga cikin kwatance takwas, ko yin hops ɗaya ko fiye a jere tare da wannan yanki. Kuna iya dakatar da sarkar hop a kowane saukowa. Ba za a iya haɗa mataki da huntu gaba ɗaya ba. Cika kowane murabba'i a cikin kishiyar sansanin don cin nasara.","Frequently asked questions":"Tambayoyin da ake yawan yi","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Shin tsalle-tsalle na kama?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"No. Tsalle kawai yana motsa yanki a kan wani yanki na kusa. Yankin ya yi tsalle ya tsaya a inda yake, ko naka ne ko na ɗan wasa.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Zan iya yin tsalle sama da ɗaya a juyi?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Ee. Ci gaba da wannan yanki sama da wani yanki na kusa zuwa cikin fili mara komai. Kuna iya ƙare sarkar bayan kowace saukowa.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Zan iya taka sannan in yi tsalle a juyi ɗaya?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"A'a. Juyawa ko dai mataki ɗaya ne kusa da shi ko sarƙar tsalle ɗaya. Ba za a iya haɗa su ba.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Shin yanki zai iya barin kishiyar sansanin bayan ya shiga?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"A'a. Wannan sigar tana adana yanki a cikin sansanin abokan gaba da zarar ya shiga.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Shin Halma tana da abokin adawar kwamfuta?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Ee. Zaɓi kwamfutar gida ko wuce na'ura ɗaya tsakanin mutane biyu. Kwamfuta tana yin motsi mai sauƙi na doka akan wannan na'urar; ba kan layi ba ne da yawa.","Rules and limitations":"Dokoki da iyakancewa","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Abokin hamayyar kwamfuta yana amfani da ƙarancin ci gaban gida mai nauyi, ba bincike mai zurfi ba ko cikakkiyar wasa. Wannan shi ne wasan ƙwallon ƙafa biyu na 16 ×16 wasan allo, ba masu duban Sinanci masu siffar tauraro ba. Matsakaicin maimaitawa uku ko maɓallin aminci na 400 ana ɗaukar su azaman zane a cikin wannan sigar.","Related tools":"Kayan aiki masu alaƙa","Game mode":"Yanayin wasa","Play against the computer":"Yi wasa da kwamfutar","Two players on this device":"Yan wasa biyu akan wannan na'urar","First turn":"Juyawar farko","Player 1 starts":"Dan wasa 1 yana farawa","Computer starts":"Kwamfuta ta fara","Player 2 starts":"Mai kunnawa 2 yana farawa","New game":"Sabon wasa","Resume saved game":"Ci gaba da wasan da aka ajiye","Delete saved game":"Share wasan da aka ajiye","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Zaɓi yanayi kuma fara wasa.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 ta allon 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Jere {row}, shafi {column}","Player 1":"Mai kunnawa 1","Player 2":"Mai kunnawa 2","Computer":"Kwamfuta","empty":"marai","Turn":"Juya","Pieces in opposite camp":"Yanki a gaban sansani","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Manufar: cika kishiyar sansanin kusurwa","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Juyinku: zaɓi ɗaya daga cikin ɓangarorin ku, sa'an nan fare na fanko na kusa ko tsalle.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"An zaɓi yanki. Zaɓi murabba'i mai samuwa.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Akwai wani hop. Ci gaba da tsalle ko ƙare juyawa.","End jump chain":"Sarkar tsalle ta ƙare","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Kwamfuta tana zabar motsi na doka…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Matsar da na'urar zuwa mai kunnawa na gaba.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Kun cika kishiyar sansanin kun ci nasara!","Player 1 wins!":"Dan wasa 1 yayi nasara!","Player 2 wins!":"Dan wasa 2 yayi nasara!","The computer wins.":"Kwamfutar ta yi nasara.","The game is a draw.":"Wasan zane ne.","New game started.":"An fara sabon wasa.","Game saved on this device.":"Wasan da aka ajiye akan wannan na'urar.","Saved game resumed.":"An ci gaba da wasa.","Saved game deleted.":"An share wasan da aka ajiye.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Wannan mai binciken ba zai iya ajiyewa a gida ba. Kuna iya ci gaba da wasa yayin da wannan shafin ke buɗewa.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Wasan da aka ajiye ya kasa karantawa. Fara sabon wasa ko share lalacewa da aka lalace.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Wannan motsi bai halatta ba. Zaɓi murabba'i mara komai kuma bi sarkar tsalle mai haske.","Rules reference":"Ma'anar Dokokin","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Ka'idojin Halma na 'yan wasa biyu daidai"},"hi":{"Halma":"हल्मा","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma ऑनलाइन — जंप चेन के साथ मुफ़्त 16×16 बोर्ड गेम","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"क्लासिक दो-खिलाड़ियों हल्मा को मुफ्त में ऑनलाइन खेलें। 16×16 बोर्ड पर 19 टुकड़ों को आठ-दिशा चरणों और जंजीर छलांग के साथ ले जाएं; स्थानीय कंप्यूटर चलाएं या पास-एंड-प्ले करें।","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"अपने सभी 19 टुकड़ों को विपरीत कोने वाले शिविर में दौड़ाएं। एक वर्ग कदम रखें या किसी भी टुकड़े पर हॉप करें, फिर उसी मोड़ में अधिक हॉप्स की श्रृंखला बनाएं। उछले हुए टुकड़े बोर्ड पर टिके रहते हैं।","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"खेलने के लिए निःशुल्क। बोर्ड और सहेजा गया गेम इस डिवाइस पर इस ब्राउज़र में रहता है; कोई गेम डेटा अपलोड नहीं किया गया है.","Play Halma":"हल्मा खेलें","How a jump chain works":"जम्प चेन कैसे काम करती है","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"एक टुकड़ा आसन्न कब्जे वाले वर्ग के ऊपर से सीधे उसके परे खाली वर्ग में कूद सकता है। लैंडिंग के बाद यह फिर से दूसरी दिशा में उड़ान भर सकता है। जिन टुकड़ों पर यह कूद गया उन्हें कभी नहीं पकड़ा जाता।","How to play":"कैसे खेलें","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"यह पृष्ठ मानक दो-खिलाड़ी वर्ग-बोर्ड संस्करण का उपयोग करता है: एक 16×16 ग्रिड और दो विपरीत कोने वाले शिविरों में से प्रत्येक में 19 टुकड़े। एक मोड़ पर, एक टुकड़े को आठ दिशाओं में से किसी एक में आसन्न खाली वर्ग में ले जाएं, या उसी टुकड़े के साथ एक या अधिक लगातार हॉप्स बनाएं। आप किसी भी लैंडिंग पर हॉप चेन को रोक सकते हैं। एक कदम और एक छलांग को एक मोड़ में नहीं जोड़ा जा सकता। जीतने के लिए विपरीत खेमे में प्रत्येक वर्ग भरें।","Frequently asked questions":"अक्सर पूछे जाने वाले प्रश्न","Do jumps capture pieces?":"क्या छलांग टुकड़ों को पकड़ती है?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"नहीं। एक छलांग केवल आपके टुकड़े को आसन्न टुकड़े के ऊपर ले जाती है। उछला हुआ टुकड़ा वहीं रहता है, चाहे वह आपका हो या दूसरे खिलाड़ी का।","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"क्या मैं एक मोड़ में एक से अधिक छलांग लगा सकता हूँ?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"हाँ। एक खाली वर्ग में उसी टुकड़े को दूसरे आसन्न टुकड़े के ऊपर से जारी रखें। आप किसी भी लैंडिंग के बाद श्रृंखला समाप्त कर सकते हैं।","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"क्या मैं एक कदम रख सकता हूँ और फिर एक बार में कूद सकता हूँ?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"नहीं। एक मोड़ या तो एक आसन्न कदम या एक छलांग श्रृंखला है। उन्हें संयोजित नहीं किया जा सकता.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"क्या कोई टुकड़ा विपरीत शिविर में प्रवेश करने के बाद छोड़ सकता है?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"नहीं। यह संस्करण प्रतिद्वंद्वी के गंतव्य शिविर में प्रवेश करने के बाद एक टुकड़े को उसके अंदर रखता है।","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"क्या हल्मा का कोई कंप्यूटर प्रतिद्वंद्वी है?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"हाँ। स्थानीय कंप्यूटर चुनें या दो लोगों के बीच एक ही डिवाइस पास करें। कंप्यूटर इस उपकरण पर एक सरल कानूनी कदम उठाता है; यह ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेयर नहीं है.","Rules and limitations":"नियम और सीमाएँ","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"कंप्यूटर प्रतिद्वंद्वी एक हल्के स्थानीय प्रगति अनुमान का उपयोग करता है, न कि गहरी खोज या सही खेल का। यह दो-खिलाड़ियों वाला 16×16 स्क्वायर-बोर्ड गेम है, स्टार-आकार का चीनी चेकर्स नहीं। इस संस्करण में तीन बार दोहराई गई स्थिति या 400-टर्न सेफ्टी कैप को ड्रॉ माना जाता है।","Related tools":"संबंधित उपकरण","Game mode":"गेम मोड","Play against the computer":"कंप्यूटर के विरुद्ध खेलें","Two players on this device":"इस डिवाइस पर दो खिलाड़ी","First turn":"पहला मोड़","Player 1 starts":"प्लेयर 1 प्रारंभ होता है","Computer starts":"कंप्यूटर प्रारंभ होता है","Player 2 starts":"प्लेयर 2 प्रारंभ होता है","New game":"नया गेम","Resume saved game":"सहेजा गया गेम फिर से शुरू करें","Delete saved game":"सहेजा गया गेम हटाएं","Choose a mode and start a game.":"एक मोड चुनें और गेम शुरू करें।","Halma 16 by 16 board":"16 बोर्ड द्वारा हल्मा 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"पंक्ति {row}, स्तंभ {column}","Player 1":"प्लेयर 1","Player 2":"प्लेयर 2","Computer":"कंप्यूटर","empty":"खाली","Turn":"बारी","Pieces in opposite camp":"विपरीत शिविर में टुकड़े","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"लक्ष्य: विपरीत कोने वाले शिविर को भरें","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"आपकी बारी: अपने टुकड़ों में से एक चुनें, फिर एक आसन्न खाली वर्ग या एक छलांग।","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"टुकड़ा चयनित। एक उपलब्ध वर्ग चुनें.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"एक और हॉप उपलब्ध है। कूदना जारी रखें या मोड़ समाप्त करें।","End jump chain":"एंड जंप चेन","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"कंप्यूटर एक कानूनी कदम चुन रहा है...","Pass the device to the next player.":"डिवाइस को अगले प्लेयर को पास करें।","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"आपने विपरीत खेमे को भर दिया और जीत गए!","Player 1 wins!":"खिलाड़ी 1 जीत गया!","Player 2 wins!":"खिलाड़ी 2 जीत गया!","The computer wins.":"कंप्यूटर जीतता है।","The game is a draw.":"खेल ड्रा रहा।","New game started.":"नया गेम शुरू हुआ।","Game saved on this device.":"गेम इस डिवाइस पर सहेजा गया।","Saved game resumed.":"सहेजा गया गेम फिर से शुरू हुआ।","Saved game deleted.":"सहेजा गया गेम हटा दिया गया।","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"यह ब्राउज़र स्थानीय रूप से सहेज नहीं सकता। जब तक यह पृष्ठ खुला रहेगा आप खेलना जारी रख सकते हैं।","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"सहेजा गया गेम पढ़ा नहीं जा सका। एक नया गेम शुरू करें या क्षतिग्रस्त सेव को हटा दें।","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"वह कदम कानूनी नहीं है। एक खाली वर्ग चुनें और हाइलाइट की गई जंप श्रृंखला का अनुसरण करें।","Rules reference":"नियम संदर्भ","Standard two-player Halma rules":"मानक दो-खिलाड़ी हल्मा नियम"},"id":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Permainan Papan 16×16 Gratis dengan Rantai Lompat","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Mainkan Halma dua pemain klasik online gratis. Pindahkan kepingan 19 melintasi papan 16×16 dengan langkah delapan arah dan lompatan berantai; memainkan komputer lokal atau pass-and-play.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Balap semua 19 bidak Anda ke kamp sudut seberang. Melangkah satu kotak atau melompati bagian mana pun, lalu merangkai lebih banyak lompatan pada putaran yang sama. Potongan yang dilompati tetap berada di papan.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis dimainkan. Papan dan permainan yang disimpan tetap berada di browser ini pada perangkat ini; tidak ada data game yang diunggah.","Play Halma":"Mainkan Halma","How a jump chain works":"Cara kerja rantai lompat","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Sebuah bidak dapat melompati kotak yang berdekatan dan ditempati ke kotak kosong tepat di luarnya. Setelah mendarat, ia mungkin akan melompat lagi ke arah lain. Potongan yang dilompatinya tidak pernah ditangkap.","How to play":"Cara bermain","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Halaman ini menggunakan varian papan persegi dua pemain standar: kotak 16×16 dan bidak 19 di masing-masing dua kubu sudut yang berlawanan. Pada gilirannya, pindahkan satu bidak ke kotak kosong yang berdekatan di salah satu dari delapan arah, atau buat satu atau lebih lompatan berturut-turut dengan bidak yang sama. Anda dapat menghentikan rantai lompatan pada pendaratan mana pun. Sebuah langkah dan lompatan tidak dapat digabungkan dalam satu putaran. Isi setiap kotak di kamp lawan untuk menang.","Frequently asked questions":"Pertanyaan yang sering diajukan","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Apakah lompatan menangkap bidak?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Tidak. Lompatan hanya menggerakkan bidak Anda melewati bidak yang berdekatan. Bidak yang dilompati akan tetap berada di tempatnya, baik itu milik Anda atau pemain lain.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Dapatkah saya melakukan lebih dari satu lompatan secara bergantian?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Ya. Lanjutkan dengan potongan yang sama di atas potongan lain yang berdekatan menjadi kotak kosong. Anda dapat mengakhiri rantai setelah mendarat.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Bolehkah saya melangkah lalu melompat dalam satu putaran?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Tidak. Putaran adalah salah satu langkah yang berdekatan atau satu rantai lompat. Mereka tidak dapat digabungkan.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Bisakah bidak meninggalkan kamp seberang setelah masuk?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Tidak. Versi ini menyimpan bidak di dalam kubu tujuan lawan begitu ia masuk.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Apakah Halma memiliki lawan komputer?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Ya. Pilih komputer lokal atau berikan perangkat yang sama antara dua orang. Komputer melakukan tindakan hukum sederhana pada perangkat ini; ini bukan multipemain daring.","Rules and limitations":"Aturan dan batasan","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Lawan komputer menggunakan heuristik kemajuan lokal yang ringan, bukan pencarian mendalam atau permainan sempurna. Ini adalah permainan papan persegi 16×16 untuk dua pemain, bukan Catur Cina berbentuk bintang. Tiga posisi berulang atau tutup pengaman putaran 400 dianggap seri dalam versi ini.","Related tools":"Alat terkait","Game mode":"Mode permainan","Play against the computer":"Bermain melawan komputer","Two players on this device":"Dua pemain di perangkat ini","First turn":"Giliran pertama","Player 1 starts":"Pemain 1 dimulai","Computer starts":"Komputer menyala","Player 2 starts":"Pemain 2 dimulai","New game":"Permainan baru","Resume saved game":"Lanjutkan permainan yang disimpan","Delete saved game":"Hapus permainan yang disimpan","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Pilih mode dan mulai permainan.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 oleh papan 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Baris {row}, kolom {column}","Player 1":"Pemain 1","Player 2":"Pemain 2","Computer":"Komputer","empty":"kosong","Turn":"Putar","Pieces in opposite camp":"Potongan di kubu seberang","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Tujuan: mengisi kamp pojok seberang","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Giliran Anda: pilih salah satu bidak Anda, lalu kotak kosong yang berdekatan atau lompat.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Bagian dipilih. Pilih kotak yang tersedia.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Tersedia lompatan lain. Lanjutkan melompat atau akhiri belokan.","End jump chain":"Rantai lompat akhir","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Komputer sedang memilih langkah hukum…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Berikan perangkat ke pemain berikutnya.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Anda mengisi kubu seberang dan menang!","Player 1 wins!":"Pemain 1 menang!","Player 2 wins!":"Pemain 2 menang!","The computer wins.":"Komputer menang.","The game is a draw.":"Pertandingannya seri.","New game started.":"Permainan baru dimulai.","Game saved on this device.":"Game disimpan di perangkat ini.","Saved game resumed.":"Permainan yang disimpan dilanjutkan.","Saved game deleted.":"Game yang disimpan dihapus.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Browser ini tidak dapat menyimpan secara lokal. Anda dapat terus bermain selagi halaman ini tetap terbuka.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Game yang disimpan tidak dapat dibaca. Mulai permainan baru atau hapus simpanan yang rusak.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Langkah itu tidak sah. Pilih kotak kosong dan ikuti rantai lompat yang disorot.","Rules reference":"Referensi aturan","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Aturan Halma dua pemain standar"},"it":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Gioco da tavolo 16×16 gratuito con catenelle","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Gioca online gratuitamente al classico Halma per due giocatori. Sposta i pezzi 19 su una tavola 16×16 con passi in otto direzioni e salti concatenati; giocare su un computer locale o passare e giocare.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Fai correre tutti i 19 dei tuoi pezzi nel campo all'angolo opposto. Fai un passo di un quadrato o salta su qualsiasi pezzo, quindi concatena più salti nello stesso turno. I pezzi saltati rimangono sul tabellone.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Giocare gratuitamente. Il tabellone e la partita salvata rimangono nel browser di questo dispositivo; non vengono caricati dati di gioco.","Play Halma":"Gioca ad Halma","How a jump chain works":"Come funziona una catena di salto","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Un pezzo può saltare da una casella occupata adiacente nella casella vuota direttamente al di là di essa. Dopo l'atterraggio, potrebbe saltare di nuovo in un'altra direzione. I pezzi su cui ha saltato non vengono mai catturati.","How to play":"Come si gioca","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Questa pagina utilizza la variante standard del tabellone quadrato per due giocatori: una griglia 16×16 e pezzi 19 in ciascuno dei due campi agli angoli opposti. Durante un turno, sposta un pezzo in una casella vuota adiacente in una qualsiasi delle otto direzioni o esegui uno o più salti consecutivi con lo stesso pezzo. Puoi fermare una catena di luppoli in qualsiasi pianerottolo. Un passo e un salto non possono essere combinati in un turno. Riempi ogni casella del campo opposto per vincere.","Frequently asked questions":"Domande frequenti","Do jumps capture pieces?":"I salti catturano i pezzi?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"N. Un salto sposta solo il tuo pezzo su un pezzo adiacente. Il pezzo saltato resta dov'è, sia che appartenga a te che all'altro giocatore.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Posso fare più di un salto per turno?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Sì. Continua con lo stesso pezzo sopra un altro pezzo adiacente in un quadrato vuoto. Puoi terminare la catena dopo ogni atterraggio.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Posso fare un passo e poi saltare in un turno?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"N. Un turno è costituito da un passo adiacente o da un salto concatenato. Non possono essere combinati.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Un pezzo può lasciare il campo opposto dopo essere entrato?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"N. Questa versione mantiene un pezzo all'interno del campo di destinazione dell'avversario una volta entrato.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Halma ha un avversario computerizzato?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Sì. Scegli il computer locale o passa lo stesso dispositivo tra due persone. Il computer effettua una semplice mossa legale su questo dispositivo; non è multiplayer online.","Rules and limitations":"Regole e limitazioni","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"L'avversario computerizzato utilizza un'euristica leggera del progresso locale, non una ricerca approfondita o un gioco perfetto. Questo è il gioco da tavolo quadrato 16×16 per due giocatori, non la dama cinese a forma di stella. In questa versione, tre posizioni ripetute o un limite di sicurezza del giro 400 vengono trattati come un pareggio.","Related tools":"Strumenti correlati","Game mode":"Modalità di gioco","Play against the computer":"Gioca contro il computer","Two players on this device":"Due giocatori su questo dispositivo","First turn":"Prima svolta","Player 1 starts":"Il lettore 1 si avvia","Computer starts":"Il computer si avvia","Player 2 starts":"Il lettore 2 si avvia","New game":"Nuovo gioco","Resume saved game":"Riprendi la partita salvata","Delete saved game":"Elimina la partita salvata","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Scegli una modalità e avvia una partita.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Scheda Halma 16 della 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Riga {row}, colonna {column}","Player 1":"Giocatore 1","Player 2":"Giocatore 2","Computer":"Computer","empty":"vuoto","Turn":"Gira","Pieces in opposite camp":"Pezzi nel campo opposto","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Obiettivo: riempire il campo all'angolo opposto","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Il tuo turno: scegli uno dei tuoi pezzi, poi una casella vuota adiacente o un salto.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Pezzo selezionato. Scegli un quadrato disponibile.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Un altro hop è disponibile. Continua a saltare o termina il turno.","End jump chain":"Catena di salto finale","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Il computer sta scegliendo una mossa legale…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Passa il dispositivo al giocatore successivo.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Hai riempito il campo opposto e hai vinto!","Player 1 wins!":"Il giocatore 1 vince!","Player 2 wins!":"Il giocatore 2 vince!","The computer wins.":"Il computer vince.","The game is a draw.":"La partita è un pareggio.","New game started.":"Nuovo gioco iniziato.","Game saved on this device.":"Gioco salvato su questo dispositivo.","Saved game resumed.":"Gioco salvato ripreso.","Saved game deleted.":"Gioco salvato eliminato.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Questo browser non può salvare localmente. Puoi continuare a giocare mentre questa pagina rimane aperta.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Impossibile leggere la partita salvata. Inizia una nuova partita o elimina il salvataggio danneggiato.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Quella mossa non è legale. Scegli un quadrato vuoto e segui la catena di salto evidenziata.","Rules reference":"Riferimento alle regole","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Regole standard Halma per due giocatori"},"ja":{"Halma":"ハルマ","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — ジャンプチェーン付き無料 16×16 ボードゲーム","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"古典的な 2 プレイヤー Halma をオンラインで無料でプレイします。 8 方向のステップと連鎖ジャンプで、19 のピースを 16×16 ボード上で移動します。ローカルコンピュータまたはパスアンドプレイでプレイします。","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"自分の駒のすべての 19 を反対側のコーナーキャンプにレースします。 1 マス進むか、任意のピースを飛び越えて、同じターンでさらにホップを連鎖させます。ジャンプした駒は盤上に残ります。","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"無料でプレイできます。ボードと保存されたゲームは、このデバイス上のこのブラウザーに残ります。ゲームデータはアップロードされません。","Play Halma":"ハルマをプレイ","How a jump chain works":"ジャンプ チェーンの仕組み","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"ピースは、隣接する占有されたマスを飛び越えて、そのすぐ先の空のマスに移動できます。着地後、再び別の方向に飛び跳ねることがあります。飛び越えたピースは決して捕らえられません。","How to play":"遊び方","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"このページでは、標準的な 2 人用の正方形ボードのバリアント、つまり 2 つの向かい合うコーナー キャンプのそれぞれに 16×16 グリッドと 19 ピースを使用します。ターンでは、1 つのピースを 8 方向のいずれかにある隣接する空きマスに移動するか、同じピースで 1 つ以上の連続したホップを行います。ホップチェーンはどの着地でも停止できます。ステップとホップを 1 回のターンで組み合わせることはできません。反対側のキャンプのすべてのマスを埋めると勝利します。","Frequently asked questions":"よくある質問","Do jumps capture pieces?":"ジャンプは駒を捕らえますか?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"いいえ。ジャンプは、自分の駒を隣接する駒の上に移動するだけです。飛び越えた駒は、それが自分のものであっても、他のプレイヤーのものであっても、その場に留まります。","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"1 ターンに複数回ジャンプできますか?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"はい。同じピースを別の隣接するピースの上に重ねて空の正方形に配置します。着陸後にチェーンを終了することができます。","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"1 ターンでステップしてからジャンプできますか?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"いいえ。ターンとは、隣接する 1 つのステップまたは 1 つのジャンプ チェーンのいずれかです。組み合わせることはできません。","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"駒は入った後、反対側のキャンプから出ることができますか?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"いいえ。このバージョンでは、駒が相手の目的地のキャンプに入ったら、その中に駒を保持します。","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"ハルマにはコンピューターの敵がいますか?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"はい。ローカル コンピューターを選択するか、2 人の間で同じデバイスを渡します。コンピュータはこのデバイス上で単純な合法的な行動をとります。オンラインマルチプレイヤーではありません。","Rules and limitations":"ルールと制限事項","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"コンピューターの対戦相手は、深い検索や完璧なプレイではなく、軽量のローカル進行ヒューリスティックを使用します。これは 2 人用の 16×16 正方形のボード ゲームであり、星型のチャイニーズ チェッカーではありません。このバージョンでは、3 つの繰り返しポジションまたは 400 ターン安全キャップは引き分けとして扱われます。","Related tools":"関連ツール","Game mode":"ゲームモード","Play against the computer":"コンピュータと対戦する","Two players on this device":"このデバイスには 2 人のプレーヤーがいます","First turn":"最初のターン","Player 1 starts":"プレーヤー 1 が開始します","Computer starts":"コンピューターが起動します","Player 2 starts":"プレーヤー 2 が開始します","New game":"新しいゲーム","Resume saved game":"保存したゲームを再開する","Delete saved game":"保存したゲームを削除する","Choose a mode and start a game.":"モードを選択してゲームを開始します。","Halma 16 by 16 board":"ハルマ 16 by 16 ボード","Row {row}, column {column}":"行 {row}、列 {column}","Player 1":"プレーヤー 1","Player 2":"プレーヤー 2","Computer":"コンピューター","empty":"空","Turn":"ターン","Pieces in opposite camp":"反対陣営のピース","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"目標: 反対側のコーナーキャンプを埋める","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"あなたの番: 自分の駒を 1 つ選択し、次に隣接する空の正方形またはジャンプを選択します。","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"ピースが選択されました。利用可能な正方形を選択します。","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"別のホップが使用可能です。ジャンプを続けるかターンを終了します。","End jump chain":"ジャンプ チェーンの終了","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"コンピューターは合法的な手段を選択しています…","Pass the device to the next player.":"デバイスを次のプレイヤーに渡します。","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"あなたは反対陣営を埋めて勝利しました!","Player 1 wins!":"プレーヤー 1 が勝ちました!","Player 2 wins!":"プレーヤー 2 が勝ちました!","The computer wins.":"コンピューターが勝ちます。","The game is a draw.":"試合は引き分けです。","New game started.":"新しいゲームが始まりました。","Game saved on this device.":"ゲームはこのデバイスに保存されました。","Saved game resumed.":"保存されたゲームが再開されました。","Saved game deleted.":"保存されたゲームが削除されました。","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"このブラウザはローカルに保存できません。このページを開いたままプレイを続けることができます。","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"保存されたゲームを読み取れませんでした。新しいゲームを開始するか、破損したセーブデータを削除してください。","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"その動きは合法ではありません。空の四角形を選択し、強調表示されたジャンプ チェーンに従います。","Rules reference":"ルールリファレンス","Standard two-player Halma rules":"標準の 2 人用ハルマ ルール"},"ko":{"Halma":"할마","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — 점프 체인이 포함된 무료 16×16 보드 게임","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"클래식 2인용 Halma 온라인을 무료로 플레이하세요. 8방향 스텝과 체인 점프를 통해 16×16 보드에서 19 조각을 이동하세요. 로컬 컴퓨터를 플레이하거나 패스 앤 플레이를 해보세요.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"모든 19개의 조각을 반대편 모퉁이 캠프로 경주하세요. 한 칸씩 이동하거나 어떤 조각 위로 뛰어든 다음, 같은 차례에 더 많은 홉을 연결하세요. 점프한 조각은 보드에 남아 있습니다.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"무료로 플레이할 수 있습니다. 보드와 저장된 게임은 이 장치의 브라우저에 유지됩니다. 게임 데이터가 업로드되지 않습니다.","Play Halma":"할마 플레이","How a jump chain works":"점프 체인 작동 방식","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"조각은 인접한 점령된 사각형을 뛰어넘어 그 바로 뒤에 있는 빈 사각형으로 이동할 수 있습니다. 착륙 후 다른 방향으로 다시 뛰어오를 수 있습니다. 뛰어넘은 조각은 절대 포착되지 않습니다.","How to play":"플레이 방법","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"이 페이지는 표준 2인용 사각형 보드 변형을 사용합니다: 16×16 그리드와 두 개의 반대편 코너 캠프 각각에 있는 19 조각. 차례가 되면 하나의 조각을 8개 방향 중 하나로 인접한 빈 사각형으로 이동하거나 동일한 조각으로 한 번 이상 연속으로 홉을 만듭니다. 착륙할 때마다 홉 체인을 멈출 수 있습니다. 스텝과 홉은 한 턴에 결합될 수 없습니다. 승리하려면 반대 진영의 모든 칸을 채우세요.","Frequently asked questions":"자주 묻는 질문","Do jumps capture pieces?":"점프가 조각을 포착합니까?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"아니요. 점프는 당신의 조각을 인접한 조각 위로만 이동시킵니다. 뛰어넘은 조각은 자신의 것이든 다른 플레이어의 것이든 그 자리에 그대로 유지됩니다.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"한 차례에 두 번 이상의 점프를 할 수 있습니까?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"예. 같은 조각을 다른 인접한 조각 위에 계속해서 빈 사각형으로 만듭니다. 착륙 후 체인을 끝낼 수 있습니다.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"걸어갔다가 한 턴에 점프할 수 있나요?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"아니요. 턴은 하나의 인접한 단계이거나 하나의 점프 체인입니다. 결합할 수 없습니다.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"조각이 들어온 후 반대편 캠프를 떠날 수 있습니까?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"아니요. 이 버전은 일단 상대방의 목적지 캠프에 들어가면 그 안에 조각을 보관합니다.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"할마에게 컴퓨터 상대가 있나요?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"예. 로컬 컴퓨터를 선택하거나 두 사람이 동일한 장치를 전달합니다. 컴퓨터는 이 장치에서 간단한 합법적인 동작을 수행합니다. 온라인 멀티플레이어가 아닙니다.","Rules and limitations":"규칙 및 제한 사항","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"컴퓨터 상대는 심층 검색이나 완벽한 플레이가 아닌 가벼운 로컬 진행 휴리스틱을 사용합니다. 별 모양의 체커가 아닌 2인용 16×16 사각보드 게임입니다. 이 버전에서는 세 번의 반복 위치 또는 400 회전 안전 캡이 무승부로 처리됩니다.","Related tools":"관련 도구","Game mode":"게임 모드","Play against the computer":"컴퓨터를 상대로 플레이","Two players on this device":"이 장치에는 두 명의 플레이어가 있습니다.","First turn":"첫 번째 턴","Player 1 starts":"플레이어 1 시작","Computer starts":"컴퓨터 시작","Player 2 starts":"플레이어 2 시작","New game":"새 게임","Resume saved game":"저장된 게임 재개","Delete saved game":"저장된 게임 삭제","Choose a mode and start a game.":"모드를 선택하고 게임을 시작하세요.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 by 16 보드","Row {row}, column {column}":"행 {row}, 열 {column}","Player 1":"플레이어 1","Player 2":"플레이어 2","Computer":"컴퓨터","empty":"비어 있음","Turn":"턴","Pieces in opposite camp":"반대 진영의 조각들","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"목표: 반대편 모퉁이 캠프를 채우세요","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"당신의 차례: 조각 중 하나를 선택한 다음 인접한 빈 사각형이나 점프를 선택하세요.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"조각이 선택되었습니다. 사용 가능한 사각형을 선택하세요.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"다른 홉을 사용할 수 있습니다. 계속 점프하거나 턴을 종료합니다.","End jump chain":"점프 체인 끝","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"컴퓨터가 합법적인 움직임을 선택하고 있습니다…","Pass the device to the next player.":"장치를 다음 플레이어에게 전달합니다.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"반대 진영을 채워 승리했습니다!","Player 1 wins!":"플레이어 1가 승리했습니다!","Player 2 wins!":"플레이어 2가 승리했습니다!","The computer wins.":"컴퓨터가 승리합니다.","The game is a draw.":"게임은 무승부입니다.","New game started.":"새 게임이 시작되었습니다.","Game saved on this device.":"게임이 이 장치에 저장되었습니다.","Saved game resumed.":"저장된 게임이 재개되었습니다.","Saved game deleted.":"저장된 게임이 삭제되었습니다.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"이 브라우저는 로컬에 저장할 수 없습니다. 이 페이지가 열려 있는 동안 계속 플레이할 수 있습니다.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"저장된 게임을 읽을 수 없습니다. 새 게임을 시작하거나 손상된 저장 파일을 삭제하세요.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"그 이동은 합법적이지 않습니다. 빈 사각형을 선택하고 강조 표시된 점프 체인을 따라가세요.","Rules reference":"규칙 참조","Standard two-player Halma rules":"표준 2인용 Halma 규칙"},"mr":{"Halma":"हलमा","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"हलमा ऑनलाइन — मोफत 16×16 बोर्ड गेम जंप चेनसह","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"क्लासिक टू-प्लेअर हलमा ऑनलाइन विनामूल्य खेळा. 19 तुकडे 16×16 बोर्डवर आठ-दिशेच्या पायऱ्या आणि साखळीत उडी घेऊन हलवा; स्थानिक संगणक प्ले करा किंवा पास-अँड-प्ले करा.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"तुमच्या सर्व 19 तुकड्यांची शर्यत विरुद्ध कॉर्नर कॅम्पमध्ये करा. एक चौरस पायरी करा किंवा कोणत्याही तुकड्यावर फिरवा, नंतर त्याच वळणात आणखी हॉप्स साखळी करा. उडी मारलेले तुकडे बोर्डवर राहतात.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"प्ले करण्यासाठी विनामूल्य. बोर्ड आणि सेव्ह केलेला गेम या डिव्हाइसवर या ब्राउझरमध्ये राहतो; कोणताही गेम डेटा अपलोड केलेला नाही.","Play Halma":"हलमा खेळा","How a jump chain works":"जंप चेन कशी काम करते","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"एक तुकडा लगतच्या व्यापलेल्या स्क्वेअरवर थेट त्याच्या पलीकडे असलेल्या रिकाम्या स्क्वेअरमध्ये जाऊ शकतो. लँडिंग केल्यानंतर, ते पुन्हा दुसर्या दिशेने उडी शकते. त्यावर उडी मारलेले तुकडे कधीच पकडले जात नाहीत.","How to play":"कसे खेळायचे","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"हे पृष्ठ मानक दोन-प्लेअर स्क्वेअर-बोर्ड प्रकार वापरते: 16×16 ग्रिड आणि 19 तुकडे प्रत्येक दोन विरुद्ध कोपरा शिबिरांमध्ये. एका वळणावर, आठ दिशांपैकी कोणत्याही एका बाजूच्या रिकाम्या चौकोनात एक तुकडा हलवा किंवा त्याच तुकड्याने एक किंवा अधिक सलग हॉप्स बनवा. तुम्ही कोणत्याही लँडिंगवर हॉप चेन थांबवू शकता. एक पाऊल आणि हॉप एका वळणात एकत्र केले जाऊ शकत नाही. जिंकण्यासाठी विरुद्ध कॅम्पमधील प्रत्येक चौक भरा.","Frequently asked questions":"वारंवार विचारले जाणारे प्रश्न","Do jumps capture pieces?":"जंप तुकडे कॅप्चर करतात का?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"नं. एक उडी तुमचा तुकडा फक्त जवळच्या तुकड्यावर हलवते. उडी मारलेला तुकडा जिथे आहे तिथेच राहतो, मग तो तुमचा असो किंवा इतर खेळाडूचा.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"मी एका वळणावर एकापेक्षा जास्त उडी मारू शकतो का?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"होय. त्याच तुकड्याने दुसऱ्या समीप तुकड्यावर रिकाम्या चौकोनात सुरू ठेवा. कोणत्याही लँडिंगनंतर तुम्ही साखळी संपवू शकता.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"मी पाऊल टाकून एका वळणावर उडी मारू शकतो का?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"नं. वळण म्हणजे एकतर एक जवळची पायरी किंवा एक जंप चेन. ते एकत्र केले जाऊ शकत नाहीत.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"एखादा तुकडा आत गेल्यावर विरुद्ध शिबिर सोडू शकतो का?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"नं. ही आवृत्ती प्रतिस्पर्ध्याच्या गंतव्य शिबिरात प्रवेश केल्यावर एक तुकडा ठेवते.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"हल्माला संगणकाचा विरोधक आहे का?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"होय. स्थानिक संगणक निवडा किंवा दोन लोकांमध्ये समान डिव्हाइस पास करा. संगणक या डिव्हाइसवर एक साधी कायदेशीर हालचाल करतो; हे ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेअर नाही.","Rules and limitations":"नियम आणि मर्यादा","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"संगणक विरोधक हलक्या वजनाचा स्थानिक प्रगती ह्युरिस्टिक वापरतो, खोल शोध किंवा परिपूर्ण खेळ नाही. हा दोन-खेळाडूंचा 16×16 स्क्वेअर-बोर्ड गेम आहे, तारेच्या आकाराचा चायनीज चेकर्स नाही. या आवृत्तीमध्ये तीन पुनरावृत्ती पोझिशन्स किंवा 400-टर्न सेफ्टी कॅप ड्रॉ मानली जाते.","Related tools":"संबंधित साधने","Game mode":"गेम मोड","Play against the computer":"संगणकाविरुद्ध खेळा","Two players on this device":"या डिव्हाइसवर दोन खेळाडू","First turn":"पहिले वळण","Player 1 starts":"प्लेअर 1 सुरू होते","Computer starts":"संगणक सुरू होतो","Player 2 starts":"प्लेअर 2 सुरू होते","New game":"नवीन गेम","Resume saved game":"जतन केलेला गेम पुन्हा सुरू करा","Delete saved game":"जतन केलेला गेम हटवा","Choose a mode and start a game.":"एक मोड निवडा आणि गेम सुरू करा.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"16 बोर्डद्वारे हलमा 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"पंक्ती {row}, स्तंभ {column}","Player 1":"प्लेअर 1","Player 2":"प्लेअर 2","Computer":"संगणक","empty":"रिक्त","Turn":"वळण","Pieces in opposite camp":"विरुध्द कॅम्पमधील तुकडे","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"ध्येय: विरुद्ध कोपरा शिबिर भरा","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"तुमची पाळी: तुमचा एक तुकडा निवडा, नंतर जवळचा रिकामा चौक किंवा उडी घ्या.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"तुकडा निवडला. उपलब्ध स्क्वेअर निवडा.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"आणखी एक हॉप उपलब्ध आहे. उडी मारणे सुरू ठेवा किंवा वळण संपवा.","End jump chain":"एंड जंप चेन","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"संगणक कायदेशीर हालचाली निवडत आहे…","Pass the device to the next player.":"पुढील प्लेअरकडे डिव्हाइस पास करा.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"तुम्ही विरुद्ध शिबिर भरले आणि जिंकले!","Player 1 wins!":"खेळाडू 1 जिंकला!","Player 2 wins!":"खेळाडू 2 जिंकला!","The computer wins.":"संगणक जिंकतो.","The game is a draw.":"खेळ अनिर्णित आहे.","New game started.":"नवीन गेम सुरू झाला.","Game saved on this device.":"या डिव्हाइसवर गेम सेव्ह केला आहे.","Saved game resumed.":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम पुन्हा सुरू झाला.","Saved game deleted.":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम हटवला.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"हा ब्राउझर स्थानिकरित्या जतन करू शकत नाही. हे पृष्ठ उघडे असताना तुम्ही खेळत राहू शकता.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम वाचता आला नाही. नवीन गेम सुरू करा किंवा खराब झालेले सेव्ह हटवा.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"ती हालचाल कायदेशीर नाही. रिक्त चौकोन निवडा आणि हायलाइट केलेल्या जंप चेनचे अनुसरण करा.","Rules reference":"नियम संदर्भ","Standard two-player Halma rules":"मानक दोन खेळाडू हल्मा नियम"},"ms":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Dalam Talian — Percuma 16×16 Permainan Papan dengan Rantaian Lompat","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Main Halma dua pemain klasik dalam talian secara percuma. Gerakkan kepingan 19 merentasi papan 16×16 dengan langkah lapan arah dan lompatan berantai; bermain komputer tempatan atau hantaran dan main.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Berlumba semua 19 bahagian anda ke kem sudut bertentangan. Langkah satu segi empat sama atau lompat ke atas mana-mana bahagian, kemudian rantai lagi lompatan pada giliran yang sama. Kepingan lompat kekal di papan.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Percuma untuk dimainkan. Papan dan permainan yang disimpan kekal dalam penyemak imbas ini pada peranti ini; tiada data permainan dimuat naik.","Play Halma":"Main Halma","How a jump chain works":"Cara rantai lompat berfungsi","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Sekeping boleh melompat di atas petak yang diduduki bersebelahan ke petak kosong terus di seberangnya. Selepas mendarat, ia mungkin melompat semula ke arah lain. Kepingan yang dilonjaknya tidak pernah ditangkap.","How to play":"Cara bermain","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Halaman ini menggunakan varian papan persegi dua pemain standard: grid 16×16 dan kepingan 19 dalam setiap dua kem sudut bertentangan. Pada giliran, gerakkan satu bahagian ke petak kosong bersebelahan dalam mana-mana daripada lapan arah, atau buat satu atau lebih lompatan berturut-turut dengan bahagian yang sama. Anda boleh menghentikan rantai hop di mana-mana pendaratan. Satu langkah dan lompatan tidak boleh digabungkan dalam satu pusingan. Isi setiap petak di kem bertentangan untuk menang.","Frequently asked questions":"Soalan lazim","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Adakah lompatan menangkap kepingan?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"No. Lompatan hanya menggerakkan sekeping anda ke atas sekeping bersebelahan. Sekeping yang melompat kekal di tempatnya, sama ada ia milik anda atau pemain lain.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Bolehkah saya membuat lebih daripada satu lompatan secara bergilir?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Ya. Teruskan dengan bahagian yang sama ke atas bahagian lain yang bersebelahan ke dalam petak kosong. Anda boleh menamatkan rantai selepas sebarang pendaratan.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Bolehkah saya melangkah dan kemudian melompat dalam satu pusingan?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"No. Satu pusingan sama ada satu langkah bersebelahan atau satu rantai lompat. Mereka tidak boleh digabungkan.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Bolehkah sekeping meninggalkan kem bertentangan selepas ia masuk?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"No. Versi ini menyimpan sekeping di dalam kem destinasi lawan sebaik sahaja ia masuk.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Adakah Halma mempunyai lawan komputer?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Ya. Pilih komputer tempatan atau hantar peranti yang sama antara dua orang. Komputer membuat langkah undang-undang yang mudah pada peranti ini; ia bukan berbilang pemain dalam talian.","Rules and limitations":"Peraturan dan had","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Lawan komputer menggunakan heuristik kemajuan tempatan yang ringan, bukan carian mendalam atau permainan yang sempurna. Ini ialah permainan papan segi empat sama 16×16 dua pemain, bukan Checkers Cina berbentuk bintang. Tiga kedudukan berulang atau penutup keselamatan pusingan 400 dianggap sebagai seri dalam versi ini.","Related tools":"Alat berkaitan","Game mode":"Mod permainan","Play against the computer":"Main melawan komputer","Two players on this device":"Dua pemain pada peranti ini","First turn":"Pusingan pertama","Player 1 starts":"Pemain 1 bermula","Computer starts":"Komputer dimulakan","Player 2 starts":"Pemain 2 bermula","New game":"Permainan baharu","Resume saved game":"Sambung semula permainan yang disimpan","Delete saved game":"Padamkan permainan yang disimpan","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Pilih mod dan mulakan permainan.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 oleh papan 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Baris {row}, lajur {column}","Player 1":"Pemain 1","Player 2":"Pemain 2","Computer":"Komputer","empty":"kosong","Turn":"Pusing","Pieces in opposite camp":"Kepingan di kem bertentangan","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Matlamat: mengisi kem penjuru bertentangan","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Giliran anda: pilih salah satu bahagian anda, kemudian petak kosong bersebelahan atau lompat.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Sekeping dipilih. Pilih petak yang tersedia.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Satu lagi lompatan tersedia. Teruskan melompat atau tamatkan selekoh.","End jump chain":"Tamatkan rantai lompat","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Komputer sedang memilih langkah undang-undang…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Lepaskan peranti kepada pemain seterusnya.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Anda memenuhi kem bertentangan dan menang!","Player 1 wins!":"Pemain 1 menang!","Player 2 wins!":"Pemain 2 menang!","The computer wins.":"Komputer menang.","The game is a draw.":"Permainan ini adalah seri.","New game started.":"Permainan baharu bermula.","Game saved on this device.":"Permainan disimpan pada peranti ini.","Saved game resumed.":"Permainan yang disimpan disambung semula.","Saved game deleted.":"Permainan yang disimpan dipadamkan.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Pelayar ini tidak boleh menyimpan secara setempat. Anda boleh terus bermain sementara halaman ini dibuka.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Permainan yang disimpan tidak dapat dibaca. Mulakan permainan baharu atau padamkan simpanan yang rosak.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Langkah itu tidak sah. Pilih petak kosong dan ikut rantai lompat yang diserlahkan.","Rules reference":"Rujukan peraturan","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Peraturan Halma dua pemain standard"},"nb":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Gratis 16×16 brettspill med hoppekjeder","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Spill klassisk to-spiller Halma online gratis. Flytt 19-brikker over et 16×16-brett med trinn i åtte retninger og lenkede hopp; spille en lokal datamaskin eller pass-and-play.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Sett alle 19 av brikkene dine inn i den motsatte hjørneleiren. Gå en firkant eller hopp over en hvilken som helst brikke, og lenk deretter flere humler i samme omgang. Hoppede brikker forblir på brettet.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis å spille. Brettet og lagret spill forblir i denne nettleseren på denne enheten; ingen spilldata lastes opp.","Play Halma":"Spill Halma","How a jump chain works":"Hvordan en hoppkjede fungerer","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"En brikke kan hoppe over en tilstøtende okkupert rute inn i den tomme ruten rett utenfor den. Etter landing kan den hoppe igjen i en annen retning. Brikkene den hoppet over blir aldri fanget.","How to play":"Slik spiller du","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Denne siden bruker standard to-spillers firkantet bordvariant: et 16×16 rutenett og 19 brikker i hver av to motsatte hjørneleirer. På en tur, flytt en brikke til en tilstøtende tom firkant i en av åtte retninger, eller gjør ett eller flere påfølgende hopp med den samme brikken. Du kan stoppe en hoppkjede ved hvilken som helst landing. Et steg og et hopp kan ikke kombineres i en omgang. Fyll hver rute i den motsatte leiren for å vinne.","Frequently asked questions":"Ofte stilte spørsmål","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Fanger hopp brikker?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Nr. Et hopp flytter bare brikken din over en tilstøtende brikke. Brikken som hoppes over blir der den er, enten den tilhører deg eller den andre spilleren.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Kan jeg gjøre mer enn ett hopp i en sving?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Ja. Fortsett med det samme stykket over et annet tilstøtende stykke til en tom firkant. Du kan avslutte kjeden etter enhver landing.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Kan jeg steppe og deretter hoppe i en sving?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Nr. En sving er enten ett tilstøtende trinn eller en hoppkjede. De kan ikke kombineres.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Kan en brikke forlate den motsatte leiren etter at den kommer inn?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Nr. Denne versjonen holder en brikke inne i motstanderens destinasjonsleir når den kommer inn.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Har Halma en datamaskinmotstander?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Ja. Velg den lokale datamaskinen eller send den samme enheten mellom to personer. Datamaskinen gjør et enkelt lovlig trekk på denne enheten; det er ikke online multiplayer.","Rules and limitations":"Regler og begrensninger","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Datamaskinmotstanderen bruker en lett lokal fremdriftsheuristikk, ikke dypt søk eller perfekt spill. Dette er to-spiller 16×16 firkantet brettspill, ikke stjerneformet kinesisk dam. Tre gjentatte posisjoner eller en 400-sving sikkerhetshette behandles som uavgjort i denne versjonen.","Related tools":"Relaterte verktøy","Game mode":"Spillmodus","Play against the computer":"Spill mot datamaskinen","Two players on this device":"To spillere på denne enheten","First turn":"Første sving","Player 1 starts":"Spiller 1 starter","Computer starts":"Datamaskinen starter","Player 2 starts":"Spiller 2 starter","New game":"Nytt spill","Resume saved game":"Fortsett lagret spill","Delete saved game":"Slett lagret spill","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Velg en modus og start et spill.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 av 16-brett","Row {row}, column {column}":"Rad {row}, kolonne {column}","Player 1":"Spiller 1","Player 2":"Spiller 2","Computer":"Computer","empty":"tom","Turn":"Sving","Pieces in opposite camp":"Bykker i motsatt leir","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Mål: fylle leiren på motsatt hjørne","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Din tur: velg en av brikkene dine, deretter en tilstøtende tom rute eller et hopp.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Stykke valgt. Velg en tilgjengelig firkant.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"En annen hop er tilgjengelig. Fortsett å hoppe eller avslutt svingen.","End jump chain":"Endehoppkjede","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Datamaskinen velger et lovlig trekk...","Pass the device to the next player.":"Send enheten til neste spiller.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Du fylte den motsatte leiren og vant!","Player 1 wins!":"Spiller 1 vinner!","Player 2 wins!":"Spiller 2 vinner!","The computer wins.":"Datamaskinen vinner.","The game is a draw.":"Spillet er uavgjort.","New game started.":"Nytt spill startet.","Game saved on this device.":"Spillet er lagret på denne enheten.","Saved game resumed.":"Lagret spill ble gjenopptatt.","Saved game deleted.":"Lagret spill slettet.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Denne nettleseren kan ikke lagre lokalt. Du kan fortsette å spille mens denne siden er åpen.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Det lagrede spillet kunne ikke leses. Start et nytt spill eller slett den skadede lagringen.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Det trekket er ikke lovlig. Velg en tom firkant og følg den uthevede hoppkjeden.","Rules reference":"Referanse for regler","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Standard to-spiller Halma regler"},"nl":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Gratis 16×16 bordspel met springkettingen","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Speel de klassieke Halma voor twee spelers gratis online. Verplaats 19-stukken over een 16×16-bord met stappen in acht richtingen en geketende sprongen; speel op een lokale computer of pass-and-play.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Race met alle 19 van je stukken naar het tegenoverliggende hoekkamp. Stap één vakje of spring over een willekeurig stuk heen, en koppel dan in dezelfde beurt meer sprongen. Gesprongen stukken blijven op het bord staan.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis te spelen. Het bord en het opgeslagen spel blijven in deze browser op dit apparaat; er worden geen spelgegevens geüpload.","Play Halma":"Speel Halma","How a jump chain works":"Hoe een springketting werkt","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Een stuk kan over een aangrenzend bezet veld springen naar het lege veld direct daarbuiten. Na de landing kan het weer in een andere richting springen. De stukken waar hij overheen sprong, worden nooit vastgelegd.","How to play":"Hoe te spelen","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Deze pagina gebruikt de standaard vierkante bordvariant voor twee spelers: een 16×16-raster en 19-stukken in elk van de twee tegenoverliggende hoekkampen. Verplaats tijdens een beurt een stuk naar een aangrenzend leeg vierkant in een van de acht richtingen, of maak een of meer opeenvolgende sprongen met datzelfde stuk. Je mag bij elke landing een hopketting stoppen. Een stap en een sprong kunnen niet in één beurt worden gecombineerd. Vul elk vierkant in het tegenovergestelde kamp om te winnen.","Frequently asked questions":"Veelgestelde vragen","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Vellen sprongen stukken?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Nr. Een sprong verplaatst je stuk alleen over een aangrenzend stuk. Het stuk waar overheen gesprongen is, blijft waar het is, of het nu van jou is of van de andere speler.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Kan ik meer dan één sprong per beurt maken?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Ja. Ga verder met hetzelfde stuk over een ander aangrenzend stuk in een leeg vierkant. Je mag de ketting na elke landing beëindigen.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Kan ik in één beurt stappen en dan springen?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Nr. Een beurt bestaat uit één aangrenzende stap of één sprongketen. Ze kunnen niet worden gecombineerd.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Kan een stuk het tegenoverliggende kamp verlaten nadat het het binnengekomen is?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Nr. Deze versie houdt een stuk binnen het bestemmingskamp van de tegenstander zodra het binnenkomt.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Heeft Halma een computertegenstander?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Ja. Kies de lokale computer of geef hetzelfde apparaat door aan twee personen. De computer maakt een eenvoudige legale zet op dit apparaat; het is geen online multiplayer.","Rules and limitations":"Regels en beperkingen","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"De computertegenstander gebruikt een lichtgewicht lokale vooruitgangsheuristiek, geen diepgaand zoeken of perfect spel. Dit is het 16×16 vierkant bordspel voor twee spelers, geen stervormige Chinese dammen. Drie herhaalde posities of een 400-draaiveiligheidskap worden in deze versie als gelijkspel beschouwd.","Related tools":"Gerelateerde hulpmiddelen","Game mode":"Spelmodus","Play against the computer":"Speel tegen de computer","Two players on this device":"Twee spelers op dit apparaat","First turn":"Eerste beurt","Player 1 starts":"Speler 1 start","Computer starts":"Computer start","Player 2 starts":"Speler 2 start","New game":"Nieuw spel","Resume saved game":"Hervat het opgeslagen spel","Delete saved game":"Verwijder opgeslagen spel","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Kies een modus en start een spel.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 door 16-bord","Row {row}, column {column}":"Rij {row}, kolom {column}","Player 1":"Speler 1","Player 2":"Speler 2","Computer":"Computer","empty":"leeg","Turn":"Draai","Pieces in opposite camp":"Stukjes in tegenoverstaand kamp","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Doel: het tegenoverliggende hoekkamp vullen","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Jouw beurt: kies een van je stukken, daarna een aangrenzend leeg veld of een sprong.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Stuk geselecteerd. Kies een beschikbaar vierkant.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Er is nog een hop beschikbaar. Ga door met springen of beëindig de bocht.","End jump chain":"Einde springketting","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"De computer kiest voor een legale zet...","Pass the device to the next player.":"Geef het apparaat door aan de volgende speler.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Je vulde het tegenovergestelde kamp en won!","Player 1 wins!":"Speler 1 wint!","Player 2 wins!":"Speler 2 wint!","The computer wins.":"De computer wint.","The game is a draw.":"Het spel is gelijkspel.","New game started.":"Nieuw spel gestart.","Game saved on this device.":"Game opgeslagen op dit apparaat.","Saved game resumed.":"Opgeslagen spel hervat.","Saved game deleted.":"Opgeslagen spel verwijderd.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Deze browser kan niet lokaal opslaan. Je kunt blijven spelen zolang deze pagina open blijft.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Het opgeslagen spel kon niet worden gelezen. Start een nieuw spel of verwijder de beschadigde save.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Deze zet is niet legaal. Kies een leeg vierkant en volg de gemarkeerde sprongketen.","Rules reference":"Regelreferentie","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Standaard Halma-regels voor twee spelers"},"pl":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — bezpłatna gra planszowa 16×16 z łańcuchami skoków","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Zagraj w klasyczną grę Halma dla dwóch graczy online za darmo. Przesuwaj elementy 19 po planszy 16×16, wykonując kroki w ośmiu kierunkach i skoki łańcuchowe; graj na komputerze lokalnym lub w trybie pass-and-play.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Ścigaj się wszystkimi 19 swoich elementów do przeciwległego obozu narożnego. Zrób krok o jedno pole lub przeskocz dowolny element, a następnie wykonaj serię kolejnych przeskoków w tej samej turze. Przeskakiwane elementy pozostają na planszy.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Za darmo. Plansza i zapisana gra pozostają w tej przeglądarce na tym urządzeniu; żadne dane gry nie są przesyłane.","Play Halma":"Zagraj w Halmę","How a jump chain works":"Jak działa łańcuch skoków","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Pionek może przeskoczyć przez sąsiednie zajęte pole na puste pole bezpośrednio za nim. Po wylądowaniu może ponownie odskoczyć w innym kierunku. Kawałki, nad którymi przeskoczył, nigdy nie są przechwytywane.","How to play":"Jak grać","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Ta strona wykorzystuje standardowy wariant kwadratowej planszy dla dwóch graczy: siatkę 16×16 i elementy 19 w każdym z dwóch przeciwległych obozów narożnych. W turze przesuń jedną figurę na sąsiednie puste pole w dowolnym z ośmiu kierunków lub wykonaj jeden lub więcej kolejnych skoków tą samą figurą. Możesz zatrzymać łańcuch przeskoków na dowolnym przystanku. Kroku i skoku nie można łączyć w jednej turze. Wypełnij każde pole w przeciwległym obozie, aby wygrać.","Frequently asked questions":"Często zadawane pytania","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Czy skoki chwytają pionki?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Nie. Skok przesuwa tylko twoją figurę nad sąsiednią figurę. Przeskoczona figura pozostaje tam, gdzie jest, niezależnie od tego, czy należy do ciebie, czy do innego gracza.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Czy mogę wykonać więcej niż jeden skok w turze?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Tak. Kontynuuj tę samą część ponad innym sąsiednim elementem, aż do pustego kwadratu. Możesz zakończyć łańcuch po dowolnym lądowaniu.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Czy mogę wejść, a potem skoczyć w jednej turze?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Nie. Tura to albo jeden sąsiedni krok, albo jeden łańcuch skoków. Nie można ich łączyć.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Czy pionek może opuścić przeciwny obóz po wejściu?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Nie. Ta wersja zatrzymuje element w obozie docelowym przeciwnika po jego wejściu.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Czy Halma ma komputerowego przeciwnika?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Tak. Wybierz komputer lokalny lub przekaż to samo urządzenie dwóm osobom. Komputer wykonuje na tym urządzeniu prosty, legalny ruch; to nie jest tryb wieloosobowy online.","Rules and limitations":"Zasady i ograniczenia","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Komputerowy przeciwnik używa lekkiej heurystyki lokalnego postępu, a nie głębokiego wyszukiwania lub doskonałej gry. To jest gra planszowa 16×16 dla dwóch graczy, a nie chińskie warcaby w kształcie gwiazdy. Trzy powtarzające się pozycje lub zabezpieczenie obrotowe 400 traktowane są w tej wersji jako remis.","Related tools":"Powiązane narzędzia","Game mode":"Tryb gry","Play against the computer":"Graj przeciwko komputerowi","Two players on this device":"Dwóch graczy na tym urządzeniu","First turn":"Pierwszy obrót","Player 1 starts":"Uruchamia się odtwarzacz 1","Computer starts":"Komputer uruchamia się","Player 2 starts":"Uruchamia się odtwarzacz 2","New game":"Nowa gra","Resume saved game":"Wznów zapisaną grę","Delete saved game":"Usuń zapisaną grę","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Wybierz tryb i rozpocznij grę.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 firmy 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Wiersz {row}, kolumna {column}","Player 1":"Gracz 1","Player 2":"Gracz 2","Computer":"Komputer","empty":"pusty","Turn":"Obrót","Pieces in opposite camp":"Elementy w przeciwległym obozie","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Cel: wypełnić przeciwległy obóz narożny","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Twoja kolej: wybierz jeden ze swoich elementów, następnie sąsiadujące puste pole lub skok.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Wybrano element. Wybierz dostępny kwadrat.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Dostępny jest kolejny przeskok. Kontynuuj skoki lub zakończ turę.","End jump chain":"Zakończ łańcuch skoków","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Komputer wybiera legalny ruch…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Przekaż urządzenie następnemu graczowi.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Wypełniłeś przeciwny obóz i wygrałeś!","Player 1 wins!":"Gracz 1 wygrywa!","Player 2 wins!":"Gracz 2 wygrywa!","The computer wins.":"Komputer wygrywa.","The game is a draw.":"Remis w meczu.","New game started.":"Rozpoczęto nową grę.","Game saved on this device.":"Gra zapisana na tym urządzeniu.","Saved game resumed.":"Zapisana gra została wznowiona.","Saved game deleted.":"Zapisana gra została usunięta.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Ta przeglądarka nie może zapisywać lokalnie. Możesz grać dalej, dopóki ta strona będzie otwarta.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Nie można odczytać zapisanej gry. Rozpocznij nową grę lub usuń uszkodzony zapis.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"To posunięcie jest nielegalne. Wybierz pusty kwadrat i podążaj za podświetlonym łańcuchem skoków.","Rules reference":"Odniesienie do zasad","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Standardowe zasady Halmy dla dwóch graczy"},"pt":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online – Jogo de tabuleiro 16×16 grátis com correntes de salto","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Jogue Halma clássico para dois jogadores online gratuitamente. Mova peças 19 em um tabuleiro 16×16 com passos em oito direções e saltos encadeados; jogue em um computador local ou passe e jogue.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Corra com todas as suas peças 19 para o acampamento do canto oposto. Pise um quadrado ou pule sobre qualquer peça e, em seguida, encadeie mais saltos no mesmo turno. As peças saltadas permanecem no tabuleiro.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Grátis para jogar. O tabuleiro e o jogo salvo permanecem neste navegador neste dispositivo; nenhum dado do jogo é carregado.","Play Halma":"Jogar Halma","How a jump chain works":"Como funciona uma corrente de salto","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Uma peça pode saltar sobre um quadrado ocupado adjacente para o quadrado vazio diretamente além dele. Após o pouso, ele poderá saltar novamente em outra direção. As peças que ele saltou nunca são capturadas.","How to play":"Como jogar","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Esta página usa a variante padrão do tabuleiro quadrado para dois jogadores: uma grade 16×16 e peças 19 em cada um dos dois campos de canto opostos. Num turno, mova uma peça para um quadrado vazio adjacente em qualquer uma das oito direções ou faça um ou mais saltos consecutivos com a mesma peça. Você pode parar uma corrente de lúpulo em qualquer patamar. Um passo e um salto não podem ser combinados em um único turno. Preencha todos os quadrados do campo oposto para vencer.","Frequently asked questions":"Perguntas frequentes","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Os saltos capturam peças?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Não. Um salto apenas move sua peça sobre uma peça adjacente. A peça saltada permanece onde está, seja sua ou do outro jogador.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Posso dar mais de um salto por vez?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Sim. Continue com a mesma peça sobre outra peça adjacente em um quadrado vazio. Você pode encerrar a corrente após qualquer pouso.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Posso dar um passo e depois pular de uma só vez?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Não. Uma curva é uma etapa adjacente ou uma cadeia de salto. Eles não podem ser combinados.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Uma peça pode sair do campo oposto depois de entrar?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Não. Esta versão mantém uma peça dentro do campo de destino do oponente assim que ele entra.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Halma tem um oponente controlado pelo computador?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Sim. Escolha o computador local ou passe o mesmo dispositivo entre duas pessoas. O computador faz um movimento legal simples neste dispositivo; não é multijogador online.","Rules and limitations":"Regras e limitações","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"O oponente do computador usa uma heurística leve de progresso local, não uma pesquisa profunda ou jogo perfeito. Este é o jogo de tabuleiro quadrado 16×16 para dois jogadores, não Damas Chinesas em forma de estrela. Três posições repetidas ou uma tampa de segurança giratória 400 são tratadas como empate nesta versão.","Related tools":"Ferramentas relacionadas","Game mode":"Modo de jogo","Play against the computer":"Jogue contra o computador","Two players on this device":"Dois jogadores neste dispositivo","First turn":"Primeira volta","Player 1 starts":"O reprodutor 1 inicia","Computer starts":"Computador inicia","Player 2 starts":"O reprodutor 2 inicia","New game":"Novo jogo","Resume saved game":"Retomar jogo salvo","Delete saved game":"Excluir jogo salvo","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Escolha um modo e inicie um jogo.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Placa Halma 16 por 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Linha {row}, coluna {column}","Player 1":"Jogador 1","Player 2":"Jogador 2","Computer":"Computador","empty":"vazio","Turn":"Turno","Pieces in opposite camp":"Peças no campo oposto","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Objetivo: preencher o acampamento do canto oposto","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Sua vez: escolha uma de suas peças e, em seguida, um quadrado vazio adjacente ou um salto.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Peça selecionada. Escolha um quadrado disponível.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Outro salto está disponível. Continue pulando ou termine o turno.","End jump chain":"Corrente de salto final","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"O computador está escolhendo uma jogada legal…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Passe o dispositivo para o próximo jogador.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Você preencheu o campo oposto e venceu!","Player 1 wins!":"Jogador 1 vence!","Player 2 wins!":"Jogador 2 vence!","The computer wins.":"O computador vence.","The game is a draw.":"O jogo empatou.","New game started.":"Novo jogo iniciado.","Game saved on this device.":"Jogo salvo neste dispositivo.","Saved game resumed.":"Jogo salvo retomado.","Saved game deleted.":"Jogo salvo excluído.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Este navegador não pode salvar localmente. Você pode continuar jogando enquanto esta página permanece aberta.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"O jogo salvo não pôde ser lido. Inicie um novo jogo ou exclua o salvamento danificado.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Essa mudança não é legal. Escolha um quadrado vazio e siga a cadeia de salto destacada.","Rules reference":"Referência de regras","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Regras Halma padrão para dois jogadores"},"ru":{"Halma":"Халма","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Бесплатная настольная игра 16×16 с цепочками прыжков","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Играйте в классическую Halma для двоих онлайн бесплатно. Перемещайте фигуры 19 по доске 16×16 с помощью шагов в восьми направлениях и цепных прыжков; играйте на локальном компьютере или в режиме «пассируй и играй».","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Мчитесь всеми 19 своих фигур в противоположный угловой лагерь. Шагните на одну клетку или перепрыгните через любую фигуру, а затем выполните еще несколько прыжков за один ход. Выскочившие фигуры остаются на доске.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Играть можно бесплатно. Доска и сохраненная игра остаются в браузере на этом устройстве; никакие игровые данные не загружаются.","Play Halma":"Играть в Халму","How a jump chain works":"Как работает прыжковая цепь","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Фишка может перепрыгнуть через соседнее занятое поле в пустое поле, находящееся непосредственно за ним. После приземления он может снова прыгнуть в другом направлении. Части, через которые он перепрыгнул, никогда не захватываются.","How to play":"Как играть","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"На этой странице используется стандартный вариант квадратной доски для двух игроков: сетка 16×16 и фигуры 19 в каждом из двух противоположных угловых лагерей. На своем ходу переместите одну фигуру на соседнюю пустую клетку в любом из восьми направлений или сделайте один или несколько последовательных прыжков с этой же фигурой. Вы можете остановить цепочку прыжков на любой площадке. Шаг и прыжок не могут быть совмещены в одном повороте. Заполните все квадраты в противоположном лагере, чтобы победить.","Frequently asked questions":"Часто задаваемые вопросы","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Прыжки захватывают фигуры?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Нет. Прыжок перемещает вашу фигуру только через соседнюю фигуру. Фигура, через которую перепрыгнули, остается на месте, независимо от того, принадлежит ли она вам или другому игроку.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Могу ли я совершить более одного прыжка за ход?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Да. Продолжайте использовать ту же фигуру над другой соседней фигурой до пустого квадрата. Вы можете завершить цепочку после любого приземления.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Могу ли я шагнуть, а затем прыгнуть за один ход?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Нет. Ход — это либо один соседний шаг, либо одна цепочка прыжков. Их нельзя совмещать.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Может ли фигура покинуть лагерь противника после его входа?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Нет. В этой версии фигура остается внутри лагеря назначения противника, как только она входит.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Есть ли у Халмы компьютерный противник?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Да. Выберите локальный компьютер или передайте одно и то же устройство между двумя людьми. Компьютер делает простой законный ход с этим устройством; это не онлайн-мультиплеер.","Rules and limitations":"Правила и ограничения","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Компьютерный противник использует облегченную эвристику локального прогресса, а не глубокий поиск или идеальную игру. Это квадратная настольная игра для двух игроков 16×16, а не китайские шашки в форме звезды. В этой версии три повторяющихся положения или предохранительный колпачок с поворотом 400 считаются ничьей.","Related tools":"Сопутствующие инструменты","Game mode":"Игровой режим","Play against the computer":"Играйте против компьютера","Two players on this device":"На этом устройстве два игрока","First turn":"Первый ход","Player 1 starts":"Игрок 1 запускается","Computer starts":"Компьютер запускается","Player 2 starts":"Игрок 2 запускается","New game":"Новая игра","Resume saved game":"Возобновить сохраненную игру","Delete saved game":"Удалить сохраненную игру","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Выберите режим и начните игру.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Плата Halma 16 от 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Строка {row}, столбец {column}","Player 1":"Игрок 1","Player 2":"Игрок 2","Computer":"Компьютер","empty":"пустой","Turn":"Поворот","Pieces in opposite camp":"Фрагменты в противоположном лагере","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Цель: заполнить лагерь в противоположном углу.","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Ваш ход: выберите одну из своих фигур, затем соседнюю пустую клетку или прыжок.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Деталь выбрана. Выберите доступный квадрат.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Доступен другой переход. Продолжайте прыгать или завершите поворот.","End jump chain":"Конец цепи прыжков","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Компьютер выбирает законный ход…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Передайте устройство следующему игроку.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Вы заполнили противоположный лагерь и победили!","Player 1 wins!":"Игрок 1 побеждает!","Player 2 wins!":"Игрок 2 побеждает!","The computer wins.":"Компьютер побеждает.","The game is a draw.":"Игра завершилась вничью.","New game started.":"Началась новая игра.","Game saved on this device.":"Игра сохранена на этом устройстве.","Saved game resumed.":"Сохраненная игра возобновлена.","Saved game deleted.":"Сохраненная игра удалена.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Этот браузер не может сохранять локально. Вы можете продолжать играть, пока эта страница остается открытой.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Сохраненная игра не может быть прочитана. Начните новую игру или удалите поврежденное сохранение.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Этот шаг незаконен. Выберите пустой квадрат и следуйте выделенной цепочке прыжков.","Rules reference":"Справочник правил","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Стандартные правила Халмы для двух игроков"},"sv":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Gratis 16×16 brädspel med hoppkedjor","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Spela klassiska Halma för två spelare online gratis. Flytta 19-bitar över en 16×16-bräda med steg i åtta riktningar och kedjade hopp; spela en lokal dator eller pass-and-play.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Kävla alla 19 av dina pjäser till det motsatta hörnet. Steg en ruta eller hoppa över valfri bit och kedja sedan fler humle i samma varv. Hoppade pjäser stannar på brädet.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis att spela. Brädan och det sparade spelet stannar i den här webbläsaren på den här enheten; ingen speldata laddas upp.","Play Halma":"Spela Halma","How a jump chain works":"Så fungerar en hoppkedja","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"En pjäs kan hoppa över en intilliggande upptagen ruta till den tomma rutan direkt bortom den. Efter landning kan den hoppa igen i en annan riktning. Bitarna den hoppade över fångas aldrig.","How to play":"Hur man spelar","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Den här sidan använder standardvarianten med fyrkantig bräda för två spelare: ett 16×16 rutnät och 19 pjäser i vart och ett av två motsatta hörnläger. På en tur, flytta en pjäs till en intilliggande tom ruta i någon av åtta riktningar, eller gör ett eller flera på varandra följande hopp med samma pjäs. Du kan stoppa en hoppkedja vid vilken landning som helst. Ett steg och ett hopp kan inte kombineras i ett varv. Fyll varje ruta i det motsatta lägret för att vinna.","Frequently asked questions":"Vanliga frågor","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Fångar hopp bitar?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Nr. Ett hopp flyttar bara din pjäs över en intilliggande pjäs. Pjäsen som hoppats över stannar där den är, oavsett om den tillhör dig eller den andra spelaren.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Kan jag göra mer än ett hopp i en sväng?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Ja. Fortsätt med samma bit över en annan intilliggande bit till en tom ruta. Du kan avsluta kedjan efter varje landning.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Kan jag stega och sedan hoppa i ett varv?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Nr. En sväng är antingen ett angränsande steg eller en hoppkedja. De går inte att kombinera.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Kan en pjäs lämna det motsatta lägret efter att den kommit in?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Nr. Denna version håller en pjäs i motståndarens destinationsläger när den kommer in.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Har Halma en datormotståndare?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Ja. Välj den lokala datorn eller skicka samma enhet mellan två personer. Datorn gör ett enkelt lagligt drag på den här enheten; det är inte online multiplayer.","Rules and limitations":"Regler och begränsningar","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Datormotståndaren använder en lätt lokal framstegsheuristik, inte djupsökning eller perfekt spel. Detta är 16×16 fyrkantigt brädspel för två spelare, inte stjärnformade kinesiska dam. Tre upprepade positioner eller en 400-sväng säkerhetslock behandlas som oavgjort i denna version.","Related tools":"Relaterade verktyg","Game mode":"Spelläge","Play against the computer":"Spela mot datorn","Two players on this device":"Två spelare på den här enheten","First turn":"Första sväng","Player 1 starts":"Spelare 1 startar","Computer starts":"Datorn startar","Player 2 starts":"Spelare 2 startar","New game":"Nytt spel","Resume saved game":"Återuppta sparat spel","Delete saved game":"Ta bort sparat spel","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Välj ett läge och starta ett spel.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 by 16 board","Row {row}, column {column}":"Rad {row}, kolumn {column}","Player 1":"Spelare 1","Player 2":"Spelare 2","Computer":"Dator","empty":"tom","Turn":"Vrid","Pieces in opposite camp":"Pjäser i motsatt läger","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Mål: fyll det motsatta hörnet","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Din tur: välj en av dina pjäser, sedan en intilliggande tom ruta eller ett hopp.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Stycke vald. Välj en ledig ruta.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"En annan hop är tillgänglig. Fortsätt hoppa eller avsluta svängen.","End jump chain":"Avsluta hoppkedjan","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Datorn väljer ett lagligt drag...","Pass the device to the next player.":"Överför enheten till nästa spelare.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Du fyllde det motsatta lägret och vann!","Player 1 wins!":"Spelare 1 vinner!","Player 2 wins!":"Spelare 2 vinner!","The computer wins.":"Datorn vinner.","The game is a draw.":"Spelet är oavgjort.","New game started.":"Nytt spel har startat.","Game saved on this device.":"Spelet har sparats på den här enheten.","Saved game resumed.":"Sparat spel återupptas.","Saved game deleted.":"Sparat spel raderat.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Denna webbläsare kan inte spara lokalt. Du kan fortsätta spela medan den här sidan är öppen.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Det sparade spelet kunde inte läsas. Starta ett nytt spel eller ta bort den skadade lagringen.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Det draget är inte lagligt. Välj en tom ruta och följ den markerade hoppkedjan.","Rules reference":"Referens","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Standard Halma-regler för två spelare"},"sw":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Mchezo Bila Malipo wa 16×16 na Minyororo ya Kuruka","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Cheza Halma ya wachezaji wawili wa kawaida mtandaoni bila malipo. Sogeza vipande vya 19 kwenye ubao wa 16×16 wenye hatua za mwelekeo nane na kuruka kwa minyororo; cheza kompyuta ya ndani au pasi-na-kucheza.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Mbio zote 19 za vipande vyako kwenye kambi ya kona iliyo kinyume. Hatua ya mraba moja au ruka juu ya kipande chochote, kisha unganisha miinuko mingi kwa zamu sawa. Vipande vilivyoruka hukaa kwenye ubao.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Bila kucheza. Ubao na mchezo uliohifadhiwa hukaa katika kivinjari hiki kwenye kifaa hiki; hakuna data ya mchezo iliyopakiwa.","Play Halma":"Cheza Halma","How a jump chain works":"Jinsi mnyororo wa kuruka unavyofanya kazi","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Kipande kinaweza kuruka juu ya mraba ulio karibu na kuingia kwenye mraba tupu moja kwa moja zaidi yake. Baada ya kutua, inaweza kuruka tena kuelekea upande mwingine. Vipande vilivyoruka juu havijakamatwa kamwe.","How to play":"Jinsi ya kucheza","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Ukurasa huu unatumia kibadala cha kawaida cha wachezaji wawili-ubao wa mraba: gridi ya 16×16 na vipande 19 katika kila kambi mbili za kona zilizo kinyume. Kwa zamu, sogeza kipande kimoja hadi kwenye mraba tupu ulio karibu katika pande nane, au tengeneza humle moja au zaidi mfululizo kwa kipande hicho. Unaweza kusimamisha mnyororo wa kurukaruka wakati wa kutua yoyote. Hatua na hop haziwezi kuunganishwa kwa zamu moja. Jaza kila mraba kwenye kambi iliyo kinyume ili kushinda.","Frequently asked questions":"Maswali yanayoulizwa mara kwa mara","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Je, anaruka vipande vipande?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Na. Kuruka kunasogeza kipande chako juu ya kipande kilicho karibu. Kipande kilichoruka kinabaki pale kilipo, iwe ni chako au mchezaji mwingine.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Je, ninaweza kuruka zaidi ya moja kwa zamu?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Ndiyo. Endelea na kipande sawa juu ya kipande kingine cha karibu kwenye mraba tupu. Unaweza kumaliza mnyororo baada ya kutua yoyote.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Je, ninaweza kupiga hatua na kisha kuruka kwa zamu moja?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Na. Zamu ni ama hatua moja iliyo karibu au mnyororo mmoja wa kuruka. Haziwezi kuunganishwa.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Je, kipande kinaweza kuondoka kwenye kambi iliyo kinyume baada ya kuingia?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Na. Toleo hili huweka kipande ndani ya kambi lengwa la mpinzani pindi linapoingia.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Je, Halma ana mpinzani wa kompyuta?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Ndiyo. Chagua kompyuta ya ndani au upitishe kifaa sawa kati ya watu wawili. Kompyuta hufanya hatua rahisi ya kisheria kwenye kifaa hiki; sio wachezaji wengi mtandaoni.","Rules and limitations":"Sheria na mapungufu","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Mpinzani wa kompyuta anatumia mbinu nyepesi ya maendeleo ya ndani, si utafutaji wa kina au uchezaji kamili. Huu ni mchezo wa ubao wa mraba wa 16×16 wa wachezaji wawili, si Checkers za Kichina zenye umbo la nyota. Nafasi tatu zinazorudiwa au kofia ya usalama ya 400 inachukuliwa kama droo katika toleo hili.","Related tools":"Vyombo vinavyohusiana","Game mode":"Njia ya mchezo","Play against the computer":"Cheza dhidi ya kompyuta","Two players on this device":"Wachezaji wawili kwenye kifaa hiki","First turn":"Zamu ya kwanza","Player 1 starts":"Mchezaji 1 anaanza","Computer starts":"Kompyuta inaanza","Player 2 starts":"Mchezaji 2 anaanza","New game":"Mchezo mpya","Resume saved game":"Endelea na mchezo uliohifadhiwa","Delete saved game":"Futa mchezo uliohifadhiwa","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Chagua modi na uanze mchezo.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 kwa bodi ya 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Safu {row}, safu {column}","Player 1":"Mchezaji 1","Player 2":"Mchezaji 2","Computer":"Kompyuta","empty":"tupu","Turn":"Washa","Pieces in opposite camp":"Vipande katika kambi kinyume","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Lengo: jaza kambi ya kona iliyo kinyume","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Zamu yako: chagua moja ya vipande vyako, kisha mraba tupu ulio karibu au kuruka.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Kipande kimechaguliwa. Chagua mraba unaopatikana.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Hop nyingine inapatikana. Endelea kuruka au kumaliza zamu.","End jump chain":"Maliza mlolongo wa kuruka","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Kompyuta inachagua hatua ya kisheria...","Pass the device to the next player.":"Peleka kifaa kwa kichezaji kinachofuata.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Ulijaza kambi iliyo kinyume na ukashinda!","Player 1 wins!":"Mchezaji 1 ameshinda!","Player 2 wins!":"Mchezaji 2 ameshinda!","The computer wins.":"Kompyuta itashinda.","The game is a draw.":"Mchezo ni wa sare.","New game started.":"Mchezo mpya umeanza.","Game saved on this device.":"Mchezo umehifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki.","Saved game resumed.":"Mchezo uliohifadhiwa umeanza tena.","Saved game deleted.":"Mchezo uliohifadhiwa umefutwa.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Kivinjari hiki hakiwezi kuhifadhi ndani ya nchi. Unaweza kuendelea kucheza ukurasa huu ukiwa wazi.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Mchezo uliohifadhiwa haukuweza kusomeka. Anzisha mchezo mpya au ufute hifadhi iliyoharibiwa.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Hatua hiyo si halali. Chagua mraba tupu na ufuate mlolongo wa kuruka ulioangaziwa.","Rules reference":"Marejeleo ya Kanuni","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Sheria za kawaida za Halma za wachezaji wawili"},"ta":{"Halma":"ஹல்மா","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"ஹால்மா ஆன்லைன் — இலவச 16×16 ஜம்ப் செயின்களுடன் போர்டு கேம்","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"கிளாசிக் டூ பிளேயர் ஹல்மாவை ஆன்லைனில் இலவசமாக விளையாடுங்கள். 19 துண்டுகளை ஒரு 16×16 போர்டு முழுவதும் எட்டு-திசை படிகள் மற்றும் சங்கிலித் தாவல்களுடன் நகர்த்தவும்; உள்ளூர் கம்ப்யூட்டரை இயக்கவும் அல்லது பாஸ்-அண்ட்-ப்ளே செய்யவும்.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"உங்கள் அனைத்து 19 துணுக்குகளையும் எதிர் மூலையில் உள்ள முகாமில் பந்தயம் செய்யுங்கள். ஒரு சதுரத்திற்கு அடியெடுத்து வைக்கவும் அல்லது ஏதேனும் ஒரு துண்டின் மேல் குதிக்கவும், பின்னர் அதே திருப்பத்தில் அதிக ஹாப்ஸை இணைக்கவும். குதித்த துண்டுகள் பலகையில் இருக்கும்.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"இலவசமாக விளையாடலாம். போர்டு மற்றும் சேமித்த கேம் இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் இந்த உலாவியில் இருக்கும்; விளையாட்டு தரவு பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை.","Play Halma":"ஹல்மாவை விளையாடு","How a jump chain works":"ஜம்ப் செயின் எப்படி வேலை செய்கிறது","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"ஒரு துண்டு அருகில் உள்ள ஆக்கிரமிக்கப்பட்ட சதுரத்தின் மீது நேரடியாக அதற்கு அப்பால் உள்ள வெற்று சதுரத்திற்குள் செல்ல முடியும். தரையிறங்கிய பிறகு, அது மீண்டும் வேறு திசையில் செல்லக்கூடும். அது குதித்த துண்டுகள் ஒருபோதும் கைப்பற்றப்படவில்லை.","How to play":"எப்படி விளையாடுவது","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"இந்தப் பக்கம் நிலையான இரண்டு-பிளேயர் ஸ்கொயர்-போர்டு மாறுபாட்டைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது: ஒரு 16×16 கட்டம் மற்றும் 19 துண்டுகள் இரண்டு எதிர் மூலை முகாம்களில் ஒவ்வொன்றிலும். ஒரு திருப்பத்தில், எட்டு திசைகளில் ஏதேனும் ஒன்றில் அருகிலுள்ள காலியான சதுரத்திற்கு ஒரு பகுதியை நகர்த்தவும் அல்லது அதே துண்டுடன் ஒன்று அல்லது அதற்கு மேற்பட்ட தொடர்ச்சியான ஹாப்ஸை உருவாக்கவும். எந்த தரையிறக்கத்திலும் நீங்கள் ஒரு ஹாப் சங்கிலியை நிறுத்தலாம். ஒரு படி மற்றும் ஒரு ஹாப் ஒரு திருப்பத்தில் இணைக்க முடியாது. வெற்றிபெற எதிர் முகாமில் உள்ள ஒவ்வொரு சதுரத்தையும் நிரப்பவும்.","Frequently asked questions":"அடிக்கடி கேட்கப்படும் கேள்விகள்","Do jumps capture pieces?":"ஜம்ப்ஸ் காய்களைப் பிடிக்குமா?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"எண். ஒரு ஜம்ப் உங்கள் துண்டை அருகிலுள்ள துண்டின் மீது மட்டுமே நகர்த்துகிறது. குதித்த துண்டு, அது உங்களுக்கோ அல்லது மற்ற வீரருக்கோ சொந்தமாக இருந்தாலும், அது இருக்கும் இடத்திலேயே இருக்கும்.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"திருப்பத்தில் ஒன்றுக்கு மேற்பட்ட குதிக்க முடியுமா?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"ஆம். அதே துண்டுடன் மற்றொரு அருகிலுள்ள துண்டின் மீது வெற்று சதுரமாக தொடரவும். எந்த தரையிறங்கிய பிறகும் நீங்கள் சங்கிலியை முடிக்கலாம்.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"நான் அடியெடுத்து வைத்துவிட்டு ஒரு திருப்பத்தில் குதிக்கலாமா?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"எண். ஒரு திருப்பம் என்பது அருகிலுள்ள ஒரு படி அல்லது ஒரு ஜம்ப் செயின் ஆகும். அவற்றை இணைக்க முடியாது.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"ஒரு துண்டு உள்ளே நுழைந்த பிறகு எதிர் முகாமிலிருந்து வெளியேற முடியுமா?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"எண். இந்தப் பதிப்பு எதிராளியின் இலக்கு முகாமுக்குள் நுழைந்தவுடன் ஒரு பகுதியை வைத்திருக்கிறது.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"ஹல்மாவுக்கு கணினி எதிர்ப்பாளர் உள்ளதா?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"ஆம். லோக்கல் கம்ப்யூட்டரைத் தேர்வு செய்யவும் அல்லது ஒரே சாதனத்தை இருவர் இடையே அனுப்பவும். கணினி இந்த சாதனத்தில் ஒரு எளிய சட்ட நகர்வை செய்கிறது; இது ஆன்லைன் மல்டிபிளேயர் அல்ல.","Rules and limitations":"விதிகளும் வரம்புகளும்","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"கணினி எதிர்ப்பாளர் ஒரு இலகுரக உள்ளூர் முன்னேற்ற ஹூரிஸ்டிக்கைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறார், ஆழமான தேடல் அல்லது சரியான விளையாட்டு அல்ல. இது இரண்டு வீரர் 16×16 சதுர பலகை விளையாட்டு, நட்சத்திர வடிவ சீன செக்கர்ஸ் அல்ல. மூன்று தொடர்ச்சியான நிலைகள் அல்லது 400-டர்ன் பாதுகாப்பு தொப்பி இந்தப் பதிப்பில் டிராவாகக் கருதப்படுகிறது.","Related tools":"தொடர்புடைய கருவிகள்","Game mode":"கேம் பயன்முறை","Play against the computer":"கணினிக்கு எதிராக விளையாடு","Two players on this device":"இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் இரண்டு பிளேயர்கள்","First turn":"முதல் திருப்பம்","Player 1 starts":"பிளேயர் 1 தொடங்குகிறது","Computer starts":"கணினி தொடங்குகிறது","Player 2 starts":"பிளேயர் 2 தொடங்குகிறது","New game":"புதிய கேம்","Resume saved game":"சேமித்த விளையாட்டை மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்","Delete saved game":"சேமித்த கேமை நீக்கு","Choose a mode and start a game.":"ஒரு பயன்முறையைத் தேர்ந்தெடுத்து விளையாட்டைத் தொடங்கவும்.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"ஹல்மா 16 by 16 போர்டு","Row {row}, column {column}":"வரிசை {row}, நெடுவரிசை {column}","Player 1":"வீரர் 1","Player 2":"வீரர் 2","Computer":"கணினி","empty":"காலி","Turn":"திருப்பு","Pieces in opposite camp":"எதிர் முகாமில் உள்ள துண்டுகள்","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"இலக்கு: எதிர் மூலை முகாமை நிரப்பவும்","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"உங்கள் முறை: உங்களின் துணுக்குகளில் ஒன்றைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும், அதன் பிறகு அருகில் உள்ள வெற்று சதுரம் அல்லது ஒரு ஜம்ப்.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"துண்டு தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்டது. கிடைக்கக்கூடிய சதுரத்தைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"மற்றொரு ஹாப் உள்ளது. குதிப்பதைத் தொடரவும் அல்லது திருப்பத்தை முடிக்கவும்.","End jump chain":"ஜம்ப் சங்கிலியை முடிக்கவும்","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"கணினி சட்டப்பூர்வ நகர்வைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கிறது...","Pass the device to the next player.":"சாதனத்தை அடுத்த பிளேயருக்கு அனுப்பவும்.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"எதிர் முகாமை நிரப்பி வெற்றி பெற்றீர்கள்!","Player 1 wins!":"பிளேயர் 1 வெற்றி!","Player 2 wins!":"பிளேயர் 2 வெற்றி!","The computer wins.":"கணினி வெற்றி பெறுகிறது.","The game is a draw.":"விளையாட்டு சமநிலையில் உள்ளது.","New game started.":"புதிய கேம் தொடங்கியது.","Game saved on this device.":"இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் கேம் சேமிக்கப்பட்டது.","Saved game resumed.":"சேமிக்கப்பட்ட கேம் மீண்டும் தொடங்கப்பட்டது.","Saved game deleted.":"சேமிக்கப்பட்ட கேம் நீக்கப்பட்டது.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"இந்த உலாவி உள்நாட்டில் சேமிக்க முடியாது. இந்தப் பக்கம் திறந்திருக்கும் போது நீங்கள் தொடர்ந்து விளையாடலாம்.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"சேமித்த கேமை படிக்க முடியவில்லை. புதிய கேமைத் தொடங்கவும் அல்லது சேதமடைந்த சேமிப்பை நீக்கவும்.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"அந்த நடவடிக்கை சட்டப்பூர்வமானது அல்ல. வெற்று சதுரத்தைத் தேர்ந்தெடுத்து, ஹைலைட் செய்யப்பட்ட ஜம்ப் செயினைப் பின்தொடரவும்.","Rules reference":"விதிகளின் குறிப்பு","Standard two-player Halma rules":"ஸ்டாண்டர்ட் டூ பிளேயர் ஹல்மா விதிகள்"},"te":{"Halma":"హల్మా","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"హల్మా ఆన్‌లైన్ — జంప్ చైన్‌లతో ఉచిత 16×16 బోర్డ్ గేమ్","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"క్లాసిక్ టూ-ప్లేయర్ హల్మాను ఆన్‌లైన్‌లో ఉచితంగా ప్లే చేయండి. 19 ముక్కలను 16×16 బోర్డ్‌లో ఎనిమిది-దిశల దశలు మరియు చైన్డ్ జంప్‌లతో తరలించండి; స్థానిక కంప్యూటర్ లేదా పాస్-అండ్-ప్లే ప్లే చేయండి.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"మీ అన్ని 19 ముక్కలను ఎదురుగా ఉన్న కార్నర్ క్యాంప్‌లోకి రేస్ చేయండి. ఒక చతురస్రాకారంలో అడుగు వేయండి లేదా ఏదైనా ముక్కపైకి ఎక్కండి, ఆపై అదే మలుపులో మరిన్ని హాప్‌లను చైన్ చేయండి. జంప్డ్ ముక్కలు బోర్డు మీద ఉంటాయి.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"ప్లే చేయడానికి ఉచితం. బోర్డ్ మరియు సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్ ఈ పరికరంలోని ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో ఉంటాయి; గేమ్ డేటా అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడలేదు.","Play Halma":"హల్మా ప్లే చేయండి","How a jump chain works":"జంప్ చైన్ ఎలా పనిచేస్తుంది","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"ఒక ముక్క ప్రక్కనే ఉన్న ఆక్రమిత చతురస్రంపై నేరుగా దాని అవతల ఉన్న ఖాళీ చతురస్రంలోకి దూసుకుపోతుంది. ల్యాండింగ్ తర్వాత, అది మరొక దిశలో మళ్లీ దూకవచ్చు. అది దూకిన ముక్కలు ఎప్పటికీ పట్టుబడవు.","How to play":"ఎలా ఆడాలి","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"ఈ పేజీ స్టాండర్డ్ టూ-ప్లేయర్ స్క్వేర్-బోర్డ్ వేరియంట్‌ను ఉపయోగిస్తుంది: రెండు వ్యతిరేక మూలల క్యాంపుల్లో ప్రతిదానిలో 16×16 గ్రిడ్ మరియు 19 ముక్కలు. ఒక మలుపులో, ఒక భాగాన్ని ఎనిమిది దిశలలో ఏదైనా ఒక ప్రక్కనే ఉన్న ఖాళీ చతురస్రానికి తరలించండి లేదా అదే ముక్కతో ఒకటి లేదా అంతకంటే ఎక్కువ వరుస హాప్‌లను చేయండి. మీరు ఏదైనా ల్యాండింగ్ వద్ద హాప్ చైన్‌ను ఆపవచ్చు. ఒక స్టెప్ మరియు హాప్ ఒక మలుపులో కలపడం సాధ్యం కాదు. గెలవడానికి వ్యతిరేక శిబిరంలోని ప్రతి చతురస్రాన్ని పూరించండి.","Frequently asked questions":"తరచుగా అడిగే ప్రశ్నలు","Do jumps capture pieces?":"జంప్‌లు ముక్కలను సంగ్రహిస్తాయా?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"నం. ఒక జంప్ మీ భాగాన్ని ప్రక్కనే ఉన్న ముక్కపై మాత్రమే కదిలిస్తుంది. పావు జంప్ ఓవర్ అది మీకు లేదా ఇతర ఆటగాడికి చెందినదైనా అది ఉన్న చోటనే ఉంటుంది.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"నేను ఒక మలుపులో ఒకటి కంటే ఎక్కువ జంప్ చేయవచ్చా?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"అవును. ఖాళీ చతురస్రాకారంలో మరొక ప్రక్కనే ఉన్న ముక్కపై అదే భాగాన్ని కొనసాగించండి. ఏదైనా ల్యాండింగ్ తర్వాత మీరు గొలుసును ముగించవచ్చు.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"నేను అడుగు వేసి ఒక్క మలుపులో దూకవచ్చా?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"నం. మలుపు ఒక ప్రక్కనే ఉన్న ఒక అడుగు లేదా ఒక జంప్ చైన్. వాటిని కలపడం సాధ్యం కాదు.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"ఒక ముక్క ప్రవేశించిన తర్వాత ఎదురుగా ఉన్న శిబిరాన్ని వదిలివేయవచ్చా?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"నం. ఈ సంస్కరణ ప్రత్యర్థి గమ్యస్థాన శిబిరంలోకి ప్రవేశించిన తర్వాత దానిలో భాగాన్ని ఉంచుతుంది.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"హల్మాకు కంప్యూటర్ ప్రత్యర్థి ఉందా?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"అవును. స్థానిక కంప్యూటర్‌ను ఎంచుకోండి లేదా ఇద్దరు వ్యక్తుల మధ్య ఒకే పరికరాన్ని పాస్ చేయండి. కంప్యూటర్ ఈ పరికరంలో సాధారణ చట్టపరమైన కదలికను చేస్తుంది; ఇది ఆన్‌లైన్ మల్టీప్లేయర్ కాదు.","Rules and limitations":"నియమాలు మరియు పరిమితులు","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"కంప్యూటర్ ప్రత్యర్థి తేలికపాటి లోకల్ ప్రోగ్రెస్ హ్యూరిస్టిక్‌ని ఉపయోగిస్తాడు, లోతైన శోధన లేదా ఖచ్చితమైన ఆట కాదు. ఇది ఇద్దరు ఆటగాళ్ల 16×16 స్క్వేర్-బోర్డ్ గేమ్, స్టార్ ఆకారంలో ఉన్న చైనీస్ చెకర్స్ కాదు. మూడు పునరావృత స్థానాలు లేదా 400-టర్న్ సేఫ్టీ క్యాప్ ఈ వెర్షన్‌లో డ్రాగా పరిగణించబడుతుంది.","Related tools":"సంబంధిత సాధనాలు","Game mode":"గేమ్ మోడ్","Play against the computer":"కంప్యూటర్‌కి వ్యతిరేకంగా ప్లే చేయండి","Two players on this device":"ఈ పరికరంలో ఇద్దరు ప్లేయర్‌లు ఉన్నారు","First turn":"మొదటి మలుపు","Player 1 starts":"ప్లేయర్ 1 ప్రారంభమవుతుంది","Computer starts":"కంప్యూటర్ ప్రారంభమవుతుంది","Player 2 starts":"ప్లేయర్ 2 ప్రారంభమవుతుంది","New game":"కొత్త గేమ్","Resume saved game":"సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్‌ను పునఃప్రారంభించండి","Delete saved game":"సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్‌ను తొలగించండి","Choose a mode and start a game.":"మోడ్‌ని ఎంచుకుని, గేమ్‌ని ప్రారంభించండి.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"16 బోర్డు ద్వారా హల్మా 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"అడ్డు వరుస {row}, కాలమ్ {column}","Player 1":"ప్లేయర్ 1","Player 2":"ప్లేయర్ 2","Computer":"కంప్యూటర్","empty":"ఖాళీ","Turn":"మలుపు","Pieces in opposite camp":"ఎదురు శిబిరంలో ముక్కలు","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"లక్ష్యం: ఎదురుగా ఉన్న కార్నర్ క్యాంపును పూరించండి","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"మీ వంతు: మీ ముక్కల్లో ఒకదాన్ని ఎంచుకోండి, ఆపై పక్కనే ఉన్న ఖాళీ చతురస్రం లేదా జంప్.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"పీస్ ఎంచుకోబడింది. అందుబాటులో ఉన్న చతురస్రాన్ని ఎంచుకోండి.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"మరొక హాప్ అందుబాటులో ఉంది. దూకడం కొనసాగించండి లేదా మలుపును ముగించండి.","End jump chain":"జంప్ చైన్‌ని ముగించండి","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"కంప్యూటర్ చట్టపరమైన తరలింపును ఎంచుకుంటుంది…","Pass the device to the next player.":"పరికరాన్ని తదుపరి ప్లేయర్‌కు పంపండి.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"మీరు వ్యతిరేక శిబిరాన్ని నింపారు మరియు గెలిచారు!","Player 1 wins!":"ప్లేయర్ 1 విజయాలు!","Player 2 wins!":"ప్లేయర్ 2 విజయాలు!","The computer wins.":"కంప్యూటర్ గెలుస్తుంది.","The game is a draw.":"ఆట డ్రాగా ఉంది.","New game started.":"కొత్త గేమ్ ప్రారంభించబడింది.","Game saved on this device.":"గేమ్ ఈ పరికరంలో సేవ్ చేయబడింది.","Saved game resumed.":"సేవ్ చేయబడిన గేమ్ మళ్లీ ప్రారంభించబడింది.","Saved game deleted.":"సేవ్ చేయబడిన గేమ్ తొలగించబడింది.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్ స్థానికంగా సేవ్ చేయదు. ఈ పేజీ తెరిచి ఉన్నప్పుడు మీరు ప్లే చేయడం కొనసాగించవచ్చు.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్ చదవడం సాధ్యపడలేదు. కొత్త గేమ్‌ను ప్రారంభించండి లేదా దెబ్బతిన్న సేవ్‌ను తొలగించండి.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"ఆ తరలింపు చట్టబద్ధం కాదు. ఖాళీ చతురస్రాన్ని ఎంచుకుని, హైలైట్ చేసిన జంప్ చైన్‌ని అనుసరించండి.","Rules reference":"నియమాల సూచన","Standard two-player Halma rules":"స్టాండర్డ్ టూ-ప్లేయర్ హల్మా నియమాలు"},"th":{"Halma":"ฮาลมา","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — ฟรีเกมกระดาน 16×16 พร้อม Jump Chains","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"เล่น Halma ผู้เล่นสองคนสุดคลาสสิกออนไลน์ฟรี ย้ายชิ้นส่วน 19 ไปบนกระดาน 16×16 ที่มีขั้นตอนแปดทิศทางและการกระโดดแบบโซ่ เล่นเครื่องคอมพิวเตอร์หรือผ่านและเล่น","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"แข่ง 19 ทุกชิ้นของคุณไปที่แคมป์มุมตรงข้าม ก้าวหนึ่งช่องสี่เหลี่ยมหรือกระโดดข้ามชิ้นส่วนใดๆ จากนั้นต่อโซ่เพิ่มในเทิร์นเดียวกัน ชิ้นส่วนที่กระโดดจะยังคงอยู่บนกระดาน","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"เล่นฟรี บอร์ดและเกมที่บันทึกไว้จะยังคงอยู่ในเบราว์เซอร์นี้บนอุปกรณ์นี้ ไม่มีการอัพโหลดข้อมูลเกม","Play Halma":"เล่นฮาลมา","How a jump chain works":"วิธีการทำงานของโซ่กระโดด","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"ชิ้นส่วนสามารถกระโดดข้ามสี่เหลี่ยมจัตุรัสที่ถูกยึดครองที่อยู่ติดกัน เข้าไปในสี่เหลี่ยมว่างเปล่าที่อยู่เลยออกไปโดยตรง หลังจากลงจอดแล้วอาจกระโดดอีกครั้งในทิศทางอื่น ชิ้นส่วนที่มันกระโดดข้ามจะไม่ถูกจับ","How to play":"วิธีการเล่น","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"หน้านี้ใช้รูปแบบกระดานสี่เหลี่ยมมาตรฐานสำหรับผู้เล่นสองคน: ชิ้นตาราง 16×16 และชิ้น 19 ในแต่ละแคมป์สองมุมที่อยู่ตรงข้ามกัน ในเทิร์นหนึ่ง ย้ายชิ้นหนึ่งไปยังสี่เหลี่ยมว่างที่อยู่ติดกันในแปดทิศทางใดก็ได้ หรือทำการกระโดดต่อเนื่องกันหนึ่งชิ้นขึ้นไปด้วยชิ้นเดียวกันนั้น คุณสามารถหยุดห่วงโซ่ฮอปเมื่อลงจอดที่ไหนก็ได้ สเต็ปและฮอปไม่สามารถรวมกันได้ในเทิร์นเดียว เติมทุกช่องในค่ายฝั่งตรงข้ามเพื่อชนะ","Frequently asked questions":"คำถามที่พบบ่อย","Do jumps capture pieces?":"การกระโดดจับชิ้นส่วนหรือไม่","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"No. การกระโดดจะเคลื่อนหมากของคุณไปเหนือหมากที่อยู่ติดกันเท่านั้น ชิ้นส่วนที่กระโดดข้ามจะยังคงอยู่ในตำแหน่งที่มันอยู่ ไม่ว่าจะเป็นของคุณหรือผู้เล่นคนอื่นก็ตาม","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"ฉันสามารถกระโดดมากกว่าหนึ่งครั้งได้หรือไม่","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"ใช่ ดำเนินการต่อด้วยชิ้นเดียวกันบนอีกชิ้นที่อยู่ติดกันเป็นสี่เหลี่ยมว่างเปล่า คุณสามารถจบโซ่ได้หลังจากลงจอด","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"ฉันสามารถก้าวแล้วกระโดดในเทิร์นเดียวได้หรือไม่?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"No. การเลี้ยวคือขั้นตอนเดียวที่อยู่ติดกันหรือห่วงโซ่กระโดดหนึ่งอัน ไม่สามารถรวมกันได้","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"ชิ้นส่วนสามารถออกจากแคมป์ฝั่งตรงข้ามหลังจากที่เข้าไปได้หรือไม่?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"No. เวอร์ชันนี้จะเก็บชิ้นส่วนไว้ในแคมป์ปลายทางของคู่ต่อสู้ทันทีที่เข้ามา","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Halma มีคู่แข่งทางคอมพิวเตอร์หรือไม่?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"ใช่ เลือกเครื่องคอมพิวเตอร์หรือส่งอุปกรณ์เดียวกันระหว่างคนสองคน คอมพิวเตอร์ดำเนินการทางกฎหมายบนอุปกรณ์นี้อย่างง่ายดาย มันไม่ใช่ผู้เล่นหลายคนออนไลน์","Rules and limitations":"กฎและข้อจำกัด","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"ฝ่ายตรงข้ามที่ใช้คอมพิวเตอร์ใช้การวิเคราะห์ความก้าวหน้าในท้องถิ่นแบบบางเบา ไม่ใช่การค้นหาเชิงลึกหรือการเล่นที่สมบูรณ์แบบ นี่คือเกมกระดานสี่เหลี่ยม 16×16 ที่มีผู้เล่นสองคน ไม่ใช่หมากฮอสจีนรูปดาว ตำแหน่งที่ทำซ้ำสามตำแหน่งหรือฝาปิดนิรภัยแบบหมุน 400 จะถือเป็นการเสมอกันในเวอร์ชันนี้","Related tools":"เครื่องมือที่เกี่ยวข้อง","Game mode":"โหมดเกม","Play against the computer":"เล่นกับคอมพิวเตอร์","Two players on this device":"ผู้เล่นสองคนบนอุปกรณ์นี้","First turn":"เทิร์นแรก","Player 1 starts":"ผู้เล่น 1 เริ่มต้นขึ้น","Computer starts":"คอมพิวเตอร์เริ่มทำงาน","Player 2 starts":"ผู้เล่น 2 เริ่มต้นขึ้น","New game":"เกมใหม่","Resume saved game":"เล่นเกมที่บันทึกไว้ต่อ","Delete saved game":"ลบเกมที่บันทึกไว้","Choose a mode and start a game.":"เลือกโหมดและเริ่มเกม","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 โดยบอร์ด 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"แถว {row} คอลัมน์ {column}","Player 1":"ผู้เล่น 1","Player 2":"ผู้เล่น 2","Computer":"คอมพิวเตอร์","empty":"ว่างเปล่า","Turn":"เทิร์น","Pieces in opposite camp":"ชิ้นตรงข้ามค่าย","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"เป้าหมาย: เติมแคมป์มุมตรงข้าม","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"ตาของคุณ: เลือกชิ้นส่วนของคุณหนึ่งชิ้น จากนั้นเลือกสี่เหลี่ยมว่างที่อยู่ติดกันหรือกระโดด","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"เลือกชิ้นแล้ว. เลือกสี่เหลี่ยมที่มี","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"มีฮอปอีกอันให้เลือก กระโดดต่อหรือจบเทิร์น","End jump chain":"เอนด์จั๊มโซ่","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"คอมพิวเตอร์กำลังเลือกการเคลื่อนไหวทางกฎหมาย...","Pass the device to the next player.":"ส่งต่ออุปกรณ์ไปยังเครื่องเล่นถัดไป","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"คุณเติมแคมป์ฝั่งตรงข้ามแล้วชนะ!","Player 1 wins!":"ผู้เล่น 1 ชนะ!","Player 2 wins!":"ผู้เล่น 2 ชนะ!","The computer wins.":"คอมพิวเตอร์ชนะ","The game is a draw.":"เกมนี้เสมอกัน","New game started.":"เกมใหม่เริ่มแล้ว","Game saved on this device.":"บันทึกเกมบนอุปกรณ์นี้","Saved game resumed.":"เกมที่บันทึกไว้กลับมาทำงานต่อ","Saved game deleted.":"เกมที่บันทึกไว้ถูกลบแล้ว","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"เบราว์เซอร์นี้ไม่สามารถบันทึกในเครื่องได้ คุณสามารถเล่นต่อได้ในขณะที่หน้านี้ยังเปิดอยู่","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"ไม่สามารถอ่านเกมที่บันทึกไว้ได้ เริ่มเกมใหม่หรือลบบันทึกที่เสียหาย","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"การเคลื่อนไหวนั้นไม่ถูกกฎหมาย เลือกสี่เหลี่ยมว่างแล้วเดินตามห่วงโซ่กระโดดที่ไฮไลต์","Rules reference":"การอ้างอิงกฎ","Standard two-player Halma rules":"กฎมาตรฐานสำหรับผู้เล่นสองคนของ Halma"},"tl":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Libreng 16×16 Board Game na may Jump Chain","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Maglaro ng klasikong two-player na Halma online ng libre. Ilipat ang mga piraso ng 19 sa isang 16×16 na board na may walong direksyon na mga hakbang at mga nakakadena na pagtalon; maglaro ng lokal na computer o pass-and-play.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Race ang lahat ng 19 ng iyong mga piraso papunta sa tapat ng kampo sa sulok. Hakbang ng isang parisukat o lumukso sa anumang piraso, pagkatapos ay i-chain ang higit pang mga hop sa parehong pagliko. Ang mga tumalon na piraso ay manatili sa pisara.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Libreng laruin. Ang board at naka-save na laro ay mananatili sa browser na ito sa device na ito; walang na-upload na data ng laro.","Play Halma":"Laruin ang Halma","How a jump chain works":"Paano gumagana ang jump chain","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Maaaring tumalon ang isang piraso sa isang katabing inookupahan na parisukat papunta sa bakanteng parisukat nang direkta sa kabila nito. Pagkatapos mag-landing, maaari itong lumukso muli sa ibang direksyon. Ang mga pirasong tinalon nito ay hindi kailanman nakuhanan.","How to play":"Paano laruin","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Gumagamit ang page na ito ng karaniwang two-player square-board na variant: isang 16×16 grid at 19 na mga piraso sa bawat isa sa dalawang magkasalungat na kampo sa sulok. Sa isang pagliko, ilipat ang isang piraso sa isang katabing bakanteng parisukat sa alinman sa walong direksyon, o gumawa ng isa o higit pang magkakasunod na paglukso gamit ang parehong piraso. Maaari mong ihinto ang isang hop chain sa anumang landing. Ang isang hakbang at isang paglukso ay hindi maaaring pagsamahin sa isang pagliko. Punan ang bawat parisukat sa tapat ng kampo upang manalo.","Frequently asked questions":"Mga madalas itanong","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Nakakakuha ba ng mga piraso ang jumps?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Hindi. Ang isang pagtalon ay gumagalaw lamang sa iyong piraso sa isang katabing piraso. Ang pirasong tumalon ay nananatili kung nasaan ito, kung ito man ay sa iyo o sa ibang manlalaro.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Maaari ba akong gumawa ng higit sa isang pagtalon sa isang pagliko?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Oo. Magpatuloy sa parehong piraso sa ibabaw ng isa pang katabing piraso sa isang walang laman na parisukat. Maaari mong tapusin ang kadena pagkatapos ng anumang landing.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Maaari ba akong humakbang at pagkatapos ay tumalon sa isang pagliko?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Hindi. Ang pagliko ay alinman sa isang katabing hakbang o isang jump chain. Hindi sila maaaring pagsamahin.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Maaari bang umalis ang isang piraso sa kabilang kampo pagkatapos nitong makapasok?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Hindi. Ang bersyon na ito ay nagpapanatili ng isang piraso sa loob ng destinasyong kampo ng kalaban kapag ito ay pumasok.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"May kalaban ba sa computer si Halma?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Oo. Piliin ang lokal na computer o ipasa ang parehong device sa pagitan ng dalawang tao. Ang computer ay gumagawa ng isang simpleng legal na hakbang sa device na ito; hindi ito online multiplayer.","Rules and limitations":"Mga panuntunan at limitasyon","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Gumagamit ang kalaban sa computer ng isang magaan na lokal na pag-unlad na heuristic, hindi malalim na paghahanap o perpektong paglalaro. Ito ang two-player na 16×16 square-board game, hindi hugis-star na Chinese Checkers. Ang tatlong paulit-ulit na posisyon o isang 400-turn safety cap ay itinuturing bilang isang draw sa bersyong ito.","Related tools":"Mga kaugnay na tool","Game mode":"Game mode","Play against the computer":"Maglaro laban sa computer","Two players on this device":"Dalawang manlalaro sa device na ito","First turn":"Unang pagliko","Player 1 starts":"Magsisimula ang Manlalaro na 1","Computer starts":"Nagsisimula ang computer","Player 2 starts":"Magsisimula ang Manlalaro 2","New game":"Bagong laro","Resume saved game":"Ipagpatuloy ang naka-save na laro","Delete saved game":"Tanggalin ang naka-save na laro","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Pumili ng mode at magsimula ng laro.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 ng 16 board","Row {row}, column {column}":"Row {row}, column {column}","Player 1":"Manlalaro 1","Player 2":"Manlalaro 2","Computer":"Computer","empty":"walang laman","Turn":"Lumiko","Pieces in opposite camp":"Mga piraso sa tapat ng kampo","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Layunin: punan ang tapat ng kampo sa sulok","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Iyong turn: pumili ng isa sa iyong mga piraso, pagkatapos ay isang katabing bakanteng parisukat o isang tumalon.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Piraso ang napili. Pumili ng magagamit na parisukat.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Available ang isa pang hop. Ipagpatuloy ang paglukso o tapusin ang pagliko.","End jump chain":"End jump chain","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Ang computer ay pumipili ng legal na hakbang...","Pass the device to the next player.":"Ipasa ang device sa susunod na player.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Napunan mo ang kabilang kampo at nanalo!","Player 1 wins!":"Panalo ang Manlalaro na 1!","Player 2 wins!":"Panalo ang Manlalaro na 2!","The computer wins.":"Nanalo ang computer.","The game is a draw.":"Ang laro ay isang draw.","New game started.":"Nagsimula ang bagong laro.","Game saved on this device.":"Na-save ang laro sa device na ito.","Saved game resumed.":"Ipinagpatuloy ang naka-save na laro.","Saved game deleted.":"Na-delete na ang naka-save na laro.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Hindi maaaring mag-save nang lokal ang browser na ito. Maaari kang magpatuloy sa paglalaro habang nananatiling bukas ang page na ito.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Hindi mabasa ang naka-save na laro. Magsimula ng bagong laro o tanggalin ang nasirang save.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Hindi legal ang paglipat na iyon. Pumili ng walang laman na parisukat at sundin ang naka-highlight na jump chain.","Rules reference":"Sanggunian sa mga panuntunan","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Mga karaniwang panuntunan ng Halma ng dalawang manlalaro"},"tr":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — Atlama Zincirleriyle Ücretsiz 16×16 Masa Oyunu","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Klasik iki oyunculu Halma'yı ücretsiz çevrimiçi oynayın. 19 parçalarını sekiz yönlü adımlarla ve zincirleme atlamalarla 16×16 tahtası üzerinde hareket ettirin; yerel bir bilgisayarda oynayın veya pass-and-play yapın.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"19 parçanızın tamamını karşı köşe kampına doğru yarışın. Bir kare adım atın veya herhangi bir parçanın üzerinden atlayın, ardından aynı sırada daha fazla atlama yapın. Atlanan parçalar tahtanın üzerinde kalır.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Oynaması ücretsiz. Pano ve kaydedilen oyun bu cihazdaki bu tarayıcıda kalır; hiçbir oyun verisi yüklenmedi.","Play Halma":"Halma'yı oyna","How a jump chain works":"Atlama zinciri nasıl çalışır?","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Bir taş, bitişikteki işgal edilmiş karenin üzerinden doğrudan arkasındaki boş kareye atlayabilir. İndikten sonra tekrar başka bir yöne sıçrayabilir. Üzerinden atladığı parçalar asla ele geçirilmez.","How to play":"Nasıl oynanır","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Bu sayfada standart iki oyunculu kare tahta çeşidi kullanılmaktadır: 16×16 ızgarası ve iki karşıt köşe kampının her birinde 19 parçaları. Dönüşte, bir taşı sekiz yönden herhangi bir yönde bitişikteki boş kareye taşıyın veya aynı taşla bir veya daha fazla ardışık atlama yapın. Herhangi bir inişte bir atlama zincirini durdurabilirsiniz. Bir adım ve bir atlama tek turda birleştirilemez. Kazanmak için karşı kamptaki her kareyi doldurun.","Frequently asked questions":"Sıkça sorulan sorular","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Sıçrayışlar parçaları yakalar mı?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Hayır. Bir sıçrama, parçanızı yalnızca bitişik bir parçanın üzerinden hareket ettirir. Üzerinden atlanan taş ister size, ister karşı oyuncuya ait olsun, olduğu yerde kalır.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Bir turda birden fazla atlama yapabilir miyim?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Evet. Aynı parçayı başka bir bitişik parçanın üzerinden boş bir kareye doğru devam edin. Herhangi bir inişten sonra zinciri sonlandırabilirsiniz.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Bir turda adım atıp atlayabilir miyim?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Hayır. Bir dönüş ya bitişik bir adımdır ya da bir atlama zinciridir. Birleştirilemezler.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Bir parça girdikten sonra karşı kamptan çıkabilir mi?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Hayır. Bu versiyon, bir parçayı rakibin hedef kampına girdikten sonra içinde tutar.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Halma'nın bilgisayar rakibi var mı?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Evet. Yerel bilgisayarı seçin veya aynı cihazı iki kişi arasında geçirin. Bilgisayar bu cihaz üzerinde basit bir yasal hamle yapar; çevrimiçi çok oyunculu değil.","Rules and limitations":"Kurallar ve sınırlamalar","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Bilgisayar rakibi, derin arama veya mükemmel oyun yerine hafif bir yerel ilerleme buluşsal yöntemi kullanıyor. Bu, yıldız şeklindeki Çin Daması değil, iki oyunculu 16×16 kare tahta oyunudur. Bu versiyonda tekrarlanan üç konum veya 400 dönüşlü emniyet kapağı çekme işlemi olarak kabul edilir.","Related tools":"İlgili araçlar","Game mode":"Oyun modu","Play against the computer":"Bilgisayara karşı oyna","Two players on this device":"Bu cihazda iki oyuncu","First turn":"İlk dönüş","Player 1 starts":"Oyuncu 1 başlıyor","Computer starts":"Bilgisayar başlatılıyor","Player 2 starts":"Oyuncu 2 başlar","New game":"Yeni oyun","Resume saved game":"Kaydedilen oyunu devam ettir","Delete saved game":"Kaydedilen oyunu sil","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Bir mod seçin ve oyuna başlayın.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16, 16 kurulu tarafından","Row {row}, column {column}":"Satır {row}, sütun {column}","Player 1":"Oyuncu 1","Player 2":"Oyuncu 2","Computer":"Bilgisayar","empty":"boş","Turn":"Dönüş","Pieces in opposite camp":"Karşı kamptaki parçalar","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Hedef: karşı köşedeki kampı doldurmak","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Sıra sizde: Taşlarınızdan birini seçin, ardından bitişikteki boş kareyi veya atlamayı seçin.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Parça seçildi. Kullanılabilir bir kare seçin.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Başka bir atlama mevcut. Atlamaya devam edin veya dönüşü sonlandırın.","End jump chain":"Atlama zincirinin sonu","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Bilgisayar yasal bir hamleyi seçiyor…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Cihazı bir sonraki oyuncuya aktarın.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Karşı kampı doldurdun ve kazandın!","Player 1 wins!":"Oyuncu 1 kazandı!","Player 2 wins!":"Oyuncu 2 kazandı!","The computer wins.":"Bilgisayar kazanır.","The game is a draw.":"Oyun berabere biter.","New game started.":"Yeni oyun başladı.","Game saved on this device.":"Oyun bu cihaza kaydedildi.","Saved game resumed.":"Kaydedilen oyun devam ettirildi.","Saved game deleted.":"Kayıtlı oyun silindi.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Bu tarayıcı yerel olarak kaydedemiyor. Bu sayfa açık kaldığı sürece oynamaya devam edebilirsiniz.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Kaydedilen oyun okunamadı. Yeni bir oyun başlatın veya hasarlı kaydı silin.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Bu hareket yasal değil. Boş bir kare seçin ve vurgulanan atlama zincirini takip edin.","Rules reference":"Kural referansı","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Standart iki oyunculu Halma kuralları"},"uk":{"Halma":"Халма","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma Online — безкоштовна настільна гра 16×16 із ланцюжками для стрибків","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Грайте в класичну гру Halma для двох гравців онлайн безкоштовно. Переміщуйте фігури 19 по дошці 16×16 кроками у восьми напрямках і ланцюжковими стрибками; грати на локальному комп'ютері або передавати і грати.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Бедьте всі 19 своїх фігур у табір протилежного кута. Зробіть крок на один квадрат або перестрибніть через будь-яку фігуру, а потім ланцюжком перестрибніть більше за той самий хід. Фішки, які перескочили, залишаються на дошці.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Безкоштовна гра. Дошка та збережена гра залишаються в цьому браузері на цьому пристрої; дані гри не завантажуються.","Play Halma":"Грати в Halma","How a jump chain works":"Як працює стрибковий ланцюг","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Фігура може перестрибнути через сусідню зайняту клітинку на порожню клітинку безпосередньо за нею. Після приземлення він може знову стрибнути в іншому напрямку. Частини, через які він перестрибнув, ніколи не захоплюються.","How to play":"Як грати","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"На цій сторінці використовується стандартний варіант квадратної дошки для двох гравців: сітка 16×16 і фігури 19 у кожному з двох протилежних кутових таборів. Під час ходу перемістіть одну фігуру на сусіднє порожнє поле в будь-якому з восьми напрямків або зробіть один або кілька послідовних стрибків з тією самою фігурою. Ви можете зупинити ланцюг стрибків на будь-якій посадці. Крок і стрибок не можна поєднувати в одному ході. Заповніть кожен квадрат у протилежному таборі, щоб виграти.","Frequently asked questions":"Часті запитання","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Чи стрибки захоплюють фігури?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"№ Під час стрибка ваша фігура лише пересувається над сусідньою. Фішка, яку перестрибнули, залишається там, де вона є, незалежно від того, чи належить вона вам чи іншому гравцеві.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Чи можу я зробити більше одного стрибка за хід?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Так. Продовжуйте ту саму фігуру над іншою сусідньою частиною в порожній квадрат. Ви можете завершити ланцюжок після будь-якого приземлення.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Чи можу я зробити крок, а потім стрибнути за один поворот?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"№ Поворот — це або один сусідній крок, або один ланцюжок стрибків. Їх не можна поєднувати.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Чи може фігура залишити протилежний табір після входу?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"№ Ця версія зберігає фігуру в таборі призначення супротивника, коли вона входить.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Чи є у Халми комп’ютерний опонент?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Так. Виберіть локальний комп’ютер або передайте той самий пристрій двом людям. Комп’ютер робить простий допустимий рух на цьому пристрої; це не багатокористувацький онлайн.","Rules and limitations":"Правила та обмеження","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Комп’ютерний суперник використовує легку евристику локального прогресу, а не глибокий пошук або ідеальну гру. Це квадратна настільна гра для двох гравців 16×16, а не китайські шашки у формі зірки. Три повторювані позиції або запобіжний ковпачок 400 з поворотом розглядаються як розіграш у цій версії.","Related tools":"Пов’язані інструменти","Game mode":"Режим гри","Play against the computer":"Грати проти комп'ютера","Two players on this device":"Два гравці на цьому пристрої","First turn":"Перша черга","Player 1 starts":"Запускається гравець 1","Computer starts":"Комп’ютер запускається","Player 2 starts":"Запускається гравець 2","New game":"Нова гра","Resume saved game":"Відновити збережену гру","Delete saved game":"Видалити збережену гру","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Виберіть режим і почніть гру.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Плата Halma 16 від 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Рядок {row}, стовпець {column}","Player 1":"Гравець 1","Player 2":"Гравець 2","Computer":"комп'ютер","empty":"порожній","Turn":"Поворот","Pieces in opposite camp":"Фігури в протилежному таборі","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Мета: заповнити табір протилежного кута","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Ваша черга: виберіть одну зі своїх фігур, а потім сусіднє порожнє поле або стрибок.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Вибраний фрагмент. Виберіть доступний квадрат.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Доступний інший стрибок. Продовжуйте стрибати або закінчіть поворот.","End jump chain":"Кінцевий стрибковий ланцюг","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Комп’ютер обирає законний хід…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Передайте пристрій наступному гравцеві.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Ви поповнили протилежний табір і перемогли!","Player 1 wins!":"Гравець 1 переміг!","Player 2 wins!":"Гравець 2 переміг!","The computer wins.":"Комп’ютер перемагає.","The game is a draw.":"Гра нічия.","New game started.":"Розпочато нову гру.","Game saved on this device.":"Гра збережена на цьому пристрої.","Saved game resumed.":"Збережену гру відновлено.","Saved game deleted.":"Збережену гру видалено.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Цей браузер не може зберігати локально. Ви можете продовжувати грати, поки ця сторінка залишається відкритою.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Не вдалося прочитати збережену гру. Почніть нову гру або видаліть пошкоджене збереження.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Це переміщення не є законним. Виберіть порожній квадрат і дотримуйтеся виділеного ланцюжка переходів.","Rules reference":"Посилання на правила","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Стандартні правила Halma для двох гравців"},"ur":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma آن لائن - مفت 16×16 بورڈ گیم جمپ چینز کے ساتھ","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"کلاسک ٹو پلیئر حلما مفت میں آن لائن کھیلیں۔ 19 ٹکڑوں کو 16×16 بورڈ پر آٹھ سمت والے قدموں اور زنجیروں والی چھلانگوں کے ساتھ منتقل کریں۔ مقامی کمپیوٹر یا پاس اینڈ پلے چلائیں۔","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"اپنے تمام 19 کو مخالف کونے والے کیمپ میں دوڑائیں۔ ایک چوکور قدم رکھیں یا کسی بھی ٹکڑے پر ہاپ کریں، پھر اسی موڑ میں مزید ہاپس کی زنجیر لگائیں۔ چھلانگ لگنے والے ٹکڑے بورڈ پر رہتے ہیں۔","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"کھیلنے کے لیے مفت۔ بورڈ اور محفوظ کردہ گیم اس ڈیوائس پر اس براؤزر میں رہتے ہیں۔ کوئی گیم ڈیٹا اپ لوڈ نہیں کیا گیا ہے۔","Play Halma":"Halma کھیلیں","How a jump chain works":"جمپ چین کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"ایک ٹکڑا ملحقہ زیر قبضہ مربع پر براہ راست اس سے آگے خالی مربع میں جا سکتا ہے۔ لینڈنگ کے بعد، یہ دوبارہ کسی اور سمت میں جا سکتا ہے۔ اس نے جن ٹکڑوں پر چھلانگ لگائی وہ کبھی پکڑے نہیں جاتے۔","How to play":"کیسے کھیلنا ہے۔","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"یہ صفحہ معیاری دو پلیئر اسکوائر بورڈ ویرینٹ کا استعمال کرتا ہے: ایک 16×16 گرڈ اور 19 دو مخالف کونے والے کیمپوں میں سے ہر ایک میں۔ ایک موڑ پر، آٹھ سمتوں میں سے کسی ایک ملحقہ خالی چوک میں ایک ٹکڑا منتقل کریں، یا اسی ٹکڑے کے ساتھ ایک یا زیادہ مسلسل ہاپس بنائیں۔ آپ کسی بھی لینڈنگ پر ہاپ چین کو روک سکتے ہیں۔ ایک قدم اور ہاپ کو ایک موڑ میں نہیں ملایا جا سکتا۔ جیتنے کے لیے مخالف کیمپ میں ہر مربع کو بھریں۔","Frequently asked questions":"اکثر پوچھے گئے سوالات","Do jumps capture pieces?":"کیا چھلانگیں ٹکڑوں کو پکڑتی ہیں؟","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"نہیں، ایک چھلانگ صرف آپ کے ٹکڑے کو ملحقہ ٹکڑے پر منتقل کرتی ہے۔ چھلانگ لگانے والا ٹکڑا جہاں ہے وہیں رہتا ہے، چاہے وہ آپ کا ہو یا دوسرے کھلاڑی کا۔","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"کیا میں ایک موڑ میں ایک سے زیادہ چھلانگ لگا سکتا ہوں؟","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"جی ہاں اسی ٹکڑے کے ساتھ دوسرے ملحقہ ٹکڑے پر خالی مربع میں جاری رکھیں۔ آپ کسی بھی لینڈنگ کے بعد سلسلہ ختم کر سکتے ہیں۔","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"کیا میں قدم رکھ سکتا ہوں اور پھر ایک ہی موڑ میں چھلانگ لگا سکتا ہوں؟","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"نہیں، موڑ یا تو ایک ملحقہ قدم ہے یا ایک جمپ چین۔ ان کو اکٹھا نہیں کیا جا سکتا۔","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"کیا کوئی ٹکڑا داخل ہونے کے بعد مخالف کیمپ کو چھوڑ سکتا ہے؟","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"نہیں، یہ ورژن حریف کے منزل کے کیمپ میں داخل ہونے کے بعد ایک ٹکڑا رکھتا ہے۔","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"کیا حلمہ کا کمپیوٹر مخالف ہے؟","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"جی ہاں مقامی کمپیوٹر کا انتخاب کریں یا ایک ہی ڈیوائس کو دو لوگوں کے درمیان پاس کریں۔ کمپیوٹر اس ڈیوائس پر ایک سادہ قانونی اقدام کرتا ہے۔ یہ آن لائن ملٹی پلیئر نہیں ہے۔","Rules and limitations":"قوانین اور حدود","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"کمپیوٹر کا مخالف ہلکا پھلکا مقامی پیش رفت کا اندازہ لگاتا ہے، گہری تلاش یا کامل کھیل کا نہیں۔ یہ دو کھلاڑیوں کا 16×16 مربع بورڈ گیم ہے، نہ کہ ستارے کے سائز کے چینی چیکرس۔ اس ورژن میں تین بار بار پوزیشنز یا 400 ٹرن سیفٹی کیپ کو قرعہ اندازی کے طور پر سمجھا جاتا ہے۔","Related tools":"متعلقہ اوزار","Game mode":"گیم موڈ","Play against the computer":"کمپیوٹر کے خلاف کھیلیں","Two players on this device":"اس ڈیوائس پر دو کھلاڑی","First turn":"پہلا موڑ","Player 1 starts":"پلیئر 1 شروع ہوتا ہے۔","Computer starts":"کمپیوٹر شروع ہوتا ہے۔","Player 2 starts":"پلیئر 2 شروع ہوتا ہے۔","New game":"نیا گیم","Resume saved game":"محفوظ کردہ گیم دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","Delete saved game":"محفوظ کردہ گیم کو حذف کریں۔","Choose a mode and start a game.":"ایک موڈ کا انتخاب کریں اور ایک گیم شروع کریں۔","Halma 16 by 16 board":"حلما 16 بذریعہ 16 بورڈ","Row {row}, column {column}":"قطار {row}، کالم {column}","Player 1":"پلیئر 1","Player 2":"پلیئر 2","Computer":"کمپیوٹر","empty":"خالی","Turn":"ٹرن","Pieces in opposite camp":"مخالف کیمپ میں ٹکڑے","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"مقصد: مخالف کونے والے کیمپ کو پُر کریں۔","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"آپ کی باری: اپنے ٹکڑوں میں سے ایک کا انتخاب کریں، پھر ملحقہ خالی مربع یا چھلانگ لگائیں۔","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"ٹکڑا منتخب کیا گیا۔ دستیاب مربع کا انتخاب کریں۔","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"ایک اور ہاپ دستیاب ہے۔ چھلانگ لگانا جاری رکھیں یا موڑ ختم کریں۔","End jump chain":"End جمپ چین","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"کمپیوٹر ایک قانونی اقدام کا انتخاب کر رہا ہے…","Pass the device to the next player.":"آلہ کو اگلے پلیئر تک منتقل کریں۔","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"آپ نے مخالف کیمپ بھرا اور جیت لیا!","Player 1 wins!":"کھلاڑی 1 جیت گیا!","Player 2 wins!":"کھلاڑی 2 جیت گیا!","The computer wins.":"کمپیوٹر جیت گیا۔","The game is a draw.":"گیم ڈرا ہے۔","New game started.":"نئی گیم شروع ہوگئی۔","Game saved on this device.":"گیم اس ڈیوائس پر محفوظ کیا گیا۔","Saved game resumed.":"محفوظ کردہ گیم دوبارہ شروع ہو گئی۔","Saved game deleted.":"محفوظ کردہ گیم حذف کر دی گئی۔","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"یہ براؤزر مقامی طور پر محفوظ نہیں کر سکتا۔ یہ صفحہ کھلا رہنے تک آپ کھیل جاری رکھ سکتے ہیں۔","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"محفوظ کردہ گیم کو پڑھا نہیں جا سکا۔ ایک نیا گیم شروع کریں یا تباہ شدہ محفوظ کو حذف کریں۔","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"یہ اقدام قانونی نہیں ہے۔ ایک خالی مربع کا انتخاب کریں اور نمایاں جمپ چین کی پیروی کریں۔","Rules reference":"قواعد کا حوالہ","Standard two-player Halma rules":"معیاری دو کھلاڑیوں کے حلما کے اصول"},"vi":{"Halma":"Halma","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"Halma trực tuyến — Trò chơi bảng 16×16 miễn phí với Chuỗi Nhảy","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"Chơi trực tuyến Halma hai người chơi cổ điển miễn phí. Di chuyển các quân 19 qua bảng 16×16 với các bước tám hướng và các bước nhảy theo chuỗi; chơi trên máy tính cục bộ hoặc truyền và chơi.","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"Đua tất cả 19 quân cờ của bạn vào trại ở góc đối diện. Bước một hình vuông hoặc nhảy qua bất kỳ mảnh nào, sau đó nối thêm nhiều bước nhảy trong cùng một lượt. Các quân cờ đã nhảy vẫn ở trên bảng.","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Chơi miễn phí. Bảng và trò chơi đã lưu vẫn ở trong trình duyệt này trên thiết bị này; không có dữ liệu trò chơi được tải lên.","Play Halma":"Chơi Halma","How a jump chain works":"Cách chuỗi nhảy hoạt động","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"Một quân cờ có thể nhảy qua một ô bị chiếm liền kề vào ô trống ngay bên ngoài nó. Sau khi hạ cánh, nó có thể lại nhảy sang hướng khác. Những mảnh nó nhảy qua không bao giờ bị bắt.","How to play":"Cách chơi","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"Trang này sử dụng biến thể bàn vuông tiêu chuẩn dành cho hai người chơi: lưới 16×16 và các quân 19 ở mỗi trong số hai phe góc đối diện. Trong một lượt, di chuyển một quân cờ đến một ô trống liền kề theo bất kỳ hướng nào trong tám hướng hoặc thực hiện một hoặc nhiều bước nhảy liên tiếp với cùng quân cờ đó. Bạn có thể dừng chuỗi nhảy ở bất kỳ điểm dừng nào. Một bước và một bước nhảy không thể kết hợp trong một lượt. Hãy lấp đầy mọi ô vuông ở trại đối diện để giành chiến thắng.","Frequently asked questions":"Câu hỏi thường gặp","Do jumps capture pieces?":"Các bước nhảy có bắt được mảnh ghép không?","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"Không. Một bước nhảy chỉ di chuyển quân của bạn qua quân liền kề. Quân cờ nhảy qua vẫn giữ nguyên vị trí cũ, cho dù nó thuộc về bạn hay của người chơi khác.","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"Tôi có thể nhảy nhiều lần trong một lượt không?","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"Có. Tiếp tục với mảnh tương tự trên một mảnh liền kề khác thành một hình vuông trống. Bạn có thể kết thúc chuỗi sau bất kỳ lần hạ cánh nào.","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"Tôi có thể bước rồi nhảy một lượt không?","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"Không. Một lượt là một bước liền kề hoặc một chuỗi nhảy. Chúng không thể được kết hợp.","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"Một quân có thể rời trại đối diện sau khi đã vào không?","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"Không. Phiên bản này giữ một quân cờ bên trong trại đích của đối thủ khi nó tiến vào.","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"Halma có đối thủ máy tính không?","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"Có. Chọn máy tính cục bộ hoặc chuyển cùng một thiết bị giữa hai người. Máy tính thực hiện một hành động hợp pháp đơn giản trên thiết bị này; nó không phải là nhiều người chơi trực tuyến.","Rules and limitations":"Quy tắc và giới hạn","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"Đối thủ máy tính sử dụng phương pháp phỏng đoán tiến trình cục bộ nhẹ, không phải tìm kiếm sâu hoặc chơi hoàn hảo. Đây là trò chơi bàn cờ vuông 16×16 dành cho hai người chơi, không phải cờ đam Trung Quốc hình ngôi sao. Ba vị trí lặp lại hoặc nắp an toàn quay đầu 400 được coi là một điểm hòa trong phiên bản này.","Related tools":"Các công cụ liên quan","Game mode":"Chế độ trò chơi","Play against the computer":"Chơi với máy tính","Two players on this device":"Hai người chơi trên thiết bị này","First turn":"Lượt đầu tiên","Player 1 starts":"Người chơi 1 bắt đầu","Computer starts":"Máy tính khởi động","Player 2 starts":"Người chơi 2 bắt đầu","New game":"Trò chơi mới","Resume saved game":"Tiếp tục trò chơi đã lưu","Delete saved game":"Xóa trò chơi đã lưu","Choose a mode and start a game.":"Chọn một chế độ và bắt đầu trò chơi.","Halma 16 by 16 board":"Halma 16 bởi bảng 16","Row {row}, column {column}":"Hàng {row}, cột {column}","Player 1":"Người chơi 1","Player 2":"Người chơi 2","Computer":"Máy tính","empty":"trống","Turn":"Quay","Pieces in opposite camp":"Mảnh ở trại đối diện","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"Mục tiêu: lấp đầy trại góc đối diện","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"Lượt của bạn: chọn một trong các quân cờ của bạn, sau đó chọn một ô trống liền kề hoặc nhảy.","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"Mảnh được chọn. Chọn một hình vuông có sẵn.","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"Có một bước nhảy khác. Tiếp tục nhảy hoặc kết thúc lượt.","End jump chain":"Chuỗi nhảy cuối","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"Máy tính đang chọn nước đi hợp pháp…","Pass the device to the next player.":"Chuyển thiết bị cho người chơi tiếp theo.","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"Bạn đã lấp đầy trại đối diện và giành chiến thắng!","Player 1 wins!":"Người chơi 1 chiến thắng!","Player 2 wins!":"Người chơi 2 chiến thắng!","The computer wins.":"Máy tính thắng.","The game is a draw.":"Trận đấu hòa.","New game started.":"Trò chơi mới bắt đầu.","Game saved on this device.":"Trò chơi đã được lưu trên thiết bị này.","Saved game resumed.":"Trò chơi đã lưu được tiếp tục.","Saved game deleted.":"Đã xóa trò chơi đã lưu.","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Trình duyệt này không thể lưu cục bộ. Bạn có thể tiếp tục chơi trong khi trang này vẫn mở.","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Không thể đọc được trò chơi đã lưu. Bắt đầu một trò chơi mới hoặc xóa bản lưu bị hỏng.","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"Động thái đó là không hợp pháp. Chọn một hình vuông trống và đi theo chuỗi nhảy được đánh dấu.","Rules reference":"Tham khảo quy tắc","Standard two-player Halma rules":"Luật Halma tiêu chuẩn dành cho hai người chơi"},"zh":{"Halma":"豪迈","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"豪迈在线 — 免费 16×16 带跳链的棋盘游戏","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"免费在线玩经典的两人游戏 Halma。通过八向步骤和连锁跳跃在 16×16 棋盘上移动 19 棋子；玩本地计算机或传递并玩。","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"将所有 19 颗棋子竞赛到对面的角落营地。跨过一个方格或跳过任何棋子，然后在同一回合中连续跳跃更多。跳跃的棋子留在棋盘上。","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"免费玩。棋盘和保存的游戏保留在此设备上的浏览器中；没有上传游戏数据。","Play Halma":"玩豪迈","How a jump chain works":"跳链的工作原理","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"棋子可以跳过相邻的已占据的方格，进入其正上方的空方格。着陆后，它可能会再次向另一个方向跳跃。它跳过的棋子永远不会被捕获。","How to play":"怎么玩","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"此页面使用标准的两人方棋盘变体：16×16 网格和 19 棋子位于两个相对的角落营地中。在一回合中，将一个棋子沿八个方向中的任意一个方向移动到相邻的空方格，或者使用同一棋子进行一次或多次连续跳跃。您可以在任何平台停止跳跃链。一步和跳跃不能合并在一个回合中。填满对面阵营的每个方格即可获胜。","Frequently asked questions":"常见问题解答","Do jumps capture pieces?":"跳跃会吃掉棋子吗？","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"编号跳跃只会将您的棋子移动到相邻棋子之上。跳过的棋子会留在原处，无论它是属于你还是其他玩家。","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"我可以在一个回合中进行多次跳跃吗？","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"是的。继续将同一块放在另一个相邻块上，放入一个空方块中。您可以在任何着陆后结束链条。","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"我可以先迈步再跳一回合吗？","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"编号一轮要么是一个相邻的步骤，要么是一个跳跃链。它们不能合并。","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"棋子进入后能否离开对方阵营？","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"编号此版本一旦进入对手的目的地营地，就会将棋子保留在对手的目的地营地内。","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"豪迈有电脑对手吗？","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"是的。选择本地计算机或在两个人之间传递同一设备。计算机在此设备上进行简单的合法移动；它不是在线多人游戏。","Rules and limitations":"规则和限制","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"计算机对手使用轻量级局部进度启发式，而不是深度搜索或完美发挥。这是两人棋盘游戏 16×16，不是星形跳棋。在此版本中，三个重复位置或 400 旋转安全帽被视为平局。","Related tools":"相关工具","Game mode":"游戏模式","Play against the computer":"与电脑对战","Two players on this device":"此设备上有两名玩家","First turn":"第一转","Player 1 starts":"播放器 1 启动","Computer starts":"计算机启动","Player 2 starts":"播放器 2 启动","New game":"新游戏","Resume saved game":"恢复保存的游戏","Delete saved game":"删除已保存的游戏","Choose a mode and start a game.":"选择一种模式并开始游戏。","Halma 16 by 16 board":"豪迈 16 by 16 板","Row {row}, column {column}":"行 {row}，列 {column}","Player 1":"玩家 1","Player 2":"玩家 2","Computer":"电脑","empty":"空","Turn":"转","Pieces in opposite camp":"对面阵营的棋子","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"目标：补满对角营地","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"你的回合：选择你的一个棋子，然后选择一个相邻的空方块或一个跳跃。","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"已选择。选择一个可用的正方形。","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"另一个跃点可用。继续跳跃或结束转弯。","End jump chain":"末端跳链","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"计算机正在选择合法的举动……","Pass the device to the next player.":"将设备传递给下一个玩家。","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"你填补了对面阵营并获胜！","Player 1 wins!":"玩家 1 获胜！","Player 2 wins!":"玩家 2 获胜！","The computer wins.":"计算机获胜。","The game is a draw.":"比赛平局。","New game started.":"新游戏开始了。","Game saved on this device.":"游戏已保存在此设备上。","Saved game resumed.":"保存的游戏已恢复。","Saved game deleted.":"已保存的游戏已删除。","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"此浏览器无法在本地保存。当此页面保持打开状态时，您可以继续玩游戏。","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"无法读取已保存的游戏。开始新游戏或删除损坏的保存。","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"此举不合法。选择一个空方块并遵循突出显示的跳跃链。","Rules reference":"规则参考","Standard two-player Halma rules":"标准两人 Halma 规则"},"zh_tw":{"Halma":"豪邁","Halma Online — Free 16×16 Board Game with Jump Chains":"豪邁在線 — 免費 16×16 帶跳鏈的棋盤遊戲","Play classic two-player Halma online for free. Move 19 pieces across a 16×16 board with eight-direction steps and chained jumps; play a local computer or pass-and-play.":"免費在線玩經典的雙人遊戲 Halma。透過八向步驟和連鎖跳躍在 16×16 棋盤上移動 19 棋子；玩本地計算機或傳遞並玩。","Race all 19 of your pieces into the opposite corner camp. Step one square or hop over any piece, then chain more hops in the same turn. Jumped pieces stay on the board.":"將所有 19 顆棋子競賽到對面的角落營地。跨過一個方格或跳過任何棋子，然後在同一回合中連續跳躍更多。跳躍的棋子留在棋盤上。","Free to play. The board and saved game stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"免費玩。棋盤和保存的遊戲保留在此裝置上的瀏覽器中；沒有上傳遊戲資料。","Play Halma":"玩豪邁","How a jump chain works":"跳鏈的工作原理","A piece can hop over an adjacent occupied square into the empty square directly beyond it. After landing, it may hop again in another direction. The pieces it jumped over are never captured.":"棋子可以跳過相鄰的已佔據的方格，進入其正上方的空方格。著陸後，它可能會再次向另一個方向跳躍。它跳過的棋子永遠不會被捕獲。","How to play":"怎麼玩","This page uses the standard two-player square-board variant: a 16×16 grid and 19 pieces in each of two opposite corner camps. On a turn, move one piece to an adjacent empty square in any of eight directions, or make one or more consecutive hops with that same piece. You may stop a hop chain at any landing. A step and a hop cannot be combined in one turn. Fill every square in the opposite camp to win.":"此頁面使用標準的兩人方棋盤變體：16×16 網格和 19 棋子位於兩個相對的角落營地中。在一回合中，將一個棋子沿著八個方向中的任何一個方向移動到相鄰的空方格，或使用同一棋子進行一次或多次連續跳躍。您可以在任何平台停止跳躍鏈。一步和跳躍不能合併在一個回合。填滿對面陣營的每個方格即可獲勝。","Frequently asked questions":"常見問題解答","Do jumps capture pieces?":"跳躍會吃掉棋子嗎？","No. A jump only moves your piece over an adjacent piece. The piece jumped over stays where it is, whether it belongs to you or the other player.":"編號跳躍只會將您的棋子移到相鄰棋子之上。跳過的棋子會留在原處，無論它是屬於你還是其他玩家。","Can I make more than one jump in a turn?":"我可以在一個回合中進行多次跳躍嗎？","Yes. Continue with the same piece over another adjacent piece into an empty square. You may end the chain after any landing.":"是的。繼續將同一塊放在另一個相鄰塊上，放入一個空方塊中。您可以在任何著陸後結束鏈條。","Can I step and then jump in one turn?":"我可以先邁步再跳一回合嗎？","No. A turn is either one adjacent step or one jump chain. They cannot be combined.":"編號一輪要不是相鄰的步驟，就是跳躍鏈。它們不能合併。","Can a piece leave the opposite camp after it enters?":"棋子進入後能否離開對方陣營？","No. This version keeps a piece inside the opponent’s destination camp once it enters.":"編號此版本一旦進入對手的目的地營地，就會將棋子保留在對手的目的地營地內。","Does Halma have a computer opponent?":"豪邁有電腦對手嗎？","Yes. Choose the local computer or pass the same device between two people. The computer makes a simple legal move on this device; it is not online multiplayer.":"是的。選擇本機電腦或在兩個人之間傳遞相同裝置。電腦在此裝置上進行簡單的合法移動；它不是線上多人遊戲。","Rules and limitations":"規則與限制","The computer opponent uses a lightweight local progress heuristic, not deep search or perfect play. This is the two-player 16×16 square-board game, not star-shaped Chinese Checkers. Three repeated positions or a 400-turn safety cap are treated as a draw in this version.":"電腦對手使用輕量級局部進度啟發式，而不是深度搜尋或完美發揮。這是雙人棋盤遊戲 16×16，不是星形跳棋。在此版本中，三個重複位置或 400 旋轉安全帽被視為平局。","Related tools":"相關工具","Game mode":"遊戲模式","Play against the computer":"與電腦對戰","Two players on this device":"此設備上有兩名玩家","First turn":"第一轉","Player 1 starts":"播放器 1 啟動","Computer starts":"電腦啟動","Player 2 starts":"播放器 2 啟動","New game":"新遊戲","Resume saved game":"恢復保存的遊戲","Delete saved game":"刪除已儲存的遊戲","Choose a mode and start a game.":"選擇一種模式並開始遊戲。","Halma 16 by 16 board":"豪邁 16 by 16 板","Row {row}, column {column}":"行 {row}，列 {column}","Player 1":"玩家 1","Player 2":"玩家 2","Computer":"電腦","empty":"空","Turn":"轉","Pieces in opposite camp":"對面陣營的棋子","Goal: fill the opposite corner camp":"目標：補滿對角線營地","Your turn: choose one of your pieces, then an adjacent empty square or a jump.":"你的回合：選擇你的一個棋子，然後選擇一個相鄰的空方塊或一個跳躍。","Piece selected. Choose an available square.":"已選擇。選擇一個可用的正方形。","Another hop is available. Continue jumping or end the turn.":"另一個躍點可用。繼續跳躍或結束轉彎。","End jump chain":"末端跳鏈","The computer is choosing a legal move…":"電腦正在選擇合法的舉動…","Pass the device to the next player.":"將設備傳遞給下一個玩家。","You filled the opposite camp and won!":"你填補了對面陣營並獲勝！","Player 1 wins!":"玩家 1 獲勝！","Player 2 wins!":"玩家 2 獲勝！","The computer wins.":"電腦獲勝。","The game is a draw.":"比賽平手。","New game started.":"新遊戲開始了。","Game saved on this device.":"遊戲已儲存在此裝置上。","Saved game resumed.":"已儲存的遊戲已恢復。","Saved game deleted.":"已儲存的遊戲已刪除。","This browser cannot save locally. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"此瀏覽器無法在本機儲存。當此頁面保持開啟時，您可以繼續玩遊戲。","The saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"無法讀取已儲存的遊戲。開始新遊戲或刪除損壞的保存。","That move is not legal. Choose an empty square and follow the highlighted jump chain.":"此舉不合法。選擇一個空方塊並遵循突出顯示的跳躍鏈。","Rules reference":"規則參考","Standard two-player Halma rules":"標準兩人 Halma 規則"}});
